<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">Luka - Matumbi Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Injili ya Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luka</para>
  <para style="mt2">Injili ya Yesu Mwaiandikilwe na Luka</para>
  <para style="imt">Kilongolyo sa Injili kati mwaiandikilwe na Luka</para>
  <para style="ip">Injili kati mwaiandikilwe na Luka, nga kitabu simo nkati ya itabu nsese ya Lilagano lya Ayambi', yaiawanikia maisa ga Yesu Kilisitu. Kwa kila simo kikemelwa “Injili” liyi'gi'yo lyalilombolya, “Abali Inannoga.” Ayi' nga itabu yaiandikilwe bu'ka po waa kwa Yesu, na yembe nga Matei, Maluko, Luka na Yoani. Luka aawanikiye bu'kana na maisa ga Yesu bai lili, ila aandike kai' bu'kana na makowe gabaapangite banamasi' ba Yesu bu'ka pa kiwo no yu'ka kwake. Kitabu so kikemelwa Makowe ga Atumilwe. Ntu'pu' ywatangite masu'ba gaiandikilwe Injili yo, wala pandu payaandilkilwe. Asomi baingi bayi'ki'tyana panga saandikilwe kunako myaka 70 bu'ka po belekwa kwa Yesu Kilisitu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mwandiki wake aai Luka, ywaabile nng'anga. Ilimu ya uandiki wake na mwaitumile luga ilaya panga aabile mundu mwene ilimu. Luka apalike andika maawanikio ga kakape bu'kana na maisa ga Yesu kwo yaulya kati mwagapitile li'nga bi'ngi' bapwailike pabasoma (Luka 1:1-3). Luka aabileli Nnyahudi (Akolosai 4:10-14), na aandike kwa sampuli ya kwapanga ata balu' bangali Ayahudi batange. Likowe li' libonekana mpu'la paawanikia mimu ya Kiyahudi (Luka 1:8).</para>
  <para style="ip">Injili kati mwaiandikilwe na Luka nga kitabu sakilandana na itabu ya Matei na Maluko, kwa mwanjaa ayi' itabu iyaulya makowe gagalu'galu' kwa ndi'la yailandana. Nkati ya itabu itatu yi' kitabu sa Luka kisake nga sakiyaulya kinkati muno abali yo belekwa kwa Yoani Ywabatisa. Luka akong'ondelya samya (3:3, 11:4, 17:3-4, 23:34) na malu'bo kai' (3:21, 5:16, 6:12, 11:1-12, 22:32).</para>
  <para style="iot">Mutasali</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Luka apiya kilongolyo sa Injili yake no awanikia kitumbu so andika <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Aawanikia abali yo belekwa kwa Yesu na mwaabi'kilwe wiso kwa kitumbu sa utumisi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 1:5-4:13">1:5-4:13</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Pandu paku'lu' muinjili yaiigala Luka aawanikia mengo gaapangite Yesu, muno mangelongelo gaapangite na makowe gaayi'ganiye <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 4:14-21:38">4:14-21:38</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Ayaulya mwawile Yesu no yu'ka kwake bu'ka kuuwi'li <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 22:-1-24">22-24</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Mundumuko Topili, bandu baingi bakasine andika bu'kana na makowe galu' gagaapangike paminyo gitu. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Bagaandike kati mwatubakiyilwe na balu' babaagabweni makowe go kagapangika bu'ka patumbu na babaalage Liyi'gi'yo lyo. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Nanenga bu'kana no pekeseni makowe goti bu'ka patumbu, niibweni nikwandiki wa mundumuko kwa kindonda, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />li'nga nawenga wiloli wamwene ukakape wa makowe galu' goyi'ganilwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilagano lyo belekwa kwa Yoani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Masu'ba ga Helode, nkulungwa wa Yudea, kwai na mpi'ndo wa dini ywakemelwage Zakalia, ywaabile mukipi'nga sa upi'ndo wa dini wa Abiya. Nnyumbowe akemelwage Elisabeti nembe aabile mukipi'nga sa lukolo lwa Aluni. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Boti abi'li' baai apeleteu kwa Nnu'ngu', batamage kwo bi'ngi'ya goti gaalagi Nnu'ngu' pangali bi'ki'lwa lukolo. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Lakini, baabile banapapali mwana mwanjaa, Elisabeti aai ntonga na boti abi'li' baai agoi muno. <figure style="fig" alt="Priest at altar of incense - Thompson GT00062" file="PriestAtAltarOfIncense_Luke1.5-11_GT00062.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Gordon Thompson © Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc., 2012." ref="1:7" /><verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Paliikite lisu'ba lyake lyo panga lyengo lya upi'ndo wa dini palua lwa nyumba ya Nnu'ngu', <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Zakalia asaulilwe na bandu kati mwaibile mimu yo yingya mu Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu' li'nga auye ubani. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Kipi'nga sa bandu saamesekine palua kabasali, ku'no Zakalia kauya ubani. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Amo nnyumba, ngampitya malaika wa Nnu'ngu' ywayi'mi kummalyo ga kibi'ki'lyo so ukiya ubani. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Paamweni, Zakalia aapatike ntenyo no yogopa. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Lakini malaika wa Nnu'ngu' ngammakia, “We wa Zakalia, kaneuyogope, mwanjaa gonnu'bite Nnu'ngu' akuyu'wine. Nnyumbogo Elisabeti alu'a kupapya mwana nnalu'me, na lina lyake wantine Yoani. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Waalu'a napusika muno na bandu baingi baapanga si'li'ku'si'li'ku' kwa kitumbu so belekwa kwake. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Alu'a panga wa mpu'ku'bi'la nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu'. Aalu'a lobyali wi'mbi' wowoti, aalu'a twi'li'yi'lwa Loo Mpeleteu bu'ka mundumbo ya mau' bake. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Aalu'a kwagalambwa bandu baingi ba Isilaili baamuyangani Nnu'ngu' wabe. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Aalu'a kunnongolya Bwana, ku'no kalongoyelwa na makakala ga Loo Mpeleteu kati nnondoli wa Nnu'ngu' Elia. Aalu'a kwaawana akinatati' na bana babe, na kwigalambwa myoyo ya kimbu'ku'su' babe na malango kati mwabapanga bandu ba Nnu'ngu', bu'kapo ammi'ki wiso Bwana bandu bake.” <verse eid="LUK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Zakalia ngammakia aywo malaika, “Kikowe saku' sakilu'a nipanga nenga niu'bi'li likowe li'? Nenga na nnyumbo wangu' twaboti tugoime.” <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Malaika ngannyangwa, “Nenga na Gabulieli, na malaika ywaniyi'ma nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu', nitumilwe nikubakiye Abali Inannoga. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Pi'kania, mwanjaa ukana u'bi'lya makowe ganikubakia ulu'a galambuka panga wa bubu, walongelali mpaka gano ganikubakiye gatimi.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Apo bandu baakibweni kyukala kwa mwanjaa Zakalia aasi'li'ye pitya palua lwa Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Paapiti panja, akombwili longela nabo. Yabonekine mpu'la kasabe Zakalia aagabweni makowe gayambi' mu Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu', mwanjaa ywembe alongelage kwo langyalangya na moko.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Paliyomwike lyengo lyake lyo yi'mi'li'ka mu Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu', aabuyangani kaya. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Bu'kapo, nnyumbowe Elisabeti ngayi'ma ndumbo, ngayu'ba kasake kwa myei mitano kabaya, <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />“Ago nga gaanipangi Nnu'ngu', anibi'ki kiya na kunibu'ki'ya oni yo kotoka beleka yanaabile nayo paminyo ga bandu.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 1:25">Lilagano lyo belekwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:25">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Angel visits Mary - DN00401" file="AngelVisitsMary_Luke1.26-38_DN00401.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Darwin Dunham © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="1:25" /> <verse eid="LUK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Pawikite mwei wa sita, malaika Gabulieli aatumilwe na Nnu'ngu' ayende kukilambo sakikemelwa Nasaleti, akwo ku Galilaya, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />kwa mwi'nja yumo ywangalikuntanga nnalu'me ywakemelwage Malia, aakobekilwe na Yusupu bu'ka mulukolo lwa Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Malaika ngannyendelya na kummakia, “Abali wenga wauyaliwite na Nnu'ngu', Nnu'ngu' abile pamope na wenga.”<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Malia paayu'wine makowe go, ngaumpata ntenyo, no tumbwa gania, “Makowe ga galombolya namani?” <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Malaika ngammakia, “Malia, kaneuyogope, nnyino Nnu'ngu' akupendile. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Ulu'a yi'ma ndumbo, waalu'a papa mwana nnalu'me, na lina lyake wantine Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Ywembe aalu'a panga mpi'ndo na aakemelwa Mwana wa Nnu'ngu' nku'lu'. Nnu'ngu' alu'a kumpeya kiti'gu' sa lenji bu'ka mulukolo lwa nkulungwa Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Kwa nyo, alu'a tawala lukolo lwa Yakobi milele na ukulungwa wake wayomokali.”<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Malia ngannyangwa, “Ago gapitya kwaku', nanenga nantangali nnalu'me?” <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Malaika ngannyangwa, “Aalu'a kuulukya Loo Mpeleteu, na uweso wa Nnu'ngu' Nku'lu' walu'a kwisilya kati kiwili. Kwa nyo, mwana ywaabelekwa alu'a kemelwa Mpeleteu Mwana wa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Kai' utange ata Elisabeti nnongogo, ywabammayage ntonga, ai na ndumbo ya myei sita ya mwana nnalu'me, naywembe nng'oi. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Kwa nyo, makowe goti apanga Nnu'ngu'.” <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Malia aabaite, “Nenga na mundu wa Nnu'ngu', nipangilwe kati mwobaike.” Payomwi yangwa nyo, yu'lu' malaika ngabu'ka.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 1:38">Malia antyangilya Elisabeti</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:38">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Mary and Elizabeth - Cook CN01609" file="Mary&amp;Elizabeth_Luke1.39-40_CN01609.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="1:38" /> <verse eid="LUK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Bu'ka pa masu'ba nsi'si', Malia aayabwi mwanja wa kiyu'ngu'ya mpaka kunni'ma waubile mwitu'mbi' ya ku Yudea. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Akwo, aayi'i kuntyangilya Elisabeti munyumba ya Zakalia. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Elisabeti paayu'wine lilobe lya Malia, mwana nnele mundumbo yake ngau'mbau'mba, nembe Elisabeti ngatwi'li'yi'lwa Loo Mpeleteu. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Ngalongela kwa lilobe liku'lu', “Utiyaliwa pi'ta alwawa boti, na ywolu'a kumpapa kwa ndumbo yobilenayo, ayaliwite. <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Mwanjaa namani makowe maku'lu' kati ga kumbitya ne, ata mau' bake Bwana wangu' baniisili? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Paniyu'wine lilobe lyako bai, kaunipanga abali, kaana kakabile nndumbo yangu' kaatiu'mbau'mba kwo pulaika muno. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Nantali wenga wauu'bi'li panga galu' gaakubakiye Nnu'ngu' galu'a pitya.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 1:45">Mwambo wa Malia kannumba Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:45">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Mary Praising God - Cook CN01610" file="MaryPraisingGod_Luke1.46-55_CN01610.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="1:45" /> <verse eid="LUK 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Malia ngabaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:46">“Mwoyo wangu' unnumba Nnu'ngu',<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />Na loo yangu' impulaikya Nnu'ngu', ywanikombwile.<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Kwa mwanjaa anninguli kwa liyo lya kiya, ntumisi wake ywa nnyu'wa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:48">Kwa nyo, bu'ka nambi'yambi' bandu boti balu'a nikema na ywayaliwite.<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' mwene makakala anipangi maku'lu',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:49">lina lyake lipeleteu.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Kwabi'kya kiya balu' bandu babamwisimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:50">lama bu'ka lubelekwo mpaka lubelekwo.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Apangite makowe maku'lu' kwa luboko lwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:51">Aasengemwaniye bene mpyata mumyoyo yabe.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Aulwiye bene makakala bu'ka muiti'gu' yabe ya lenji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:52">na kwakatuya aki'ba.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Ayukutiye manogau bene njala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:53">na kwabu'ya moko gabule bene mali.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Annyangatiye ntumisi wake Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:54">aku'mbu'ki kiya sake.<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />Kati mwaalagi api'ndo bitu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:55">Bulaimu na lubelekwo lwake mpaka milele.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Malia aatami na Elisabeti kwa myei itatu, no buyangania kasake. <verse eid="LUK 1:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Paikomile ndumbo yake, Elisabeti ngapapa mwana nnalu'me.<verse eid="LUK 1:57" /></para>
  <para style="s">Belekwa kwa Yoani Ywabatisage</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Alongobe na bandu, pabayu'wine makowe go panga Nnu'ngu' ami'kikiya muno, baanapusike pamope nakwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Paliikite lisu'ba lya nane, baatiisa li'nga kumwina mwana liku'mbi' na kuntina lina lya tati' bake Zakalia. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Mau' bake ngabakana, kababaya, “Nyinyo lili, mbala akemelwe Yoani.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Ngabammakia, “Mboni ntu'pu' mundu ywakemelwa lina lyo mulukolo lwinu?” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Bai, ngabannaluya Zakalia kwo langyalangya bapate tanga panga apala mwana wake akemelwe nyai. <figure style="fig" alt="Zechariah and Elizabeth with tablet - Cook CN01605" file="Zechariah&amp;Elizabeth_Luke1.63_CN01605.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="1:62" /> <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Nembe aalu'bite kibao so andika, aandike nnyanya, “Yoani nga lina lyake.” Boti baatisangala. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Popopo, nkano na lulimi lwa Zakalia ngaiyu'gu'li'lwa, ngalongela na kunnumba Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Alongobe baayingililwe na bwoga pabagabweni makowe go, gaayu'wanike kila pandu muitu'mbi' ya Yudea. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Boti babaagayu'wine makowe go, baatigania mumyoyo yabe ku'no kababaya, “Mwana yu' alu'a panga mundu gani?” Mwanjaa makakala ga Bwana gabile pamope nakwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwambo wa Zakalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Zakalia tati' bake mwana, ngabatwi'li'yi'lwa na Loo Mpeleteu, no piya kilondwo si'.<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Akwi'yi'lwe Bwana Nnu'ngu' wa Isilaili!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:68">Mwanjaa aatikwaisilya na kwakombwa bandu bake.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Atupei nkomboli wa kutukombwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:69">mmelekwa kwa lukolo lwa Daudi, ntumisi wa Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Mu'mu'lu'mu'lu' mwalongei bu'ka kwai'mbu',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:70">kwa ndi'la ya alondoli bake apeleteu,<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />panga alu'a kutukombwa mmoko ga andumu bitu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:71">no bu'ka mumaboko ga boti babatusukwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Aabaite alu'a kwabi'kya kiya api'ndo bitu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:72">no ku'mbu'kya lilagano lyake lipeleteu.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Aalapi au'ku' bitu Bulaimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:73">panga aalu'a tuyalya twenga.<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />Panga aatulagi kutukosopolya bu'ka mmoko ga andumu bitu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:74">tupate tumika pangali yogopa.<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />Kanetulemale myoyo na tubonekane twapeleteu nnu'ngi' yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:75">masu'ba goti ga bwu'mi witu.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Nawenga wa mwana wangu' walu'a kemelwa wa nnondoli wa Nnu'ngu' nku'lu',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">waalu'a kunnongolya Bwana, kumpetulya ndi'la yake,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />Wabakiye bandu bake panga alu'a kwakosopolya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:77">kwo bu'yi'lwa masambi gabe.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Kwa kiya kiku'lu' sa Nnu'ngu' witu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:78">Atuumukulya bweya bu'ka kunani.<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />Na kwamulikya boti babatama mulubi'ndu' na kiwili sa kiwo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:79">alongoye nganjo yitu mundi'la ya amani.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Mwana aatiku'la, no pata makakala ga mumwoyo. Aatami mulupu'ngu'ti' mpaka paisi boneka paminyo ga bandu ba Isilaili.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Belekwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus (baby) and Joseph and mary in stable - Cook CN01617" file="Jesus(Baby)&amp;Joseph&amp;MaryInStable_CN01617.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="2:0" /> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Masu'ba galu' nkulungwa wa Kiroma ywakemelwage Agusito aoniye lilu'nga kwapala bandu boti panni'ma babalangilwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Awo ngawai ntumbwo wo balangilwa bandu, masu'ba go Kulenio aai mpi'ndo wa nkoa wa Silia. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Bandu boti baayi'i balangilwa, kila mundu pakilambo sake saabelekulile.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Yusupu nembe aayabwi mwanja bu'ka kukilambo sa Nasaleti kuwilaya ya Galilaya li'nga akabalangilwe. Mwanjaa ywembe aabile mulukolo lwa Daudi, aayi'i kukilambo sa Betelehemu, kunkoa wa Yudea kwaabelekuli nkulungwa Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Aayi'i balangilwa pamope na Malia nnwawa ywankobekage, naywembe pamasu'ba go aai ntopelwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Pabaabile kwo, ngaliika lisu'ba lyake lyo komboka. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Ngakomboka mwana nnalu'me mmele wake, anng'walike tugu'bo twa kyana na kunng'onjeka mukili'lyo sa ng'ombe mwanjaa baapatikeli pogonjo, nyumba ya ageni yai yatwi'la.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asungi na Malaika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Shepherds" file="02 Shepherds.jpg" size="col" ref="2:8">Asungi</figure>Pandu po paabile na asungi ba ngondolo, babakelekage kilo mumakwabo li'ndi'la myugo yabe. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Malaika wa Bwana ngaapitya kwa kiimuimu, na bweya wa utukupu wa Bwana ngawamulikya pu'pu'lu'. Baatiyogopa muno. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Malaika ngaabakia, “Kanemuyogope! Ninnetyangite Abali Inannoga yo napusika muno, yailu'a kwapata bandu boti. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Mwanjaa li'no pansengo wa Daudi abelikwe Nkosopoli, abelikwe kwa kitumbu sinu mwenga nga Kilisitu Bwana. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Na wu'no walu'a panga mwasu kasinu, panga mukankwemba mwana kilekeleke banng'walike ngu'bo ya kyana banng'onjike mukili'lyo sa ng'ombe.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Popopo lipi'nga lya malaika ba kunani ngalilu'mbana na aywo malaika kabannumba Nnu'ngu' kababaya,<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Utukupu kwa Nnu'ngu' kunani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:14">na amani padunia kwa bandu baapendi ywembe.”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Bu'ka pabaabu'i abo malaika buyangania kunani, asungi ngababakiana, “Tuyende nswaa mpaka ku Betelehemu tukalibone likowe li' lyatubakiye Bwana.” <figure style="fig" alt="Shepherds in Stable with Jesus - Cook CN01625" file="ShepherdsInStableWithJesus&amp;Joseph&amp;Mary_Luke2.16_CN01625.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="2:15" /><verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Bai, baayi'i kwo talima, ngabaakwemba Malia, Yusupu, na yu'lu' mwana kilekeleke banng'onjike mukili'lyo sa ng'ombe. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Abo asungi pabaamweni mwana ywo, ngabaabakia bandu boti makowe gabagayu'wine bu'kana na aywo mwana. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Boti pabayu'wine go, baatisangala bu'kana na makowe gababakiyilwe na asungi. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Lakini Malia aagabi'i mumwoyo wake goti no gania. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Balu' asungi, baabuyangani kasabe ku'no kabankwi'ya Nnu'ngu' no lumba uku'lu' wake kwa goti gabaagayu'wine na kugabona, gabi kati mwabaabakiyilwe.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana atinilwa lina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Pagapite masu'ba manane bu'ka belekwa, lisu'ba lya kumwina liku'mbi' mwana, bantinike lina lyake Yesu. Lina lyo aatinilwe na malaika kubile balo ata yi'ma ndumbo ya mwana we.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abi'ki'lwa nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Pagaikite masu'ba go peleteyelwa Yusupu na Malia kati mwaipalilwage na salya ya Musa, abelei bo bampu'twi mwana no yenda nakwe ku Yelusalemu li'nga bampiye kwa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Musalya ya Bwana Nnu'ngu' iandikilwe, “Kila mwana mmele nnalu'me abaulilwe kwa Bwana.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Kai', baayi'i li'nga bapiye salaka <char style="qt">ngunda abi'li' au mabunda gabi'li' ga ngunda, </char> kati mwaipalikwage musalya ya Bwana. <figure style="fig" alt="Simeon Blessing Jesus in temple - Wade WA03805" file="SimeonBlessingJesus_Luke2.25-35_WA03805.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="2:24" /><verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Pamasu'ba go akwo Yelusalemu, kwai na mundu yumo mwene aki na ywankilikitya Nnu'ngu' lina lyake akemelwage Simioni, ywembe ali'ndage kwa kilu'lu' kosopolelwa kwa Isilaili. Loo Mpeleteu aabile pamope nakwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Loo Mpeleteu aamumukuli panga kiwo kinkolyali pangali kummona Kilisitu wa Bwana, Nkulungwa ywalondolilwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Bai, kalongoyelwa na Loo Mpeleteu, Simioni aayingi mulua lwa Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu'. Abelei ba Yesu pabannetike mwana wabe mulua lwa Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu', bampangi kati mwaipalikwage na salya, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simioni aampoki mwana Yesu mumaboko gake ku'no kankwi'ya Nnu'ngu', kabaya,<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Nambi'yambi' Bwana utimisike malagano gako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:29">unnyi'ki'ti'ye ntumisi wako ayende kwa amani.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Mwanjaa kwa minyo gangu' niubweni ukosopoli wauuletike<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />waubi'i wiso ubonekane na mili'ma yoti.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Bweya wawaalu'a kwamulikya bandu ba panja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:32">na utukupu kwa bandu bako Isilaili.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Tati' na mau' bake Yesu baatisangala kwa makowe gaalongei Simioni kwa abali ya mwana. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Simioni aatikwayalya, ammakiye Malia mau' bake, “Mwana yu' alu'a panga kitumbu so oba no kosopolelwa kwa bandu baingi mu Isilaili. Nembe alu'a panga kati mwasu wo kanilwa na bandu, <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />li'nga gabagania bandu baingi kwo iya gaumukulwe. Na wenga wamwene, lwu'ngu' lwalubile kati lipanga linola lwalu'a kuoma pamwoyo wako.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Kwaabile na nnondoli wa Nnu'ngu' nnwawa nng'oi muno lina lyake Ana, biti Fanueli wa kabila lya Asheli. Bu'ka ku'nda, aatami na nsengowe myaka saba bai. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Kai', aatami pangali nnalu'me mpaka paikiye upi'ndo wa myaka samanini na nsese. Nsimu awo woti, aatami palua lwa Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu' kwo punga no lu'ba kilo na muntwekati. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Popopo ngaisa Ana na kunnumba Nnu'ngu' no baya makowe ga mwana ywo kwa bandu boti babalolelage kombolelwa kwa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buyangania ku Nasaleti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Abo abelei pabaayomwi panga goti gagaamulilwe na salya ya Bwana, baabuyangani kasabe Nasaleti, kuwilaya ya Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Mwana ngaku'la, aayendeli pata makakala, aatwi'li ikima na ngu'ngu' ya Nnu'ngu' yaai pamope nakwe.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana Yesu palua lwa Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Abelei bake baai na salya yo yenda ku Yelusalemu kila mwaka masu'ba ga si'li'ku'si'li'ku' ya Pasika. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Mwana paikiye myaka ku'mi na ibi'li', baayi'i boti kati mwaibile salya yabe ya kila mwaka. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Paiyomwike si'li'ku'si'li'ku', baatumbwi mwanja wo buyangania kasabe, lakini Yesu aaigali ku Yelusalemu pangali tanga abelei bake panga, bannei nsu'gu'. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Bembe bawasage aalongwaniye na lipi'nga lya babalongolile. Baayi'i mwanja wa kutwa banammonali, ngabatumbwa kumpala mwababile alongo na mambwiga. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Pabakotwike kummona baabuyangani ku Yelusalemu kumpala. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus 12 yrs old and teachers in temple - Dunham DN00416" file="Jesus(12yrs)&amp;Teachers_Luke2.46-47_DN00416.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Darwin Dunham © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="2:45" /><verse eid="LUK 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Lisu'ba lyenetatu ngabankwemba mulua lwa Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu', atami pakatikati ya balimu ba salya, kaapi'kani'a na kwalaluya maswali. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Boti babannyu'wine makowe gake baagasangalike malango gake na mu'lu' mwayangwae kwa ikima. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Abelei bake pabaamweni, baatisangala. Malia mau' bake ngabannaluya, “Wamwana wangu', mwanjaa namani utupangite nyo? Tati' bako na nenga twendekupala, malango gaatuobike.” <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Ywembe ngayangwa, “Mwanjaa namani munipalage? Mwatangikeli panga, nipalilwa tama munyumba ya Tati' bangu'?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Lakini abelei bake baatangiteli makowe go galombolya namani.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Bai, baabuyangine nakwe mpaka ku Nasaleti, na apeyage isima yabe yoti. Mau' bake baagabi'kite makowe ago goti pamwoyo wabe. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Nembe Yesu aayendeli ku'la kimalango na kyi'mo, no pendelwa na Nnu'ngu' na bandu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Makowe ga Yoani Ywabatisage</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="John the baptist and shepherds - Dunham DN00406" file="JohnTheBaptist-Shepherds_DN00406.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Darwin Dunham © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="3:0" /> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Mwaka wa ku'mi na tano waatawalage Kaisali Tibelio, Pontio Pilato atawalage kunkoa wa Yudea. Helode atawalage Galilaya na nnunawe Pilipi atawalage pakilambo sa Itulea na Tulakoniti. Lusania atawalage Abilene. <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Anasi na Kayafa baai api'ndo aku'lu' ba dini. Pamasu'ba go, likowe lya Nnu'ngu' ngalimwisilya Yoani mwana wa Zakalia ku'lu' kulupu'ngu'ti'. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Bai, Yoani ngayenda muilambo yoti yaipakine na libi'ndi' lya Yordani. Kaabakia bandu boti bagalambuke, bammuyangani Nnu'ngu' no batisilwa, li'nga aabu'ki'ye masambi gabe. <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Ngamo iandikilwe mukitabu sa nnondoli wa Nnu'ngu' Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">
    <char style="qt">“Lilobe lya mundu akema kulupu'ngu'ti', </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">
    <char style="qt">mumpetuli Bwana ndi'la yake, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">
    <char style="qt">mugolwe simbasimba yake. </char><verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />
    <char style="qt">Mabi'ndi' goti gaalu'a kulilwa, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">
    <char style="qt">kila kitu'mbi' na litu'mbi' yaalu'a pwimwanilwa no yanjayilwa, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">
    <char style="qt">papapi'ndike, paalu'a gololelwa. </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">
    <char style="qt">Mali'la gangapetwa, gaalu'a petulwa. </char><verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />
    <char style="qt">Na bandu boti baalu'a kuubona ukosopoli wauleta Nnu'ngu'.” </char><verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Bai, Yoani aabakiage bandu baingi babaaisile li'nga aabatise kabaya, “Mwenga mwa kinng'ambo, nyai ywanking'indile mwitile nyongo yayaisa? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Mulaye kwa iyendo yinu panga mummuyangani Nnu'ngu' kwo kana buyangania sambi. Kanemwipune kwo baya, ‘Twenga twa bana ba Bulaimu.’ Nimmakianga kweli panga, Nnu'ngu' awesa kugagalambwa maliwe gamugabona gapange bana ba Bulaimu. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Bai, libago libi'kilwe paliina lya nkongo kwa nyo, kila nkongo wangali pambika itunda inannoga waalu'a pi'ngu'lwa no sonjelwa mwoto.” <verse eid="LUK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Kipi'nga sa bandu ngabalaluya, “Tupange buli?” <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Aayangwi, “Ywabile na ngu'bo ibi'li' ampei mwene buula, na ywabile na kilyo apange nyinyonyo.” <verse eid="LUK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Nabembe alonga koli ngabaisa li'nga babatisilwe ngabannaluya, “Mwalimu, tupange buli?” <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Nembe ngayangwa, “Kanemwabonele bandu kwa, kwaalonga koli pi'ta yi'lu' yaibi'kilwe na silikali.” <verse eid="LUK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Nabembe asikali ngabannaluya, “Na twenga tupange buli?” Nembe ngayangwa, “Kanemupokonywe kikowe sa mundu ywoywoti kwa makakala, wala kunsitakya mundu kwa likosa lya kunku'pi'ki'ya. Linni'ngane liposo lyamuli'pi'lwa.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Boti baai na kikowe sabakipi'kaniage, ngabatumbwa kwilaluya mumyoyo yabe kwa abali ya Yoani panga kwaali' ywembe nga Kilisitu ywabayilwe. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Apo, Yoani ngaabakia boti, “Nenga nimmatisanga kwa masi', nsu'gu' yangu' aisa mwene uweso kulikoni nenga, aywo nenga nipwaikali ata undwana ngoi ya ilatu yake. Ywembe alu'a kummatisanga kwa Loo Mpeleteu na kwa mwoto. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Ywembe aabile na kyelo mumaboko gake, so pepekeya ilalyo akaimati muliku'ngwa paligu'lu', na mayu'ngu'lu'lu' akagatiniye kumwoto wangaimika.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Kwa nyo, pamope na gaayi'ganage maingi, Yoani aakong'ondeli bandu kaabakia Abali Inannoga. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Lakini Yoani ankalipi ntawala Helode, kwa kitumbu sa kuntola Helodia nnyumbo wa nnunawe na kumpanga nnyumbowe, na ankalipi kwa ulau woti waupangite. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Kai', Helode aayongiye ulau kwa kunnyingia Yoani muutabilwe.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 3:20">Yesu endabatisilwa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:20">
    <figure style="fig" alt="John the baptist baptizing Jesus - Wade WA03810" file="JohnTheBaptistBaptizingJesus_WA03810.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="3:20" /> <verse eid="LUK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Bandu boti pabayomwi batisilwa, nembe Yesu aatibatisilwa. Na Yesu paasalyage, kunani kwatiyu'gu'ka. <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />Na apo, ngapaulukilwa na Loo Mpeleteu ywabile na uyi'me wa ngunda. Lilobe lyayu'wanike bu'ka kunani, “Wenga nga wamwana wangu' wanikupendile, ninogelilwe nawenga.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yesu paatumbwi tanganikwa na bandu kwa lyengo lyake, aabile na myaka salasini, na bandu bakitage panga ywembe mwana wa Yusupu, mwana wa Heli. <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heli abi mwana wa Matathia, ywabile mwana wa Lawi, mwana wa Melki, mwana wa Yanai, mwana wa Yusupu. <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Ywaabile mwana wa Matathia, mwana wa Amosi, mwana wa Nahumu, mwana wa Esli, mwana wa Nagai. <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Ywaabile mwana wa Maathi, mwana wa Matathia, mwana wa Shemeni, mwana wa Yoseki, mwana wa Yuda. <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Ywaabile mwana wa Yohanani, mwana wa Lesa, mwana wa Zelubabeli, Zelubabeli aai mwana wa Shealtieli, Shealtieli ai mwana wa Neli, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />mwana wa Melki, Melki aai mwana wa Adi, mwana wa Kosamu, Kosamu aai mwana wa Elmadamu, ywaabile mwana wa Eli. <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Ywaabile mwana wa Yoshua, mwana wa Eliezeli, mwana wa Yolimu, mwana wa Mathati, mwana wa Lawi. <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Ywaabile mwana wa Simioni, mwana wa Yuda, mwana wa Yusupu, mwana wa Yonamu, mwana wa Eliakimu. <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Ywaabile mwana wa Melea, mwana wa Mena, mwana wa Matatha, mwana wa Nathani, mwana wa Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Ywaabile mwana wa Yese, mwana wa Obedi, mwana wa Boazi, mwana wa Salimoni, mwana wa Nashoni. <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Ywaabile mwana wa Aminadabu, mwana wa Admini, mwana wa Alani, ywabile mwana wa Esiloni, mwana wa Pelesi, mwana wa Yuda. <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Ywaabile mwana wa Yakobi, mwana wa Isaki, mwana wa Bulaimu, mwana wa Tela, mwana wa Naholi. <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Ywaabile mwana wa Selugia, mwana wa Leu, mwana wa Pelegi, mwana wa Ebeli, mwana wa Sala. <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Ywaabile mwana wa Kainamu, mwana wa Alfaksadi, mwana wa Shemu, mwana wa Nuu, mwana wa Lameki. <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Ywaabile mwana wa Methusela, mwana wa Henoki, mwana wa Yaledi, mwana wa Mahalaleli, mwana wa Kenani. <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Ywaabile mwana wa Enoshi, mwana wa Sethi, mwana wa Adamu, ywaabile wa Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Payilwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4:1-11</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mal 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yesu abu'i mulibi'ndi' lya Yordani ai ntwi'lya Loo Mpeleteu. Ngalongoyelwa na Loo mpaka kulupu'ngu'ti', <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />akwo aapayilwe na Ibilisi kwa masu'ba alubaini, masu'ba ago goti aalileli kili'be. Paliikite lisu'ba lya alubaini ngaimminya njala. <verse eid="LUK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Apo Ibilisi ngammakia, “Wenga manautei wa mwana wa Nnu'ngu' ulibakiye liwe li' lipange likati.” <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yesu ngannyangwa, “Iandikilwe, <char style="qt">‘Mundu alamali kwa likati bai, ila kwa kila liyi'gi'yo lyalibu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu'.’”</char><verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Bu'kapo Ibilisi ngampeleka mpaka pandu patu'ndu'bau na kunnaya ukulungwa woti wa padunia. Ibilisi ngammakia, <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />“Naakupeya uweso wa kulungwa yoti yi', kwa mwanjaa ayi' yoti nitipeyelwa na mana nipendi kumpeya mundu nendakombwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Bai, mana wanikilikitya ayi' yoti yapanga mali yako.” <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesu ngannyangwa, “Iandikilwe, <char style="qt">‘Unkilikiti Bwana Nnu'ngu' wako na kuntumikia ywembe bai.’” </char> <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus on highest point of temple - Dunham DN00405" file="JesusOnHighestPointOfTemple_DN00405.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Darwin Dunham © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="4:8" /><verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Ibilisi ngampu'twa mpaka ku Yelusalemu, panani ya Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu' ngammakia, “Manaitei wenga nga wamwana wa Nnu'ngu', witu'mbu'ye pai', <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />kwa mwanjaa iandikilwe, <char style="qt">‘Aabakia malaika bake bakuli'ndi'le,’</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />na kai', <char style="qt">‘Baakupu'twa mumoko gabe li'nga wakanekunywa magu'lu' gako muliwe.’” </char><verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Lakini Yesu ngannyangwa, “Iandikilwe, <char style="qt">‘Kaneumpaye Bwana Nnu'ngu' wako.’ </char>” <verse eid="LUK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Ibilisi paibweni ampayike kwa kila ndi'la, nganneka kwa kumpelemba.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atumbwa lyengo lyake ku Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4:12-17</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mal 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Apo Yesu ngaki'li'bu'kya ku Galilaya ai ntwi'lya makakala ga Loo Mpeleteu na makowe gake ngagayu'wanika muilambo yoti ya papipi. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Naywembe aai kayi'gana mumayumba ga kunnu'ba Nnu'ngu', ngalumbilwa na bandu boti.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 4:15">Yesu akanilwa ku Nasaleti</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 4:15">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13:53-58</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mal 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:15">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Synagogue inside man reading - LB00244" file="SynagogueInsideManReading_LB00244.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="4:15" /> <verse eid="LUK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Bai, Yesu ngayenda ku Nasaleti, pandu paalelilwe, na lisu'ba lya Sabato kwa Ayahudi aayingi munyumba ya kunnu'ba Nnu'ngu' kati mwayabile mimu yake. Ngayi'ma li'nga asome Maandiko Mapeleteu kwa lilobe. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Ngapokya kitabu sa nnondoli wa Nnu'ngu' Isaya, ngakiumukwa na kupakolya pandu papaandikilwe,<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />
    <char style="qt">“Loo wa Bwana ai panani yangu', </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="qt">aniyi'mike mwene li'nga naleti aki'ba Abali Inannoga.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="qt">Anitumike kwabakia atabilwe yu'gu'li'lwa kwabe </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="qt">na kimbulibuli bapate lola, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="qt">kai' anitumike nakombwe bababonelwa, </char><verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />
    <char style="qt">no nwaya mwaka wa Bwana wo yaliwa bandu ngu'ngu' yake.” </char><verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Payomwi soma, ngakiwi'ki'lya si'lu' kitabu na kumpeya ntumisi, bu'kapo ngatama. Bandu boti ngabammu'nju'lya minyo. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Naywembe ngaabakia, “Liyi'gi'yo lyamuliyu'wine, li'no litimile.” <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Boti baatinapusika munomuno, baatisangala kwa makowe manogau gaagalongei. Ngabalaluyana, “Ayu' ka ngamwana wa Yusupu?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Nembe ngaabakia, “Nitangite mulu'a nibakia nnongelo gu', ‘Wa nng'anga witepwe wamwene.’ Kai' mwabaya, ‘Goti gatugayu'wine ugapangite ku'lu' ku Kapernaumu, ugapange kai' pano pakilambo sako.’” <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Ngapayendelya baya, “Nnondoli atanganikwali pakilambo sake. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Pi'kani, kwai na alwawa awi'li'ka baingi ku Isilaili nsimu wa Elia, kai' kwai na njala ngu'lu' munni'ma woti kwa mwanjaa aanileli ula kwa myaka itatu na nusu. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Ata nyo, Elia atumilweli kwa nnwawa nng'wi'li'kwa ywoywoti ila kwa nnwawa nng'wi'li'kwa wa ku Salepta nni'ma wa ku Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Kai' ku Isilaili nsimu wa Elisha kwaabile na bene matana baingi. Ata nyo, ntu'pu' nywapeleteyilwe ila Naamani mwenekaya wa ku Silia.” <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus at cliff top - Cook 1978 CN01680" file="JesusAtCliffTop_Luke4.29_CN01680.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="4:27" /> <verse eid="LUK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Boti babaabile mu'lu' munyumba ya kunnu'ba Nnu'ngu' pabagayu'wine galu', baatiusika muno. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Ngabayi'ma na kumpikia panja ya kilambo sabe na kumpeleka panani ya kitu'mbi', li'nga bantaikuli pai' bu'ka mungeleuko. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Lakini Yesu ngapi'ta pakatikati yabe no bu'ka.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mundu mwene moka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-28">Mal 1:12-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Bu'kapo Yesu ngaelya mpaka ku Kapernaumu kuwilaya ya Galilaya, ngaba kayi'gana bandu lisu'ba lya Sabato ya Ayahudi. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Ngabasangala uweso wabile nawo muuyi'gani wake, kwa mwanjaa ayi'ganage kwa amuli. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Na mu'lu' munyumba ya kunnu'ba Nnu'ngu' kwabile na mundu ywalobi moka, aapangite lwengele lwoiba na makutu kakemelya, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Ubile na ki'li' na twenga, wenga wa Yesu wa ku Nasaleti? Buli uisi kutulangamisa? Nikutangite wenga wanyai. Wenga nga wa Mpeleteu mwene makakala ga Nnu'ngu'!” <verse eid="LUK 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesu ngankalipya aywo moka kabaya, “Ndu'ti! Ummu'ke mundu yu'!” Bai, aywo moka ngantu'ya pai' yu'lu' mundu na kummu'ka pangali kunsulu ata pasene. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Bandu boti ngabasangala, ngababakiana, “Ali' likowe lyayambi' mwanjaa kwa uweso na makakala ammakia moka bu'ka naywembe endabu'ka!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Makowe ga Yesu gatiyu'wanika muilambo yoti ya nni'ma gu'lu'.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 4:37">Yesu atepwa bandu baingi</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 4:37">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8:14-17</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mal 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:37">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus healing the sick - LB00301" file="JesusHealingTheSick_LB00301.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="4:37" /> <verse eid="LUK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesu pabu'i mu'lu' munyumba ya kunnu'ba Nnu'ngu', ngayenda kasake Simoni. Mau' yumo nkiwe Simoni, aai na oma ngali' ngabannu'ba antepwe. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Yesu ngaisa no yi'ma papipi nakwe, ngaikalipya yi'lu' oma, ngayu'yu'ki'lwa. Yu'lu' mau' popopo ngakakatuka na kwatumikia. <verse eid="LUK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Lisu'ba palipilyage, boti babaabile na atamwe ba matamwe mbali'mbali', baatikunnetya. Naywembe aabi'kite maboko gake panani ya kila mundu, ngaatepwa boti. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Moka gaatikwabu'ka bandu baingi, ngagakemelya kagabaya, “Wenga nga wa Mwana wa Nnu'ngu'!” Lakini Yesu nga gakalipya wala aagayi'ki'tiyeli longela, kwa mwanjaa gaatangite panga ywembe nga Kilisitu ywabayilwe. <verse eid="LUK 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Ata pakusile Yesu aatibu'ka yenda pandu pakisake, kipi'nga sa bandu ngakimpala. Pabaamweni, ngabapaya kunkanikia li'nga kaneabu'ke kasabe. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Lakini Yesu ngaabakia, “Nipalikwa kwaalya Abali Inannoga ya Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu' mumili'ma yi'ngi', kwa mwanjaa nitumilwe kwa go.” <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Bai, aai kaala ku Yudea mumayumba ga kunnu'ba Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu aakema banamasi' alongoi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4:18-22</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mal 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus teaching from boat - Wade WA03840" file="JesusTeachingFromBoat_WA03840.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="5:0" /> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Lisu'ba limo, Yesu aayi'mi mbwega ya litanda liku'lu' lya Genesaleti, na bandu baingi baatikunti'li'ta no patigana kabapi'kania liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Apo Yesu ngaibona ngalaba ibi'li', mbwega ya litanda liku'lu'. Alopoli bene bai pambwega kabagu'lwa mbi'li'li' yabe. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yesu ngayingya mungalaba yimo yayaabile ya Simoni, na kumpala aiekekeye mumasi' pasene kuutalu na mbwega ya litanda liku'lu'. Ngatama no yi'gana lipi'nga lya bandu ku'no abile mungalaba.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Payomwi yi'gana ngammakia Simoni, “Uendelese ngalaba mpaka papayendekiye, na mukatumbukiye mbi'li'li' yinu li'nga mulobe omba.” <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simoni ngannyangwa, “Mpi'ndo, tutikeleka kilo soti loba lakini tupatikeli kili'be, ila mwanjaa ulongei wenga niyenda tumbukia.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Pabaatumbukiye mbi'li'li' yabe, ngabaloba omba bambone, mpaka mbi'li'li' yabe kaitumbwa kutwanika. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Ngabaakema ayabe ba mungalaba yi'ngi', li'nga sabaayangatiye. Ngabaisa no twi'li'ya omba ngalaba yoti ibi'li', ngaipala swika kwo topa. <figure style="fig" alt="Disciples hauling fish into boat - CN01875" file="DisciplesHaulingFishIntoBoat_CN01875.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="5:7" /><verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Simoni Petili paagabweni go, ngakilikita nnu'ngi' ya Yesu na kummakia, “Bwana, ubu'ke nnu'ngi' yangu', kwa mwanjaa nenga namwene sambi.” <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Simoni na aine boti baatisangala pata omba banansima kati balu'. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Yakobi na Yoani, bana ba Zebedayo, baai alobi aine Simoni. Yesu ngammakia Simoni, “Kaneuyogope, bu'ka nambi'yambi' ulu'a loba bandu.” <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Ngabaleta ngalaba mbwega ya litanda liku'lu' ngabakileka kila kili'be, na kunki'ngama.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu antepwa mwene matana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8:1-4</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mal 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Yesu paabile pakilambo simo sa nni'ma wo, ngakwembana na mundu mwene matana yi'ga yoti. Mundu ywo ngagonja ukukama na kunnu'ba Yesu, “Bwana mana upendile, wendakombwa kunipeletea.”<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesu, ngagoloya luboko, ngankunywa no baya, “Mbala, upeleteke!” Popopo matana gake ngagammu'ka. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Yesu ngammakia, “Kaneummakiye mundu ywoywoti, ila uyende ukailaye kwa mpi'ndo wa dini, na ukapiye salaka kwo peleteka kwako kati mwaabaite Musa no panga kakape upeletike.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Lakini makowe ga Yesu gaayendeli yu'waanika kila pandu. Ipi'nga ya bandu yaatikongolekana kumpi'kania no tepulwa matamwe gabe. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Lakini ywembe aayi'i pandu pakisake, no lu'ba Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu antepwa mundu ywatombolwike</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9:1-8</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mal 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Lisu'ba limo Yesu kaayi'gana, Mafalisayo na balimu ba salya bu'ka kila kilambo sa ku Galilaya, ku Yudea na ku Yelusalemu baatami po. Makakala ga Bwana gabi pamope nakwe li'nga kwatepwa atamwe. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Ngabaisa bandu bampu'twile mumasela mundu ywatombolwike yi'ga. Bapalage kunnyingiya nnyumba li'nga bammi'ke nnu'ngi' ya Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" /><figure style="fig" alt="Lowering a man through the roof" file="17 Lowering Man Through the Roof.jpg" size="col" ref="5:19" />Bu'kana no yoloka kwa bandu, baakombwili kunnyingiya nnyumba, ngabaamwa bau'bu'ke pamwagala, no bu'ya iyonjo yabayipile na kumwuluya mumasela nnu'ngi' ya Yesu, <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Yesu paabweni bai na imani ngu'lu', ngammakia aywo mundu, “Mbwiga, masambi gako usamilwe.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Balimu ba salya na Mafalisayo ngabailaluya, “Ayu' nyai ywalongela mayi'gi'yo ga kupulu? Ntu'pu' mundu ywakombwa samya sambi, ila Nnu'ngu' kisake!” <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesu wakwipwi gabagania ngaalaluya, “Mugania ki'li' mumyoyo yinu? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Lyaku' lyalibile liyu'yu'u muno baya, ‘Usamilwe sambi,’ au baya, ‘Yi'ma uyende’? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Bai, mbala mutange panga Mwana wa Mundu abile na amuli yo samya bandu sambi padunia.” Apo ngammakia yu'lu' mundu ywatombolwike, “Nikubakia, uyi'me utole masela gako uyende kasako.” <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Bu'kapo, yu'lu' mundu ywatombolwike ngayi'ma nnu'ngi' yabe boti, ngatola saagonjelile no yenda kasake, ku'no kankwi'ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Boti batisangala no gania ngabankwi'ya Nnu'ngu' kababaya, “Li'no, tugabweni makowe gayambi'.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 5:26">Lawi akemelwa abe mwanamasi'</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 5:26">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9:9-13</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mal 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:26">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus eating with Matthew - Cook 1978 CN01694" file="JesusEatingWithMatthew&amp;Friends_CN01694.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="5:26" /> <verse eid="LUK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Bu'ka pa go, Yesu aapitike panja, ngammona nnonga koli yumo ywakemelwage Lawi, atami palyengo lyake. Yesu ngammakia, “Uniki'ngame.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Naywembe ngagaleka goti nganki'ngama. <verse eid="LUK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Lawi aampangi Yesu si'li'ku'si'li'ku' ngu'lu' kasake. Na lipi'nga liku'lu' lya alonga koli na bandu baingi babaabile po, baatami nabo pamope. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Mafalisayo na balimu ba salya, baaku'ku'li'ki banamasi' bake kababaya, “Kwa ki'li' mulya no nywa pamope na alonga koli na bene sambi?” <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesu ngaayangwa, “Akoti bampalali nng'anga, babampala nng'anga balu' bababile atamwe. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Niisili kwakema bandu bene aki, ila bene sambi li'nga bammuyangani Nnu'ngu'.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makowe go punga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9:14-17</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mal 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Bandu bi'ngi' ngabammakia, “Banamasi' ba Yoani Ywabatisage bakokotyage punga no lu'ba, ata apwasi ba Mafalisayo bapanga nyinyonyo. Lakini banamasi' bako bendalya no nywa.” <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesu ngayangwa, “Balu' babakokilwe kulisengele bapalikwa punga ku'no mwene lisengele babile nakwe pamope? Lili! <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Lakini nsimu walu'a isa, wobu'yi'lwa mwene lisengele kasabe, na nsimu wo, ngabaalu'a punga.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yesu ngaabakia lukongo lu'no, “Bandu bapapwali kibamba sa ngu'bo yayambi' na kukibi'ka mungu'bo ngona. Mana bapangite nyo, ngu'bo yo yanogelyali. Kai', yapanga baalabiye ngu'bo yayambi'. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Kai' bandu bayi'yali kinywo sa njabibu yayambi' mumapondo maumala, kwa mwanjaa aso kinywo sayambi' salu'a kanja mapondo go, kinywo salu'a yitanika na, mapondo gaalabika. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Kinywo sa njabibu yayambi', kiyi'yi'lwa mumapondo gayambi'. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Ntu'pu' mundu ywaminyikia nywa kinywo sa njabibu yayambi' bu'ka po nywa kinywo sa njabibu ngona, kwa mwanjaa, ibayilwa yi'lu' ngona nga inannoga muno.”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Makowe ga lisu'ba lya Sabato ya Ayahudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12:1-8</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mal 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Lisu'ba limo lya Sabato ya Ayahudi Yesu paabile kapi'ta mumigunda ya ngano, banamasi' bake baatumbwi ti'kwana no ting'anda yeyo ya ngano li'nga balye nombo yake. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Mafalisayo baingi ngabaalaluya, “Mboni mupanga makowe gagakanilwa na salya kulisu'ba lya Sabato?” <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesu ngaayangwa, “Munasomali mwaapangite Daudi na aine pabaabile na njala? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Ywembe aayingi mu Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu', no tola galu' makati gagabi'kilwe nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu', lya na kwapeya aine. Yatikanilwa mundu lya makati galu' ila api'ndo ba dini bai.” <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Apo ngaabakia, “Mwana wa Mundu nga Bwana wa Sabato.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 6:5">Mundu mwene luboko lutomboloka</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 6:5">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12:9-14</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mal 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:5">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus Healing Man with Crippled Hand - Cook 1978 CN01695" file="JesusHealingManWithCrippledHand_CN01695.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="6:5" /> <verse eid="LUK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Lisu'ba li'ngi' lya Sabato ya Ayahudi, Yesu aayingi munyumba ya kunnu'ba Nnu'ngu' no yi'gana. Mu'lu', mwaabile na mundu ywalemile luboko lwamalyo. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Balimu ba salya na Mafalisayo bapalage kitumbu sakunsitakya Yesu, kwa nyo baatikumpekeseni bannole mana alu'a kuntepwa mundu lisu'ba lya Sabato ya Ayahudi. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Lakini Yesu aatangite mwabaganiage, ngammakia yu'lu' mwene luboko lutomboloka, “Kakatuka, uyi'me pakatikati yabe.” Ngayenda no yi'ma. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Yesu ngaabakia, “Ninnaluya mwenga, lisu'ba lya Sabato ya Ayahudi nantali panga makowe manogau au ganannyata, tepwa au bulaga?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Paaloi boti bababile palu' ngammakia yu'lu' mundu, “Goloya luboko lwako.” Naywembe paapangite nyo, luboko lwake lwapangite lukoti kai'. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Lakini bembe baatiusika muno ngabalaluyana, lyaku' lyakau lyakumpangya Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asawa banamasi' ku'mi na abi'li'</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10:1-4</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mal 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Lisu'ba limo Yesu aayi'i lu'ba Nnu'ngu' kukitu'mbi', aakelike sekesekembe. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Pamalau' ngaakema banamasi' bake, na nkati yabe ngabawa bandu ku'mi na abi'li' abo ngaakema atumilwe, <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Simoni (ywaatinilwe na Yesu lina lya Petili) na Andelea nnunawe, Yakobi na Yoani, Pilipi na Batolomayo, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matei, Tomasi, Yakobi wa Alufayo na Simoni wa kipi'nga sa Mazeloti, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yuda wa Yakobi, na Yuda Isikalioti ywaansongi Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu endayi'gana no tepwa bandu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yesu aalongwaniye na banamasi' bake kaelya bu'ka kukitu'mbi', aayi'mi pandu pankanya. Apo pai na lipi'nga liku'lu' lya banamasi' bake na bandu baingi bababu'i lwingo lwoti lwa Yudea, Yelusalemu, kumbwani ya Tilo na Sidoni. Boti baisi kumpi'kania Yesu no tepulwa matamwe gabe. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Aatepwi boti, kai' aatepwi na babaauyilwage na moka. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Bandu boti bapalage bankunywe, kwa mwanjaa nkati yake gapitage makakala ga kwatepwa boti.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 6:19">Nantali na kibona</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 6:19">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:19">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Sermon on the mount - WA03829" file="SermonOnTheMount_WA03829.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="6:19" /> <verse eid="LUK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yesu ngaagalambukya banamasi' bake ngabaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">“Nantali mwenga mwamile mwaki'ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">kwa mwanjaa Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu' winu.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Nantali mwenga mwamuminya njala nambi'yambi',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">kwa mwanjaa mwalu'a yukuta.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">Nantali mwenga mwamuli'la nambi'yambi',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">kwa mwanjaa mwalu'a eka.<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />“Nantali mwenga mwamusukilwa na bandu, mwamubaulwa, mwamui'mbu'lwa, no linyatia lina linu kitumbu sa Mwana wa Mundu. <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Pagaapita ago goti mwanapusike no u'mbau'mba, kwa mwanjaa upo yinu ngu'lu' ibile kunani. Kwa mwanjaa api'ndo babe baapangi alondoli ba Nnu'ngu' nyinyonyo.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />“Lakini mwakibona mwenga mwamatayili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:24">kwa mwanjaa mupatike upo yinu.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Mwakibona mwenga mwamuyukuta nambi'yambi',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">kwa mwanjaa mwalu'a minya njala palu'ngi'.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">Mwakibona mwenga mwamweka kwo napusika nambi'yambi',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">kwa mwanjaa mwalu'a li'la no lombola.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Mwakibona mwenga mwamulumbilwa na bandu boti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:26">kwa mwanjaa api'ndo babe baapangi alondoli ba ubu'su' nyinyonyo.”<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwapenda andumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat 5:38-48</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />“Lakini nimmakianga mwenga mwamunipi'kania, mwapende andumu binu, na mwapangi manogau babansukwanga. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Mwalu'bi makowe manogau balu' babannosa na mwalu'bi balu' babampangya ulau. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Mundu mana akuku'mbwi ligomo limo ung'alambukiye na linebi'li'. Mundu mana akupokonywi likoti lyako unneki na kiyampani sako. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Ywoywoti ywakulu'ba wampei na mundu mana akupokonywi kili'be sako kaneunnonge kukuki'li'bu'ki'ya. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Mwamupala bandu bampangi mwenga, nabembe mwapangi nyinyonyo.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />“Mana mwaalu'a kwapenda babampendile, mwenga mwalu'a pata upo yaku'? Ntu'pu', kwa mwanjaa ata bene sambi baapenda babaapendile. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Kai' mana mwapangi manogau balu' babampangi manogau, mwalu'a pata upo yaku'? Kwa mwanjaa ata bene sambi bapanga gogogo. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Na mana kamwapeya ngu'ta balu' bamwu'bi'lya kunni'pya, mwapata upo yaku'? Kwa mwanjaa ata bene sambi baapeya ayabe li'nga baki'li'bu'ki'yi'lwe si'si'lu'si'lu'. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Ila mwenga mwapende andumu binu na kwapangya manogau, mwapei ngu'ta wangau'bi'lya ki'li'bu'ki'yi'lwa na upo yinu yapanga ngu'lu', namwe mwapanga mwabana ba Nnu'ngu' wa kunani. Kwa mwanjaa ywembe nnogau kwa bangali sukulu na bababile alau. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Mube na kiya kati Tati' binu mwababile na kiya.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makowe ga kwaukumu bi'ngi'</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mat 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />“Kanemwaukumu bi'ngi', na mwenga mwaukumilwali na Nnu'ngu'. Kanemwabi'ki bi'ngi' lukoolo, namwenga mwabi'ki'lwali lukoolo na Nnu'ngu'. Mwasami bi'ngi', namwenga mwasamilwa na Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Mwapei bandu ili'be yabapala na mwenga Nnu'ngu' ampeya, mwapokya kili'ngo satwi'la no indilya, tikyatikya ika no yitanika. Kwa mwanjaa kili'ngo sososo samwaali'ngya, nga samwaali'ngi'lwa na Nnu'ngu'.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Ngaabakia lukongo, “Mbulibuli endakombwa kunnongoya ndi'la mbulibuli nnyine? Lili, boti abi'li' baalu'a tumbukya mulyi'mbwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Mwanamasi' ampi'tali mwalimu wake, lakini mwanamasi' ywayitagile ngaywaba kati mwalimu wake. <figure style="fig" alt="Blind leader - GT00067" file="BlindLeader_Luke6.39_GT00067.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Gordon Thompson © Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc., 2012." ref="6:40" /> <verse eid="LUK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />Mwanjaa buli ukibona kyelenje muliyo lya nnyino na lubago lwa muliyo lyako ulubonali? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Au ukombwabuli kummakia nnyino, ‘Nnyangu', nileka nikubu'ye kyelenje sakibile muliyo lyako’, na wamwene lubile lubago muliyo lyako? Wammu'su'bu'su', ulubu'ye wi'ti' lubago lwa muliyo lyako, ngaummu'ye nnyino.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 6:42">Mundu atanganikwa kwa makowe gake</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 6:42">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat 7:16-20</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:42">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Figs, Man picking - LB00085" file="Figs-ManPicking_LB00085.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="6:42" /> <verse eid="LUK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />“Nkongo unannoga upambikali itunda inannyata wala nkongo unannyata upambikali itunda inannoga. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Bandu bautanga nkongo bu'kana na itunda yake, itanganikwe panga, bandu batu'mbwali tini wala njabibu mumimimwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Mundu nnogau apiya manogau gagabile mumwoyo wake, na mundu nnau apiya malau gagabile mumwoyo wake. Kwa nyo, nkano wa mundu ulongela gagabile mumwoyo wake.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 6:45">Asengi ba ngolo ibi'li'</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 6:45">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:45">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Houses built on rock and sand - DN00469" file="HousesBuiltOnRock&amp;Sand_2HitByStorm_DN00469.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Darwin Dunham © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="6:45" /> <verse eid="LUK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />“Kwa mwanjaa buli munikema, ‘Bwana, Bwana,’ ku'no kamukana panga ganimmakianga? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Nilu'a kumpeyanga lukongo lu'no lwa mundu ywaisa kasangu' kugayu'wa makowe gangu' na kugapanga. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Aywo alandana na mundu ywasenga nyumba kwo i'mbi'ya mpaka mumpi'mbi' ngaupita nkukulo wa libi'ndi' pawiku'mbwi nyumba yo, isengwanikeli, kwa mwanjaa yaasengilwe ngangamau. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Lakini ywoywoti ywagayu'wa makowe gangu' kakotoka kugapanga, aywo alandana na mundu ywasengite nyumba pangali i'mbi'ya. Pawisi nkukulo ayo nyumba ngaiyiluka no sengwanika.”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu antepwa ntumisi wa mpi'ndo wa yesi lya Roma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Payomwi longela gaabini kwabakia bandu, Yesu aayi'i ku Kapernaumu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" /><figure style="fig" alt="A centurion" file="NT-08 Centurion.tif" size="col" ref="7:2">Mpi'ndo wa yesi</figure>Akwo kwaai na mpi'ndo yumo wa yesi ywembe mpangakasi wake ywampendile, endeminya na kiwo sendekumwegelelya. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Yu'lu' mpi'ndo wa yesi paayu'wine makowe ga Yesu, ngatuma agoi nsi'si' ba Kiyahudi, bakannu'be Yesu li'nga santepwe mpangakasi wake. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Pabaikite kwa Yesu, baatikumpembelelya kababaya, “Ili'ngani mundu yu' umpangi likowe li'. <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Kwa kitumbu ywembe aaupendi muno nni'ma witu na ngaywatusengi yi'lu' nyumba ya kunnu'ba Nnu'ngu'.” <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Bai, kabayenda, baalongwaniye na Yesu. Pabaabile kabaegelya panyumba ya yu'lu' mpi'ndo wa yesi, ngatuma mambwigalye bakammakiye Yesu, “Bwana, kanewisuluye muno, kwa mwanjaa nenga ili'nganili wenga yingya munyumba yangu'. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Kwa nyo, nga kitumbu sanikotwike isa kwaubile, naibweni nili'nganili. Ila ulongele bai likowe, na mpangakasi wangu' alu'a lama. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Nanenga nibi pai' ya utawala nyonyonyo, na nibile na banayesi pai' yangu'. Nimmakia yumo, ‘Yenda,’ ywembe endayenda, nimmakia ywi'ngi' ‘Isa!’ nembe endaisa, na mpangakasi wangu' ‘Panga kikowe si'!’ nembe endapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yesu payu'wine go, aatisangala, aakigalambuki si'lu' kipi'nga sa bandu sakimmi'ngi'yage, ngabaya, “Nammonali mundu mwene imani ngu'lu' kati yi' mu Isilaili yoti!” <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Balu' bandu babaatumilwe kwa Yesu pabaabukiye kasake yu'lu' mpi'ndo, bankoli yu'lu' mpangakasi ayu'yu'kilwe.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 7:10">Yesu annyu'ya mwana wa mau' ywawi'like na nsengowe</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:10">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus raises widow's son - WA03823" file="JesusRaisesWidow'sSon-3DeadManSitsUp_Luke7.15_WA03823.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="7:10" /> <verse eid="LUK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Bu'kapo, Yesu ngayenda kukilambo sa Naini, aalongwaniye na banamasi' bake, na lipi'nga lya bandu babammi'ngi'yage. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Bai, paegeli paniango wo yingya pakilambo so, baapitike bandu babapu'twi ntwi wa nnalu'me yumo ywabelekwi kisake kwa nnwawa ywawi'like na nsengowe. Bandu baingi ba kilambo so, baabile pamope na mau' ywo. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Bwana Yesu paamweni mau' ywo, aammi'ki kiya, ngammakia, “Kaneuli'le.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Bu'kapo, ngayenda kugakunywa galu' masela na balu' babaapu'twile baatiyi'ma, ngabaya, “Wamunsembe, Nikuamulisa uyumuke!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Yu'lu' nnalu'me ywawile ngakatuka tama utama, no tumbwa longela. Yesu ngankamukiya kwa mau' bake. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Bandu boti baatiyogopa na kunnumba Nnu'ngu' kababaya, “Nnondoli nku'lu' wa Nnu'ngu' apitike mulukolo lwitu. Nnu'ngu' aisi kwakombwa bandu bake.” <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Makowe gake go gaatiyu'wanika kwoti akwo Yudea na ilambo ya papipi.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banamasi' ba Yoani babaatumilwe yenda kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mat 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Banamasi' ba Yoani baayi'i kummakia Yoani makowe ago goti. Nembe Yoani payomwi kwakema banamasi' bake abi'li' bu'ka kwa boti, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />aatumike kwa Bwana, bakannaluye, “Wenga nga yu'lu' ywaisa, au tunni'nde ywi'ngi'?” <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Balu' banamasi' pabaaikite kwa Yesu, baatikummakia, “Yoani Ywabatisage atutumike kasako tukulaluye, ‘Wenga wa yu'lu' ywaisa, au tunni'nde ywi'ngi'?’”<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Palu' pabannaluyage Yesu aai mulyengo lya kwatepwa bandu baingi balu' babalumyage kwa matamwe, na babaayingililwe na moka na kwapanga atu'lu'ka minyo baingi balole. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Bai, Yesu ngayangwa, “Muyende mukammakiye Yoani galu' gamugabweni kwa minyo ginu na kugayu'wa. Atu'lu'ka minyo bendalola, itewe bendayenda, bene matana bendapeleteyelwa, aibamakutu bendayu'wa, awi'li bendayu'ka, na aki'ba baalilwa Abali Inannoga. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Nantali mundu yu'lu' ywakotwike ba na kyukala nanenga.”<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Apo pababu'i balu' baatumike Yoani, Yesu aatumbwi kulibakia lipi'nga lya bandu abali ya Yoani, “Mwayi'i linga namani ku'lu' kulupu'ngu'ti'? Buli, mupalage kugabona mambu'ngi'li'i kagapu'ngi'la na nsunga? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Mana nyinyo lili, mwayi'i linga namani? Mwayi'i kunnola mundu ywaweti magu'bo gene bei? Babawala magu'bo gene bei no tama kwa maisa ga kitayili batama mumayumba ga akulungwa! <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Bai, munibakiye, mwayi'i linga namani, mwayi'i kunnola nnondoli wa Nnu'ngu'? Eloo, kai' kumpi'ta nnondoli wa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Ayu' Yoani ngaywabayilwa mu Maandiko Mapeleteu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:27">
    <char style="qt">‘Lola, nenga nintuma mpangakasi wangu' akulongoli, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:27">
    <char style="qt">aywo alu'a kupetulya ndi'la yako.’” </char><verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Yesu aayomwi kwo baya, “Nimmakia, kati ya bandu boti babatami panni'ma, ntu'pu' ywabile nku'lu' muno kumpi'ta Yoani Ywabatisage. Ata nyo, yu'lu' ywabile nsene muno mu Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu' nga nku'lu' kulikoni ywembe.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Bandu boti pamope na alonga koli pabagayu'wine go, baaulumbite unnogau wa Nnu'ngu'. Abo nga balu' babaupoki ubatiso wa Yoani. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Lakini Mafalisayo na balimu ba salya baakani panga mwapendi Nnu'ngu', kwa kuukana ubatiso wa Yoani wawaisi kwabe bembe.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yesu ngaalaluya, “Bandu ba lubelekwo lu', nalandaniye na kili'be gani? Bandu ba uyi'me gani? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Landana kwabe kati bana babatamaga palisoko, kababakiana kipi'nga simo na si'ngi',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:32">‘Tumwonekiye ngoma, namwenga mwinikeli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:32">Tunnyi'mbi myambo ya ili'lo lakini muli'ili!’<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />“Kwa mwanjaa Yoani paisile, nembe endage punga na anywageli wi'mbi', namwenga mwabaite, ‘Ayingililwe na moka!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Nembe Mwana wa Mundu aisi kaalya no nywa, na mwenga mubaya, ‘Munninge ayu' mundu mila no lobya, mbwiga wa alonga koli na bene sambi!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Ata nyo, ikima ya Nnu'ngu' ikong'ondeli panga inannoga kwa balu' boti babaiyi'ki'tya.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 7:35">Yesu kasake Simoni Mfalisayo</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:35">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Woman anointing Jesus' Feet - WA03839" file="WomanAnointingJesus'FeetWithPerfume_WA03839.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="7:35" /> <verse eid="LUK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Mfalisayo yumo ankemite Yesu akalye kilyo kasake. Ngayingya nnyumba ya ywo Mfalisayo, aatitama no lya. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Bai, pakilambo si'lu' kwai na nnwawa yumo mwene sambi. Paayu'wine panga, Yesu abile nnyumba ya ywo Mfalisayo, aapu'twi supa ya liwe yene mauta ganannungya. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Atiisa ngayi'ma papipi na magu'lu' ga Yesu, ku'no kali'la, na moli gake gaatu'mbu'ki mumagu'lu' ga Yesu. Aywo nnwawa aagaponwi magu'lu' ga Yesu kwa nywili yake ndaso. Payomwi kumponwa, aaganoni galu' magu'lu', na kugapakaya mauta ganannungya. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Yu'lu' Mfalisayo ywankokite Yesu paagabweni go, aganiyite pamwoyo wake, “Kenda mundu yu' akapanga nnondoli wa Nnu'ngu', alu'e tanga panga, ayu' nnwawa ywankunywa mwene sambi.” <verse eid="LUK 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesu ngammakia ywo Mfalisayo, “Simoni, nibile na kikowe sa kukubakia.” Nembe Simoni ngammakia, “Nendakupi'kania Mwalimu, baya.” Yesu ngabaya, <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />“Bandu abi'li' bankopite mundu mbanje, yumo aakopite dinali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dinali yimo yabile kati mbanje ya kunni'pa kibalua yumo kwa lisu'ba limo.</char></note> mya tano, na ywi'ngi' amusini. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Wabasindwi li'pa maleni gabe, aywo mundu aatikwasamya boti abi'li'. Tumbwe, ywaku' kati ya bo bandu abi'li' ywalu'a kumpenda muno yu'lu' bwana?” <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simoni aatiyangwa, “Apo, niibona ywasamilwe leni liku'lu', ngaywaalu'a kumpenda muno yu'lu' bwana.” Yesu ngammakia, “Kakape.”<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Kai' nganng'alambukya yu'lu' nnwawa na kummakia Simoni, “Wendakummona ayu' nnwawa? Nenga paniyingi pano panyumba yako, unipeili masi' go uluwa mumagu'lu' gangu', lakini nnwawa yu' anigu'lwi' magu'lu' gangu' kwa moli gake na kuniponwa kwa nywili yake. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Wenga unipangiteli abali kwa kuninonia, lakini ayu' nnwawa, bu'ka paniyingi pano, ywembe aganoniage magu'lu' gangu'. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Wenga unilayiteli unoga mwoyo wako kwa kunipakaya mauta muntwe, lakini ayu' nnwawa apangite nyo kwa kunipakaya mauta mumagu'lu' gangu'. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Kwa nyo nendakubakia, asamilwe masambi gake maingi kwa mwanjaa alayite unogau wake nku'lu'. Ywasamilwe kisene apenda pasene.” <verse eid="LUK 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Bai, Yesu ngammakia yu'lu' nnwawa, “Usamilwe masambi gako.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Apo nga balu' babaabi pamope nakwe pamesa, ngabalaluyana, “Ayu' mundu gani, ywakombwa samya sambi?” <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Nembe Yesu ngammakia yu'lu' nnwawa, “Imani yako ikukosopolile, uyende kwa amani.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Alwawa babalongwanage na Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Bu'kapo, Yesu api'ti mumisengo miku'lu'miku'lu' na misenemisene, kaala Abali Inannoga ya Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu'. Balu' banamasi' ku'mi na abi'li' bai pamope nakwe. <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />Kai', kwaai na alwawa balu' baabi'ngite Yesu moka na kwa tepwa matamwe. Nabembe baalekangineli nakwe, maina gabe Malia (ywakemelwage Makatalena), ywembe aabi'ngilwe mitumbi saba ya moka, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Yoana nnyumbo wa Kusa ywaabile mpangakasi nku'lu' wa Helode, Susana na bi'ngi' baingi. Abo alwawa, batumyage mali yabe bene kwatumikia bembe.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 8:3">Lukongo lwa mpandi</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 8:3">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13:1-9</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mal 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:3">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Sower sowing seed - DN00470" file="Sower(Farmer)SowingSeed_Mat13.2-9_DN00470.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Darwin Dunham © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="8:3" /> <verse eid="LUK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Lisu'ba limo lipi'nga lya bandu lyatemesekana, na bandu bamwisilyage Yesu bu'ka kila kilambo. Nembe aabakiye lukongo lu'no. <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Mpandi aayi'i misa mbeyu yake, paamisage mbeyu yo, yi'ngi' yaatu'mbu'ki mundi'la, yali'batilwe na api'ta ndi'la no sonyolwa na iyuni. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Yi'ngi' yatu'mbu'ki pamaliwe, na paibalike, yaatiyu'ma kwo oba masi'. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Yi'ngi' yaatu'mbu'ki pakatikati ya kiwi'mbi', yi'lu' ya pakiwi'mbi' paibalike, yaatolilwe kikolo. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Yi'ngi' yatu'mbu'ki muukando unannoga, yabalike, no pambika mbeyu mya kwa kila lupeyu lumo.” Payomwi longela go, ngau'bu'ya lilobe, kabaya, “Mwene makutu go yu'wa, na ayu'we!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kitumbu so yi'gana kwa ngongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13:10-17</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mal 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Banamasi' bake Yesu ngabannaluya, “Lukongo lu' lulombolya namani?” <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Nembe ngayangwa, “Mwenga muyaliwite tanga iyo ya Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu', lakini abo bi'ngi' lili, ila abo babakiyilwa kwa ngongo li'nga batange panga, galu' gagaandikilwe mulilagano lya kwai'mbu' gendatimya, <char style="qt">‘Mana kabalola, kanebakibone sabakilolase, na mana kabayu'wa, kanebatange sabakiyu'wase.’ </char><verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aanwa lukongo lwa mpandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13:18-23</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mal 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />“Bai, kikomekeyo sa lukongo lu'no nga si'no, mbeyu yaibayilwa pano nga liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Yi'lu' yaitu'mbu'ki mundi'la, ilaya bandu balu' babapi'kania liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu' kai' yu'lu' nndumu endaisa na kulibu'ya mumyoyo yabe baakane u'bi'lya no kosopolelwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Yi'lu' yaitu'mbu'ki pamaliwe mana ibalike ntu'pu' poyingya ngi'ga, apo ilandana na bandu balu' babaliu'bi'lya liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu' kwo napusika na pabapayilwa pasene, bakoloka mwoyo. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Yi'lu' yaitu'mbu'ki pakiwi'mbi', ilandana na bandu balu' babapi'kania li'lu' liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu', lakini mana babu'i basuluyilwa na kyukala, utayili na maminyikio ga yi'ga, abo bapambikali itunda no komala. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Na yi'lu' yaitu'mbu'ki muukando wa mbolya, nga bandu balu' babaliyu'wa li'lu' liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu' bendaligania, na kulibi'ka mumwoyo unannoga na kuliisimu. Abo, bendakomeya mpaka bapiye itunda.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 8:15">Lumuli lwaluwi'ki'lilwe</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 8:15">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mal 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:15">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Lamp in Wall Niche - LB00148" file="LampInWallNiche_LB00148.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="8:15" /> <verse eid="LUK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />“Bandu bakoyali kimuli na kukiwi'ki'lya mukibi'ga, au mmu'ngu'. Lakini bakibi'ka patu'ndu'bau li'nga bandu balole bweya. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Sosoti sakiiyilwe saiyanikwali, na makowe ga iyo yoyoti yaiyanikwali na yabonekana paminyo ga bandu. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Kwa nyo mwili'ndi'le kwa go gamugayu'wa, kwa mwanjaa ywabile na kili'be alu'a yongeyelwa, lakini ywangali kili'be ata si'lu' kisene sabile naso saatolelwa.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mau' na alongobe Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12:46-50</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mal 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Mau' na akinannunabe, baamwisili Yesu, lakini baakombwili kumwegelya kwa kitumbu sa kipi'nga sa bandu. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Yesu aapeyilwe abali, “Mau' bako na akinannunabo bai panja, bapala kukubona.” <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Lakini Yesu aabakiye bandu boti, “Mau' na akinannunangu', balu' babapi'kania lilobe lya Nnu'ngu' na kulikamwa.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 8:21">Yesu agaamulisa mabi'mbi' ga baali gatame liki</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 8:21">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8:23-27</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mal 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:21">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus &amp; Disciples in Boat and storm - CN01707" file="Jesus&amp;DisciplesInBoat+Storm_CN01707.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="8:21" /> <verse eid="LUK 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Lisu'ba limo Yesu na banamasi' bake bau'bwike mungalaba na ngaabakia, “Tuloke litanda tuyende mpaka kwiyi'.” Bai, ngabatumbwa mwanja. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Pabaabile mungalaba, Yesu lwampatike lugono, ngagonja. Nsunga nkali' na masi' gaatiyu'gayu'ga no yingya nkati ya ngalaba, apo baakibweni kiwo kakiegelya. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Balu' banamasi' bannyendeli Yesu na kunnyumuya kababaya, “Mpi'ndo, mpi'ndo! Twenda waa!” Yesu ngayumuka na kuukalipya nsunga nkali' no yu'gayu'ga kwa masi', nawembe ngauyi'ma no tama liki. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Bu'kapo ngaabakia, “U'bi'lya kwinu kubi kwaku'?” Lakini bembe baatisangala no yogopa ku'no kababakiana, “Ayu' nga mundu gani, ywaukalipya nsunga no yu'gayu'ga kwa masi' nayembe yendakunnyu'wa?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 8:25">Yesu antepwa mundu ywayingililwe na moka</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 8:25">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8:28-34</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mal 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Demon-possessed man meets Jesus - CN01709" file="Demon-PossessedManMeetsJesus_Mark5.1-20_CN01709.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="8:25" /> <verse eid="LUK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Baayendeli na mwanja mpaka kumbwani ya nni'ma wa Agelasi, waulolangana na Galilaya kwiyi' ya litanda. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Paulukage kumbwani, mundu yumo ywalobi moka amwisili bu'ka kukilambo. Bu'ka myaka yambone mundu ywo atamage wausu bai na atamage kuulema. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Pamweni Yesu, aitu'yike pai' nnu'ngi' yake, no kemelya kwa lilobe liku'lu' kabaya, “Wenga wa Yesu wa Mwana wa Nnu'ngu' Nku'lu', ubile na kitumbu gani nanenga? Nendakulu'ba, sondesonde kaneunilumiye!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Alongei nyo kwa mwanjaa Yesu agakalipi go moka gabu'ke kwa mundu ywo. Ago moka gakoyage kunnyingilya mundu ywo, pamope no panga bandu bammi'i nnyumba na kuntaba kwa nyololo na pingwi mumagu'lu' na mumoko. Kila pabantaba ipungo yo, endekwiti'kwana no butukya kulupu'ngu'ti' kwa makakala ga aywo moka. <verse eid="LUK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Bai, Yesu ngannaluya, “Lina lyako wanyai?” Ywembe ngayangwa, “Lina lyangu' na Yesi,” kwa mwanjaa ganiyingi moka maingi. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Ago moka ngagannu'ba panga kaneagamulise yenda kulyi'mbwa liku'lu'.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Pandu po kwabile na kipi'nga kiku'lu' sa magu'be kagali'lya pakitu'mbi'. Bai, balu' moka ngabannu'ba kai', aayi'ki'tiye bakaayingi balu' magu'be. Nembe Yesu ngaayi'ki'ti'a. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Kwa nyo, galu' moka gaatikummu'ka yu'lu' mundu na kwayingya balu' magu'be, nabembe baimbiliti palinyenji no tumbukya mulitanda, masi' ngagaabulaga. <figure style="fig" alt="Demon-possessed man, pigs fall into lake - WA03846" file="Demon-PossessedManHealed-PigsFallIntoLake_WA03846.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="8:33" /><verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Balu' asungi pabagabweni goti gagaapitile, baatitila no yenda kwayaulya bandu makowe go, mukilambo na mumigunda. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Bandu ngabaisa lola gagapitike. Pabaikite paabile Yesu, baamweni yu'lu' mundu ywagammu'i moka atami papipi na Yesu, aweti ngu'bo na malango gake gabuyangine, ngabayogopa. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Balu' bandu babalibweni likowe lyo, kalipangika paminyo gabe, baayi'i kwabakia ayabe gabagabweni kwa yu'lu' mundu mwaatepulilwe. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Bandu boti ba nni'ma wa Gelasi, baatiyogopa kwa nyo, bannu'bike Yesu abu'ke. Yesu ngau'bu'ka mungalaba no bu'ka. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Yu'lu' mundu ywabu'yilwe moka, aannu'bite balongwane lakini Yesu aatikunkania ngammakia, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Ubuyangani kasako, ukabaye makowe goti gaakupangi Nnu'ngu'.” Bai, yu'lu' mundu ngayenda kasake kapi'ta ku'no kaala kila pandu mukilambo si'lu' makowe goti gapangilwe na Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Biti Yailo na nnwawa yumo bendatepulwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9:18-26</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mal 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Yesu pabuyangani kwiyi' ya litanda, kipi'nga sa bandu satikunkemya kwa mwanjaa boti bendekunni'nda. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Apo ngaisa mundu yumo ywakemelwage Yailo, mpi'ndo wa nyumba ya kunnu'ba Nnu'ngu'. Aitaikuli pamagu'lu' ga Yesu na kunnu'ba ayende kasake. <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />Kwa mwanjaa mwi'nja wake ywabelekwi kisake, ywa myaka ku'mi na ibi'li' endekomya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Yesu paayendage, bandu bendekuntwi'li'lya na kunkunywa ku'no na ku'no. <figure style="fig" alt="Woman touching fringe of cloak - Dunham DN00438" file="WomanTouchingFringeOfCloak_DN00438.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Darwin Dunham © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="8:42" /> <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Bai, kwai na nnwawa yumo pakatikati ya si'lu' kipi'nga sa bandu, ywembe abi na utamwe wa nkongomokwa kwa myaka ku'mi naibi'li'. Pamope no panga aayomwi ili'be yake yoti kwapelekya aganga, ntu'pu' ywaakombwi kuntepwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Aywo nnwawa aammi'ngi'yite Yesu nsu'gu', ngapakunywa mpindo wa nganju yake. Pakunywile, popopo utamwe wake waatikummu'ka. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesu ngalaluya, “Aywo nyai ywanikunywile?” Boti ngababaya panga, ntu'pu' mundu ywakukunywile. Nembe Petili ngabaya, “Mpi'ndo, kipi'nga sa bandu kitekuti'li'ta no kukutwi'li'lya.” <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Lakini Yesu ngabaya, “Kubi na mundu ywanikunywile, mwanjaa nigabweni makakala kaganibu'ka.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Yu'lu' nnwawa waibweni panga akombwali iya, ngapapitya nnu'ngi' ya Yesu ku'no kalendema kwo yogopa, ngaitu'ya pai, Yesu kannola. Apo, ngalongela nnu'ngi' ya bandu boti kitumbu sa kunkunywa Yesu na kitumbu sapatike tepulwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yesu ammakiye panga, “Biti, kwo u'bi'lya kwako uponi, uyende kwa amani.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Paabile balo kalongela, Yailo aaletilwe abali bu'ka kaya, “Mwi'nja wako awile, sakunsulukia muno Mwalimu saku'.” <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Yesu pagayu'wine go, ngammakia Yailo, “Kaneuyogope, we wu'bi'li bai alu'a tepulwa.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Yesu paikite kasake Yailo, annyi'ki'tiyeli mundu yingya nnyumba pamope nakwe, ila aayingi na Petili, Yoani, Yakobi na abelei ba aywo mwi'nja. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Bandu boti baabile kabali'la no lombola mwakipitike kiwo sake. Yesu ngaabakia, “kanemuli'le, mwana atigonja bai, anawaali!” <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Bandu ngabamweka kwa kunsalawa panga atangiteli kiwo, mwanjaa bembe baatangite awile. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Lakini Yesu ankamwi luboko na kummakia, “We mwana, yumuka!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Bwu'mi wake ngaubuyangana, no yumuka. Yesu ngaabakia, bampei kilyo. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Abelei bake batisangala kummona mwu'mi, lakini Yesu ngaaking'indya panga, kanebammakiye mundu ywoywoti aga gagapangilwe. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus healing Jairus daughter - Dunham DN00437" file="JesusHealingJairus'Daughter_DN00437.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Darwin Dunham © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="8:56" /><verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu atuma balu' ku'mi na abi'li'</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10:5-15</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mal 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yesu aakemite balu' ku'mi na abi'li' na kwapeya uweso wo bi'nga moka na kwatepwa atamwe. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Kai', ngaatuma bakaale Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu' na kwatepwa atamwe. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Aalagi, “Pamuyabwa mwanja kanemupu'twe kikowe sosoti, kanemupu'twe lukongoso wala nsaku, wala masulupu, wala mbanje wala kanemwapu'twe ata nganju yo bi'ki'ya. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Pansengo wowoti wabankemya no yingya, mwatame po mpaka pamwabu'ka pakilambo so. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Bandu mana bakani kunkemya, mubu'ke pakilambo so no paapata ata lyu'ku'mbi' lyalinamati mumagu'lu' ginu. Awo wapanga kati mwasu wa lukilo lwabe.” <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Bai, baatumbwi mwanja bapi'ti muilambo kabaala Abali Inannoga na kwatepwa atamwe kila pandu.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kyukala sa Helode</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14:1-12</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mal 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Kwa nyo ntawala Helode aapatike abali ya makowe goti gagaapangike aatangiteli mwanjaa babayage, “Yoani Ywabatisage ayu'kite bu'ka kuuwi'li!” <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Bi'ngi' babayage panga Elia apitike, bi'ngi' babayage kwaali' yumo ywa alondoli ba Nnu'ngu' ba kwai'mbu' ateyu'ka. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Lakini Helode ngagania, “Yoani natikunsinja, tumbwe aywo nyai ywaniyu'wa makowe gake?” Apalage kummona mundu ywo.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:9">Yesu apeya kilyo balu' bandu elupu tano</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:9">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mal 6:30-44</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoa 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:9">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Feeding the 5000, distributing food - CN01718" file="FeedingThe5000(4000)-3DistributingFood_CN01718.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="9:9" /> <verse eid="LUK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Bai, balu' atumilwe bake pababuyangine, bammakiye Yesu makowe goti gabaapangite. Yesu ngabu'ka nabo mpaka papipi na Betisaida li'nga bakabee kisabe. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Lakini ipi'nga ya bandu paikwipwi kwayi'i, baatikummi'ngi'ya. Yesu ngaakemya no longela nabo makowe ga Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu', aatepwi balu' babapalage tepulwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Lisu'ba palyatumbwi pilya, bannyendeli balu' ku'mi na abi'li' bammakiye, “Walage bandu bayende kumisengo na kumigunda ya papipi, bakapate kilyo na muugonjo, kwa mwanjaa pano patubile, palupu'ngu'ti'.” <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Lakini Yesu ngaabakia, “Mwapei mwenga kilyo.” Bannyangwi, “Twenga ntu'pu' kili'be sosoti, twigali na makati matano na omba abi'li'. Kwaali', tuyende twabene, tukaapi'mi kilyo bandu boti!” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Palu', kwai na annalu'me kati maelupu matano. Bai, Yesu ngaabakia banamasi' bake, “Mwabakiye bandu batame muipi'nga ya mitumbi amusini amusini.” <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Banamasi' baapangite kati mwababakiyilwe, baatamike mwitamo boti. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Bu'kapo, Yesu agatweti galu' makati matano na balu' omba abi'li', aalingite kunani na kwilu'bya balaka, kwimetwana na apei banamasi' bake li'nga baapei bandu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Bandu boti baatilya no yukuta, na yaiigile baakongoli muitu'ndu', yatwi'li ku'mi na ibi'li'.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petili annyi'ki'tya Yesu panga nga Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat 16:13-19</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mal 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Lisu'ba limo Yesu aabile kisake kalu'ba, na banamasi' bake babile papipi nakwe. Bai, ngaalaluya, “Bandu banibaya nenga na nyai?” <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Nabembe ngabannyangwa, “Bi'ngi' babaya panga wenga wa Yoani Ywabatisage, bi'ngi' Elia, bi'ngi' yumo kati ya alondoli ba Nnu'ngu' ba kwai'mbu' balu' babayu'kite.” <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Apo ngalaluya, “Na mwenga buli, munibaya nenga na nyai?” Petili ngayangwa, “Wenga nga wa Kilisitu wa Nnu'ngu' Nkulungwa ywabayilwe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alongelya abali ya kiwo sake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mat 16:20-28</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Mal 8:30-9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Kai', Yesu ngaaking'indya na kwakanikia panga kanebammakiye mundu ywoywoti likowe lyo, <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />ngayendelya baya, “Mwana wa Mundu apalikwa apate ngu'su'mbu' yansima no kanilwa na api'ndo, api'ndo ba dini, na balimu ba salya no bulagilwa. Lakini lisu'ba lyenetatu bu'ka kiwo sake, alu'a yu'ka.” <verse eid="LUK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Payomwi po, ngaabakia bandu boti, “Mundu ywoywoti mana kapala panga mwanamasi' wangu', aikane mwene, aupu'twe nsalaba wake kila lisu'ba, na anibi'ngi'ye. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Kwa mwanjaa mundu ywapala kuukombwa bwu'mi wake mwene alu'a kuobeya, lakini ywauobeya kwa kitumbu sangu' alu'a kuukombwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Kwani kiyongeya namani, mundu ba nawo utayili woti wa dunia kwa kwiobeya mwene? Niibona ntu'pu' so pata. <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Mundu mana kanibi'kya oni nenga na gano ganiyi'gana, Mwana wa Mundu alu'a kummi'kya oni mundu ywo nsimu walu'a isa laya utukupu wake na wa Tati' bake na wa malaika apeleteu. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Nimmakianga kakape panga, kubi na bi'ngi' papanopano baapanga banawaali wangali kuubona Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu'.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:27">Yesu agalambuka kuminyo</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:27">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat 17:1-8</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mal 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:27">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Transfiguration - GT00032" file="Transfiguration_Mat17.1-9_GT00032.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Gordon Thompson © Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc., 2012." ref="9:27" /> <verse eid="LUK 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Paliikite lisu'ba lya nane bu'ka palongei go, Yesu aayi'i na Petili, Yoani na Yakobi mpaka kukitu'mbi', akwo aayi'i lu'ba Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Paalu'bage kuminyo yake kwatigalambuka, na magu'bo gake gaabile mauu no ng'alang'atya muno. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Na bandu abi'li' baabonekine kabalongela nakwe, na bo bai Musa na Elia. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Bandu bo pabaapitike babile na utukupu, balongei nakwe bu'kana na kiwo sake, sembe kilu'e yomolya gabini Nnu'ngu' akwo ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Petili na aine baatopilwe na lugono, ata nyo pabayumwike baubweni utukupu wake, na balu' abi'li' babaayi'mi pamope nakwe. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Bai, bandu bo abi'li' pabaabile kababu'ka, Petili aammakiye Yesu, “Mpi'ndo, yanogeleli twenga tukatama pano! Bai, tusenge isewe itatu, simo sako, simo sa Musa na si'ngi' sa Elia.” Kwo baya nyo kakape, aakitangiteli salongelage.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Petili palongelage go, aapangite minyo ku'pi'li'. Lyunde ngalielya na kwawi'ki'lya, na lyunde lyo palyaisilile, balu' banamasi', baatiyogopa muno. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Lilobe lyayu'wanike bu'ka kulyunde, “Ayu' nga Mwana wangu' ywaninsawile, mumpi'kani ywembe.” <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Bu'ka paliyu'wanike lilobe lyo, Yesu aabonekine ai kisake. Banamasi' baatami liki, bammakiyeli mundu ywoywoti makowe go.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu antepwa mwana mwene moka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat 17:14-18</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mal 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Pamalau' yake pabaelyage bu'ka kukitu'mbi', kipi'nga kiku'lu' sa bandu sakwembine na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Apo, mundu yumo mukipi'nga si'lu', ngakatuya lilobe aabaite, “Mwalimu, nendakulu'ba sonde li'li'li' unninguli mwana wangu'. Mwana wangu' we yu'yu' bai! <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Moka endagakunnyingilya na kumpanga apange ndu'ti, annyi'ya kyundaunda na kumpiya matutume munkano. Mana annyingilile, endakuntesa muno na annekali kiyu'ngu'ya. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Naalu'bite banamasi' bako bakammi'nge, lakini baakombwili.” <verse eid="LUK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yesu ngabaya, “Mwenga mwa lubelekwo lulau na lwangali u'bi'lya! Nilu'a tama na mwenga na kunkomeya, mpaka pakubawi? Unnete mwana wako pano.” <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Mwana ywo payendage kwa Yesu, yu'lu' moka ngantu'ya pai' na kunnyi'ya kyundaunda. Lakini Yesu ammi'ngite yu'lu' moka kwa yu'lu' mwana na kuntepwa, kwapeya tati' bake. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Bandu boti bausangalike uweso nku'lu' wa Nnu'ngu'.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu alongela kai' abali ya kiwo sake</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17:22-23</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mal 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Balu' bandu pabasangalage goti gaagapangite Yesu, aabakiye banamasi' bake, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Muyu'we masikilo mugayu'we makowe gano. Mwana wa Mundu ayenda songelwa, no yingya mumaboko ga bandu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Lakini bembe baatangiteli kikomekeyo sa nnongelo wo. Likowe li' lyatiiyilwa li'nga baakane tanga, nabembe baayogwipe kunnaluya panga, alombolya buli bu'kana na nnongelo wo.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:45">Nyai ywabile nku'lu'?</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:45">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18:1-5</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mal 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:45">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus with 7 disciples and child - CN01734" file="JesusWith7Disciples&amp;Child_CN01734.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="9:45" /> <verse eid="LUK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Kwai na ntau kati ya balu' banamasi', kwa abali yo laluyana panga nyai pakati yabe ywabile nku'lu' kulikoni boti. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yesu pagatangite gabaganiage mumyoyo yabe, ngantola mwana nsimana na kummi'ka papipi na mwene. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Ngaabakia, “Mundu ywoywoti ywampokya mwana nsene yu' kwa lina lyangu' anipokya nenga, na ywoywoti ywanipokya nenga ampokya ywanitumike. Kwa mwanjaa yu'lu' ywabile nsene kuliko boti pakati yinu, ywembe nga nku'lu' kulikoni boti.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ywagau'bi'lya gamugapanga mubile nakwe pamope</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mal 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Yoani ngalongela, “Mpi'ndo, tumweni mundu yumo kabi'nga moka kwa lina lyako, na twenga twapayite kunkanikia mwanjaa, ywembe aabileli mukipi'nga situ.” <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Lakini Yesu ngammakia, “Kanemunkanikiye, yu'lu' ywakotoka taukana na mwenga, aywo ai pamope namwenga.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asamalia bakana kumpokya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Pauegeli nsimu wu'lu' wa Yesu pu'tu'lwa kunani, ywembe aabini ayende ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Bai, ngatuma bandu bannongoli nabembe ngabayenda. Bayingi pakilambo simo sa Asamalia pala bakammi'ki makowe wisowiso. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Lakini benekaya ba po bapaili kumpokya, kwa mwanjaa ywembe ayendage ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Bai, banamasi' bake Yoani na Yakobi pabagabweni go, ngababaya, “Bwana, upala twamulise mwoto uuluke bu'ka kunani walangamise?” <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Lakini ywembe ngaagalambukya na kwakalipya. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Baabu'i palu' no yenda kukilambo si'ngi'.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwileka yoti kunki'ngama Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Pabaabile mumwanja, mundu yumo aammakiye Yesu, “Nalu'a kuki'ngama kwokwoti kwawayenda.” <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesu ngabaya, “Ibweya babile na mapango gabe go tama, na iyuni iyumba yabe, lakini Mwana wa Mundu ywembe ntu'pu' pogonjo.” <figure style="fig" alt="Fox &amp; Young in hole - BK00051" file="Fox&amp;YoungInHole_Mat8.20_BK00051.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="9:58" /><verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Wayomwi po, aammakiye mundu ywi'ngi', “Uniki'ngame.” Lakini mundu ywo ngayangwa, “Bwana, uniyi'ki'ti'ye wi'ti' nikasike tati' bangu'.” <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesu ngayangwa, “Waleke babawile basikane bene na bene, lakini wenga uyende ukaale makowe ga Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu'.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Na mundu ywi'ngi' aatikummakia, “Bwana, naalu'a kubi'ngi'ya lakini uniyi'ki'ti'ye wi'ti' nikaalage bandu ba kasangu',” <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesu ngammakia, “Ywoywoti ywakamwa lingumbo, na katumbwa li'ma ku'no kalinga nsu'gu', aywo apwaikali kwa Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu'.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu atuma banamasi' sabini na abi'li'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Bu'kapo, Bwana aasawi bi'ngi' sabini na abi'li' ngaatuma abi'li' abi'li', li'nga balongoli kila pandu paabini mwene yenda. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Aatikwabakia, “Mauno gatwi'la, lakini auni bali'nganali. Kwa nyo, munnu'be Bwana mwene nng'unda alete auni munng'unda wake. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Nambi'yambi' muyende, lakini mutange panga nintumanga kati bana ba ngondolo babayenda pakatikati ya mapu'mbe. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Kanemupu'twe likanda wala linyamanda wala ilatu, kai', mundi'la kanemumpange mundu abali. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Na kila nsengo wamulu'a yingya mwatumbwe kwapanga abali kamwabakia, ‘Amani ibe pansengo wu'no.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Na mana kubi na mwana wa amani, amani yinu ilu'a igala nakwe, na manaitei ntu'pu', ilu'a kummuyangania mwabene. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Bai, mutame pansengo wowowo kamulya no nywa samwapeyelwa, kwa mwanjaa mpangakasi apeyelwa liposo lyake. Kanemuyangangane muutamo, li'no nsengo wu'no malau' wu'lu'! <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Mana mwikite pakilambo nsi'si', bandu manabankemile, mwalye yabampeya. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Mwatepwe atamwe bababile kwo, mwabakiye bandu, ‘Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu' umwegelile mwenga.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Lakini mana mwikite pakilambo sosoti, mana bakani kunkemya, mwabu'ke na mana kampi'ta mumali'la gabe mubaye, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘Ata lyu'ku'mbi' lya kilambo sinu lyalinamati mumagu'lu' gitu, twendapaapata kwo kana kwinu. Lakini mutange panga Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu' wegelile.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Nimmakianga panga lisu'ba lyo, kilambo so salu'a baa mmaule kulikoni galu' ga bandu ba Sodoma.<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwakibona mwamisengo mwamukana kumuyangania Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mat 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />“Wakibona wenga wa Kolazini! Wakibona wenga wa Betisaida! Kenda mangelongelo gagapangike kasinu gakapangika ku'lu' Tilo na Sidoni, sai'no bawati mabunia bu'ka palipite no tama muligu kababuyangania kwa Nnu'ngu' wabe. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Ata nyo lisu'ba lyo senulwa, mwenga mwasenuka paku'lu kulikoni Tilo na Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Nawenga wa Kapernaumu buli! Ulu'a kwikatuya mpaka kunani? Ulu'a tu'mbu'yi'lwa mpaka kumambi'.”<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Aayendeli baya, “Ywampi'kania mwenga, anipi'kania nenga na yu'lu' ywakana kumpokya mwenga, akana kunipokya nenga. Na ywoywoti ywakana kunipokya, akana kumpokya yu'lu' ywanitumike.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balu' sabini na abi'li' bendabuya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Bu'kapo balu' sabini na abi'li', ngabaki'li'bu'ka ku'no kabanapusika, “Bwana, ata moka gendatuyu'wa kwa lina lyako.” <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yesu ngaabakia, “Naamweni Ibilisi katu'mbu'ka bu'ka kunani kati njai. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Nimpeyangite amuli yo li'bata nng'ambo na ipi'li'li' na makakala goti ga yu'lu' ndumu, kai' ntu'pu' kikowe sakilu'a kunsulu. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Lakini kanemunapusike mwanjaa moka gendakunnyu'wa ila, munapusike kwa mwanjaa maina ginu gandikilwe kunani.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pulaa ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat 11:25-27</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Popopo, Yesu ngakwi'ndi'lya kwa Loo Mpeleteu aabaite, “Nendakunsukulu Mwa Tati', Bwana wa kunani na padunia, kwa mwanjaa makowe ga, mwaiyite bene ikima na malango, kwatambulya bana anangu'ta. Eloo Tati', kwa mwanjaa mo ngamwamupai.”<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Bu'kapo ngabaya, “Tati' bangu' banikamukiye ili'be yoti. Ntu'pu' ywantangite Mwana ila Tati', Kai' ntu'pu' ywatangite Tati' ila Mwana, na ywoywoti yu'lu' Mwana apendi kuntambulya.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Bu'kapo ngaatendebukya banamasi' bake ngalongela nabo pakiyi'ki'ya, “Nantali babagabona gano gamugabona mwenga! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Nimmakianga kakape, alondoli ba Nnu'ngu' na akulungwa, baapai kugabona galu' gamugabona mwenga na gamugayu'wa. Lakini bagabwenili na bagayu'wineli.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukongo lwa Nsamalia nnogau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Bu'kapo mundu yumo wa salya aatiyi'ma na kunnaluya, kapala kumpi'ndi'ka, “Mwalimu, nipange buli li'nga niupate ukoto wangayomoka?” <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Ywembe ngannyangwa, “Iandikilwe buli musalya? Wenga utanga buli?” <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Mwalimu wa salya ngannyangwa, <char style="qt">“Umpende Bwana Nnu'ngu' wako kwa mwoyo wako woti, kwa loo yako yoti, kwa makakala gako goti na kwa malango gako goti. Na umpende ywapapipi yako, kati mwawipenda wamwene.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yesu ngammakia, “Mwoyangwile unogiye! Upange nyo nawenga walu'a lama.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Lakini mwanjaa ywembe apalage kwibalangilya panga nnogau, annalwiye Yesu, “Na mundu wa papipi yangu' nga ywaku'?” <figure style="fig" alt="Good Samaritan, priest passing by - WA03860" file="GoodSamaritan_2PassingByOnOtherSide_Luke10.31-32_WA03860.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="10:29" /> <verse eid="LUK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesu ngannyangwa, “Mundu yumo aelyage bu'ka ku Yelusalemu yenda ku Yeliko. Payendage, mundi'la, aayingililwe na makatauluma, bampokonywi ili'be yake yoti, kunneka wausu na kunku'mbwa, bannei aindwike. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Nembe mpi'ndo yumo wa dini kapi'ta pandi'la yi'yi'lu'yi'lu', apite mbwega ku'no kammona. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Nembe Mlawi yumo, paikite pandu po, apite mbwega mbwega ku'no kammona. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Lakini mundu yumo Nsamalia ywabile mumwanja wake, paikite pabile yu'lu' mundu aammi'ki kiya. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Atikunnyendelya na kunnyangatia, kwa kunnyi'ya mauta na wi'mbi' wa njabibu na kuntabya itambala. Wayomwi go, ngamwu'bu'ya mumbu'nda wake na kumpeleka kunyumba ya ageni yenda kummu'bu'ya. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Pamalau' yake ngampeya mbanje dinali ibi'li' yu'lu' mwene nsengo, no lagana nakwe panga, ‘Ummu'bu'ye mundu yu', na sosoti sawalu'a tumya kai', nalu'a kuli'pa kibuyo.’” <figure style="fig" alt="Good Samaritan - GT00071b" file="GoodSamaritanW_Luke10.30-37_GT00071b.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Gordon Thompson © Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc., 2012." ref="10:35" /> <verse eid="LUK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Bu'kapo Yesu aatilaluya, “Kati ya bandu bo atatu, ywaku' ywabonekine panga mundu wa papipi ywa yu'lu' ywayingililwe na balu' makatauluma?” <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Yu'lu' mwalimu wa salya ngayangwa, “Yu'lu' ywammi'ki kiya nga mundu ywa papipi.” Yesu ngammakia, “Uyende, ukapange nyinyonyo.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 10:37">Yesu kasake Malita na Malia</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Martha and Mary with Jesus" file="CN01750C.TIF" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © 1996 David C. Cook" ref="10:37" /> <verse eid="LUK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Pabaabile mumwanja, baaikite kukilambo simo na nnwawa yumo ywakemelwa Malita, ankemi kasake. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Malita aabile na nnunawe ywakemelwage Malia, ayu' aatami papipi na Yesu, kapi'kania gayi'ganage. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Lakini Malita ywembe aiauyage na makowe gambone ga nng'eni. Bai, ngannyendelya Yesu ngammakia, “Bwana, wenga wibona sawasawa nnunangu' anileka niauke kisangu'? Ummakiye aniyangatiye.” <verse eid="LUK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Lakini Bwana annyangwi, “Malita, Malita, wendakwiauya na kwisuluya kwa makowe maingi. <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Kikowe simo bai nga sangama. Malia asawi kikowe sangama muno, na sembe apokonyolwali.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ayi'gana ndi'la yo salya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat 6:9-13</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Lisu'ba limo, Yesu aabile pandu nsi'si' kalu'ba Nnu'ngu'. Payomwi lu'ba, yumo bu'ka mukipi'nga sa banamasi' bake aatikummakia, “Bwana, tukulu'ba utuyi'gane lu'ba Nnu'ngu' kati Yoani Ywabatisage mwayi'ganiye banamasi' bake.” <verse eid="LUK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yesu aabakiye, “Pamulu'ba Nnu'ngu' mubaye nnyanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Tati' bitu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mayi'gi'yo “ba kunani” na mayi'gi'yo gi'ngi', gabileli mumaandiko malongoi ga Bibilia ya Luka.</char></note>, lina linu likwi'yi'lwe, ukulungwa winu wise.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Mutupei kilyo situ sa kila lisu'ba.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Mutusami masambi gitu, kati twenga mwatwasamya babatukosile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">kai' kanemutuyi'ngiye mumakowe ga kutupaya.’”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 11:4">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Man knocking on door - CN02111" file="ManKnockingOnDoor_CN02111.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="11:4" /> <verse eid="LUK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Kai' ngaabakia, “Tubaye yumo mukipi'nga sinu aabile na mbwigalye, nembe annyendeli kasake meku, na kummakia, ‘Mbwiga, sonde li'li'li' uniyaiki makati gatatu. <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />Mbwiga lyangu' aai mumwanja api'ti kasangu', nanenga ntu'pu' sa kumpeya.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Nembe paabile nnyumba ngannyangwa, ‘Ngani kunisuluya! Ne niyigile niango wangu'! Yi'no saa yo gonja nenga na bana bangu', nikupeyali, ubu'ke bai!’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Tubaye apala yumuka kumpeya kwa mwanjaa ywembe mbwigalye lili, ila kwa mwanjaa mundu ywo aayendeli kunnu'ba, alu'a katuka ampei sosoti sakipala. <verse eid="LUK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Kwa nyo, nimmakianga mulu'be namwenga mwapeyelwa, mupale namwenga mwapata. Mupange u'li, namwenga mwayu'gu'li'lwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Kwa mwanjaa ywoywoti ywalu'ba ngaywapeyelwa, ywapala ngaywapata na ywapanga u'li, ngaywayu'gu'li'lwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Ywaku' kasinu mana mwana wake aalu'bite tati' bake omba, alu'a kumpeya nng'ambo ayu'ye omba? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Na mana alu'bite lipinga kitiwi, alu'a kumpeya kipi'li'li'? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Kati mwenga mwamubile mwaalau, mumanyi kwapeya bana binu ikowe inannoga, nga munomuno Tati' binu ba kunani, balu'a kwapeya Loo Mpeleteu balu' babannu'ba.”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Belisebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat 12:22-30</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mal 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Lisu'ba limo Yesu abi'ngage moka ywagampangite mundu yumo kaneakombwe longela. Bai, ago moka pagammu'i, aywo mundu ngakombwa longela, kipi'nga sa bandu satisangala. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Lakini bandu bi'ngi' pakipi'nga sabe baabaike, “Abi'nga moka kwa uweso wa Belisebuli, mpi'ndo wa moka.” <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Bi'ngi' baatikumpaya li'nga apange mangelongelo itanganikwe panga ayi'ki'tilwe bu'ka kunani. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Lakini mwanjaa ywembe aagatangite gabaganiage, ngaabakia, “Ukulungwa wowoti waubaganike ipi'nga yaitaukana, ukombwali konda. Nga mwalubile lukolo lwolwoti lwaluyu'mana, lusi'yali langanyika. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Mana Ibilisi kaitaukya mwene, ukulungwa wake ulu'a yi'ma kitiwi? Mubaya buli nde, panga nibi'nga moka kwa uweso wa Belisebuli? <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Mana kanibi'nga moka kwa uweso wa Belisebuli, bamwatuma mwenga babi'nga kwa uweso wa nyai? Kwa kitumbu so, bembe ngabalu'a kunkania mwenga mwabu'su'. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Lakini mana kanibi'nga moka kwa uweso wa Nnu'ngu', bai mutange panga Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu' uyomwike ika kasinu.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />“Mundu mwene makakala, pali'ndi'la nsengo wake kwa yombo yo li'ndi'lya, mali yake yoti ipanga ngoto. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Lakini mana aisile ywampi'ta kwa makakala na kunnyingilya, ampokonywa yombo yo li'ndi'lya yaiu'bi'lyage na mali yake kwibagana. <verse eid="LUK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Ywoywoti ywakotoka lu'mbana nanenga endanitaukya, na ywoywoti ywakotoka kongolya pamope nanenga, endayanjaya.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buyangania kwa moka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />“Moka pammu'ka mundu, ati'li'tati'li'ta mulupu'ngu'ti' kapala pandu po pu'mu'lya, mana akotwike pata aibakia mwene, ‘Nilu'a buyangania kasangu' kwanibu'i.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Lakini pabuyangana, na kuikolya nyumba ntu'pu' kili'be ipyagililwe no nemekelwa na nkati yake ntu'pu' ywatama. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Bai, ayenda kwakoka moka aine saba alau pi'ta ywembe, boti bayenda kunnyingya mundu ywo. Kwa nyo, ali ya mundu ywo yaakala muno kulikoni mwayaabile.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pulaa ya kakape</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Palongelage go, nnwawa yumo pakipi'nga si'lu' sa bandu ngatu'ndu'bi'ya lilobe lyake no baya, “Nantali nnwawa ywakupapite na kukuyongeya.” <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Lakini Yesu ngabaya, “Nantali muno balu' babapi'kania liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu' na kulikamwa.”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bapala mwasu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Kipi'nga sa bandu pakiyendelyage isa Yesu aatikwabakia, “Lubelekwo lu'no lwene sambi lupala lulole mwasu, lakini lupeyelwali lola, mwasu wabaubweni kwa nnondoli Yona, uli'ngani. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Kati mu'lu' Yona mwabile mwasu kwa bandu ba ku Ninawi, nyinyonyo na Mwana wa Mundu ngamwalu'a panga mwasu kwa lubelekwo lu'no. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Malikia wa Seba alu'a pitya Nsimu wo ukumilwa lubelekwo lu'no. Nembe alu'a kuluukumu kwa mwanjaa lubile na masambi. Mwanjaa ywembe aaisi bu'ka kuutalu li'nga api'kani mayi'gi'yo gene malango ga Selemani, na aaisi kwipwa panga, kumbe pano pabile na nku'lu' kulikoni Selemani. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Bandu ba Ninawi balu'a yi'ma nsimu wo ukumilwa. Nabembe balu'a luukumu lubelekwo lu'no panga lubile na masambi. Kwa mwanjaa bembe bammuyangani Nnu'ngu' bu'kana na maalo ga Yona, na kumbe pano pabile na nku'lu' kulikoni Yona.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 11:32">Bweya wa yi'ga</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 11:32">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5:15</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 11:32">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Lamp at night - HK00151" file="LampAtNight_HK00151.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="11:32" /> <verse eid="LUK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />“Ntu'pu' mundu ywakoya kimuli na kukiwi'ki'lya mmu'ngu' au mukitu'ndu', ila akiu'bu'ya patu'ndu'bau, li'nga bandu babayingya nnyumba bapate kuubona bweya. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Liyo lyako nga kimuli sa yi'ga yako, mana libile likoto, yi'ga yako yoti yalu'a ba mubweya. Liyo lyako mana libile litu'lu'ka na yi'ga yako nayembe ilu'a ba mulubi'ndu'. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Wili'ndi'le lelo na bweya waubile nkati yako, wakane yu'ka lubi'ndu'. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Bai, manaitei yi'ga yako yoti ibile mubweya, pangali ba pandu popoti pene lubi'ndu', nawenga walu'a baa mubweya munomuno kati mu'lu' mwaupanga bweya wa kimuli.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aabi'kya lukolo Mafalisayo na balimu ba salya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23:1-36</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mal 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Yesu paabile kalongela, Mfalisayo yumo ankemi kilyo kasake, nembe ngayenda lya. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Aywo Mfalisayo asangalike kummona kalya pangali uluga masi' mumaboko, kwa mwanjaa yayi'ki'tilweli musalya. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Bwana ngammakia, “Mwenga mwa Mafalisayo, mumanyi gu'lwa nnobo na nkungu kunja, lakini nkati yake kutwi'li bwimi no akala mwoyo. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Mwenga mwalogeloge! Buli, nengite Nnu'ngu' ywatengenise panja, nga ywatengenise nkati? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Mwapei aki'ba yi'lu' ili'be yaibile nkati ya myoyo yinu na yi'ngi' yoti yapanga alali yinu.”<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />“Lakini, mwakibona Mafalisayo, kwa mwanjaa mupiya lumo kwa ku'mi ata maakapi ga ndakyo ya ilyo, ndebele na maakapi gi'ngi'. Lakini mugaleka makowe gagakong'ondya aki na kumpenda Nnu'ngu'. Mugakamwe makowe ga, pangali kugalibalya galu' gi'ngi'. <verse eid="LUK 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />Mwakibona mwenga mwa Mafalisayo, kwa mwanjaa mupendi tama nnu'ngi' pandu paisima amo mumayumba ga kunnu'ba Nnu'ngu' no pangilwa abali kwa isima pakipi'nga sa bandu. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Mwakibona, kwa mwanjaa mulandana na masiko gangali i'mbya maliwe, bandu bapi'ta panani yake pangali tanga ubolau wabauli'bata.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Yumo mukipi'nga sa balimu ba salya ngammakia, “Mwalimu, makowe golongela, twenga wendatupwi'wa.” <verse eid="LUK 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesu annyangwi panga, “Mwakibona mwenga mwabalimu ba salya, kwa mwanjaa mwatwi'ka bandu igombo yangali pu'tu'li'ka, ku'no mwabene mukombwali ata golwa lukonji lumo kwayangatia. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Mwakibona, kwa mwanjaa musengya masiko ga alondoli ba Nnu'ngu' balu' babaabulagilwe na api'ndo binu. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Kwa nyo, mukong'ondelya panga, muyi'ki'tile mwabapangite api'ndo binu, bembe bai abulagi ba abo alondoli ba Nnu'ngu', na mwenga musengya masiko gabe. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Kwa nyo, ikima ya Nnu'ngu' yabaite nnyinyo, ‘Nalu'a kwapelekya alondoli na atumilwe ba Nnu'ngu', lakini bi'ngi' balu'a kwabulaga na bi'ngi' kwapeya ngu'su'mbu'.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Bu'kana na makowe ga lubelekwo lu'no lwalu'a pwatilwa, kwa mwanjaa myai ya alondoli boti ba Nnu'ngu' yaiyitanike bu'ka palutumbwi dunia, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />bu'ka yitanika kwa myai ya Abeli mpaka yi'lu' ya Zakalia, yu'lu' ywabulagilwe mu Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu', pakati ya kibi'ki'lyo na pandu papeleteu. Nimmakianga, Kakape lubelekwo lu'no lwalu'a pwatilwa kwa makowe go. <verse eid="LUK 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />Mwakibona, mwenga mwa balimu ba salya! Kwa mwanjaa mwiyite si'lu' kiyu'gu'lyo sa niango wo yi'ganilwa, mwabene muyingili na mwakanikiye babayingyage kanebayingi.” <verse eid="LUK 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Paabu'i palu', balu' Mafalisayo na balimu ba salya, baatumbwi kunnyingilya kwa kunnaluya maswali gambone kwa ukali', <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />kabampi'ndi'ka li'nga bannyonje kwa malongelo gake bapate kitumbu sa kunsongya.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Likalipyo kitumbu sa unapiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Bandu maelupu baatikusikana no li'batana, Yesu aatumbwi wi'ti' kwabakia banamasi' bake, “Mwili'ndi'le na uyi'me wa ulu'u wa Mafalisayo nga unapiki. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Lakini ntu'pu' sakiwi'ki'lilwe, sasaakotoka umukulwa, kila sakiyu'bite salu'a kwipulwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Kwa nyo, kila samulongei mulubi'ndu', bandu balu'a kiyu'wa pabweya, na kila gamulongei kwo yu'yu'tana kuungati milyango iyigalilwe, galu'a bayilwa panani ya mwagala wa nyumba.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ywapalikwa yogopelwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mat 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />“Nimmakianga mwenga mwa mambwiga bangu', kanemwayogope balu' babakombwa bulaga yi'ga bai, lakini bakombwali yendelya panga kikowe si'ngi' mana babulige. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Nilu'a kummakianga yu'lu' ywapalikwa kunnyogopa, Munnyogope yu'lu' ywakombwa bulaga na kuntaikulya mundu kumwoto. Eloo, nimmakianga munnyogope ywo. <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Itanganikwe panga injosi tano ipi'mi'yi'lwa kwa ela njene muno, au nyonyoli? Lakini nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu', alibalilwali ata yumo. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Lakini ata nywili ya mumitwe yinu ibalangilwe yoti. Kanemuyogope, mwenga nga mwampu'ku'bi'la kulikoni injosi yambone.<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunnyi'ki'tya na kunkana Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mat 10:32-33</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />“Nimmakianga kakape, kila mundu ywaniyi'ki'tya nnu'ngi' ya bandu panga ywembe ywangu', Mwana wa Mundu nembe alu'a kunnyi'ki'tya nnu'ngi' ya malaika ba Nnu'ngu' panga mundu ywo ywake. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Lakini mundu ywoywoti ywanikana nnu'ngi' ya bandu, nembe alu'a kanilwa nnu'ngi' ya malaika ba Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="LUK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />“Ywoywoti ywalongela likowe lyo kana kunnyi'ki'tya Mwana wa Mundu, alu'a samilwa, lakini ywannongelya ubu'su' Loo Mpeleteu, alu'a samilwali.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />“Pabampelekanga mwenga nnu'ngi' ya mayumba ga kunnu'ba Nnu'ngu' na nnu'ngi' ya api'ndo na atawala, kanemwalendeme gania panga mukaikengya, au mukayangwa buli. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Kwa mwanjaa popopo, Loo Mpeleteu alu'a kunnyi'gana si'lu' samupalilwa yangwa.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukongo lwa tayili nnogeloge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Mundu yumo palu' pakipi'nga sa bandu aatikummakia, “Mwalimu, ummakiye nnunangu' yu', tubagane ulisi wabatuleki tati'.” <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yesu annyangwi, “Mbwiga, nyai ywanibi'i nenga panga na mundu wa kwakenga au kwa awana pakati yinu?”<verse eid="LUK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Bai, ngaabakia boti, “Mwili'ndi'le na kila uyi'me wa bwimi, kwa mwanjaa ukoto wa mundu ubu'kanali no yoloka kwa ili'be yabile nayo.” <figure style="fig" alt="Rich Fool Bigger barns - DN00481" file="RichFool_1BiggerBarns_Luke12.15-19_DN00481.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Darwin Dunham © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="12:12" /> <verse eid="LUK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Bu'kapo, ngaalongelya kwa lukongo lu'no, “Kwabile na tayili yumo ywembe munng'unda wake aatimeya munomuno. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Tayili ywo, aganiyite pamwoyo wake, ‘Nilu'a panga buli nanenga ntu'pu' ligu'lu' lyo bi'kya ilyo yangu'? <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Nilu'a panga nyo, nilu'a sengwana tugu'lu' twangu' tuketuke no senga ligu'lu' liku'lu' amo nganilu'a bi'ka ilyo yangu' yoti yaniunike na mali yangu'. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Apo, naubakia mwoyo wangu' panga pano le ubile na sobi'ki'ya, no tumya myaka yambone, no ponda mali bai, lya, nywa, no napusika.’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Lakini Nnu'ngu' ngammakia, ‘Wenga wa nnogeloge, kilo sa li'no, bwu'mi wako wendatolelwa. Na ili'be yi'lu' yoti yowitwi'li'kiye, ilu'a panga ya nyai?’” <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Yesu ayomoli kwo baya, “Amo ngamwabile mundu ywaitwi'li'ki'ya mali kwa makowe gake mwene bai, lakini nki'ba nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu'.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwu'bi'li Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Bu'kapo Yesu aabakiye banamasi' bake, “Kwa kitumbu so nendakummakianga, kanemube na kyukala ati' kilyo twapata kwaku', au alu'a kutuwalika nyai? <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Kwa mwanjaa nantali bwu'mi kulikoni kilyo, yi'ga nantali kuliko ngu'bo. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Mwalinge mwababile iyuni. Bapandangali wala baunali, kai' ntu'pu' ligu'lu' lyolyoti. Ata nyo Nnu'ngu' aayimali ilyo endakwayakia. Mwenga mwampu'ku'bi'la kuliko iyuni! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Nyai mukipi'nga sinu ywakombwa lumya kwa kwiauya no kombwa yongeya kwaali' pasene masu'ba ga bwu'mi wake? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Bai, manaitei mukombwali panga likowe lisene kati lyo, mwanjaa namani muba na kyukala kwa galu' gi'ngi'? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Mugalinge malu'ba mwagalembulya! Gapangali kasi kai' gaiwalikali. Lakini nimmakianga, ata Nkulungwa Selemani mwene na utayili waabile nawo na magu'bo gawalage, anaikali paugolou wa lilu'ba limo. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Manaitei Nnu'ngu' akombwa kuliwalika nyo lyamba lya munng'unda, lyembe li'no libile na malau' lyalu'a taikulwa palitu'ta no tinika mwoto. Buli, kangi' alu'a kumpangya muno mwenga? Mwenga mwa bandu ba imani njene!<verse eid="LUK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />“Bai, kanemube na kyukala kwa kwiauya pala kilyo au so nywa. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Mwanjaa bandu bangali kuntanga Nnu'ngu' baukya go, na Tati' binu batangite panga makowe go gendapalilwa na mwenga. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Mupale wi'ti' Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu' na go gi'ngi' mwalu'a yongeyelwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utayili kunani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />“Kanemuyogope, mwenga mwakipi'nga kisene sa ngondolo, kwa mwanjaa Tati' binu bapendi kumpeyanga Ukulungwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Mupi'mi'yange mali yinu na mbanje ye mukaapei aki'ba. Mwitengenesi mipuko yangali otoka na kwibi'kya amana kunani, akwo ipu'ngwali. Akwo baii baegelyali kai' ngu'lu'ku'lu' baalabiyali. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Palu' paibile amana yako, nga pawaba na mwoyo wako.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Atumisi babatama wiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />“Mube tiyali, mutabite mikanda muibuno na imulikyo yinu itame kaiyaka. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Mutame kati atumisi babanni'nda bwana wabe abuyangane bu'ka kulisengele, li'nga mana bayu'wine ilulu bai, bannyu'gu'li nniango ayingi. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Nantali atumisi balu' bembe bwana wabe paabuyangana, akwemba kabakeleka! Kakape nendakummakianga, aywo bwana aibi'ka wiso na kwakemya pamesa li'nga balye. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Ata mana aabuyangana meku au kakusa na kwakwemba kabakeleka, nantali yabe atumisi bo! <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Mutange panga kenda mwene nyumba akatanga saa yaisa mwii, alu'e keleka na alu'e yi'ki'tyali kunneka ayingi no yiba. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Na mwenga nyinyonyo, mutame wiso kwa mwanjaa, Mwana wa Mundu alu'a isa saa yangatanganikwa.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntumisi ywa u'bi'li'ka na ywangali u'bi'li'ka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mat 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Petili ngalaluya, “Bwana, lukongo lu' utulongelya twenga bai au twa bandu boti?” <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Bwana ngayangwa panga, “Ywaku' ntumisi ywa u'bi'li'ka na mwene ikima, ywembe bwana wake alu'a kummi'ka panani ya atumisi bake li'nga aapei kilyo nsimu waupalilwa? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Nantali yake ntumisi ywo, manaitei bwana wake paaki'li'bu'ka alu'a kunkwemba kapanga nyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Kakape aalu'a kumwu'bu'ya na kumpanga ntawala wa amana yake yoti. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Lakini mana ntumisi ywo abaite pamwoyo wake, ‘Bwana wangu' asi'liye buyangana,’ ngatumbwa kwaku'mbwa atumisi aine analu'me na alwawa no lya, nywa no lobya, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />bwana wake aalu'a buyangana lisu'ba lyangali pi'kanilya na saa yangali tanganikwa, aalu'a kunku'mbwa muno ntumisi ywo na kumuukumu pamope na bangali u'bi'lya. <verse eid="LUK 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Ntumisi yu'lu' ywatanga mwapala bwana wake, lakini apangali gagapalilwa panga, aaputilwa munomuno. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Lakini ywapanga makowe gagampanga mundu asenuke pangali tanga, aaputilwa pasene. Ywapeyilwe yambone, aalu'a longelwa yambone, ywapeyilwe yambone muno, aalu'a longelwa yambone munomuno.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kitumbu so lekangana bandu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />“Niisi koya mwoto padunia, napendi ukapanga uyakite! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Nibile na ubatiso wanipalikwa niupoki, kwa ndi'la yaku' niiauye mpaka utimi! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Mukita niletike amani pano padunia? Ata pasene, amani lili, ila mayu'mano. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />No bu'ka nambi'yambi', mana kubile na alongo batano, balu'a baganika, ku'no abi'li' kwi'ngi' atatu au kwi'ngi' atatu, ku'no abi'li'. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Tati' balu'a yu'mana na mwana na mwana alu'a yu'mana na tati' bake, mau' bayu'mana na mwi'nja wabe na mwi'nja ayu'mana na mau' bake, mau' mukwe bayu'mana na nkamwana na nkamwana ayu'mana na mau' mukwe.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tanga nsimu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yesu ngaibakia kai' ipi'nga ya bandu, “Mana mugabweni maunde gayi'mi kulwingo lwa kundondi bai popopo mubaya, ‘Ula alu'a nia’, kakape endania. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Mana muubweni nsunga wa kusi kaupukatya mubaya, ‘Kwalu'a ba na lyoto muno,’ Na ngamwaipangika. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Mwenga mwa anapiki! Mumanyi londwa mumaumbile ga nni'ma na kumaunde, mukotoka ki'li' tanga maumbile ga nsimu wu'no?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Awana na andumu bako</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mat 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />“Kwa mwanjaa namani mukotoka kwiamulya mwabene panga likowe linannoga? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Mana ywa kusitakya, kakupeleka kukoliti, yabile male yomwana nakwe mubile mundi'la, akane kupeleka kwa akimu, nembe akimu akane kukukamukiya kwa asikali, nabembe bakane kuyingiya muutabilwe. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Kakape nikubakia, watama mo mpaka wayomwe li'pa lwela lwa kuundi'la.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Mugaleke masambi ginu au mwalu'a waa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Nsimu wo baaisi bandu nsi'si' kummakia Yesu abali ya ku Galilaya, kwa bandu bababulagilwe na Pilato pabaaisi na inyama yabe isinjilwe kwa salaka ya mu Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Nembe Yesu aatikwabakia, “Mwenga mubaya Agalilaya bo, bai na sambi kulikoni Agalilaya bi'ngi' ati' kwa mwanjaa batesilwe nyo? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Nimmakianga kakape panga, bapangiteli sambi kwapi'ta balu', lakini namwenga kati bobobo, mana mukotwike kunng'alambukya Nnu'ngu', mulu'a langanyika kati bembe. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Au balu' ku'mi na banane babaatu'mbu'kilwe na nsengo nku'lu' ku Siloamu no waa, mubaya bembe bai na masambi kulikoni bi'ngi' boti babatamage ku Yelusalemu? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Nimmakianga nyinyo lili, lakini na mwenga mana mukani kunng'alambukya Nnu'ngu', mulu'a langanyika kati bembe.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukongo lwa ntini wangali pambika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Bu'kapo Yesu ngaabakia lukongo lu'no, “Mundu yumo aabile na ntini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Awu' nkongo, ubonekana ku Isilaili na wembe upambika itunda yaili'li'lwa na bandu.</char></note> munng'unda wake, payi'i pala atu'mbwe itunda yake, aubweni unapambikali ata limo. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Bai, ngammakia mpangakasi wake, ‘Linga! Wu'no mwaka wenetatu nisa pankongo wu' pala nitu'mbwe itunda, lakini nalibonali lipambike ata limo! Upi'ngwe, uyomwa mbolya ya munng'unda bai pangali pambika.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Lakini mpangakasi annyangwi, ‘Bwana, tuuleke kai' mwaka wu'no, nilu'a kuuti'li'ti'ki'ya nkulyo upate masi' na kuyi'ya mbolya. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Mana waapambika manisa, twauleka, mana waapambikali twaupi'ngwa.’”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 13:9">Yesu antepwa mau' yumo Lisu'ba lya ya Sabato</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:9">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus heals on sabbath - WA03870" file="JesusHealsOnSabbath_Luke13.10-17_WA03870.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="13:9" /> <verse eid="LUK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Yesu endeyi'gana munyumba ya kunnu'ba Nnu'ngu' kulisu'ba lya Sabato ya Ayahudi. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Na po, kwabile na nnwawa yumo ntamwe kwa myaka ku'mi na minane aayingililwe na moka. Kwa mwanjaa nyo, ng'ongo wake waatilemala muno ata akombwageli yi'ma wi'ma. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Yesu pamweni aatikunkema ngammakia, “Mau', utamwe winu mutepulilwe.” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Aammi'ki maboko gake pantwe na popopo, yi'ga yake yapatike makakala go yi'ma kai' na ankwi'yite Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="LUK 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Lakini mpi'ndo wa nyumba ya kunnu'ba Nnu'ngu' aatiusika kitumbu sa Yesu kuntepwa mau' ywo lisu'ba lya Sabato ya Ayahudi. Kwa nyo, aabakiye bandu babaabile palu', “Mubile na masu'ba sita go panga kasi, bai mugatumi masu'ba go isapala pona matamwe ginu, lakini kanemwise lisu'ba lya Sabato ya Ayahudi.”<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Apo Bwana ngannyangwa, “Mwenga mwa anapiki! Nyai kwinu ywalu'e somwa yu'gu'lya ng'ombe bake au mbu'nda bake mukyu'ngu'lu' annongoye kunyweli wa masi' ata likabile lisu'ba lya Sabato ya Ayahudi? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Tumbwe pano kubile na mwi'nja wa Bulaimu, ywembe Ibilisi ampangite alemale kwa myaka ku'mi na minane. Buli, yanogeleli lili kunnyu'gu'lya muutabilwe wake lisu'ba lya Sabato ya Ayahudi?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Payomwi longela go, babantaukyage baibweni oni lakini bandu bi'ngi' boti batipulaika muno kwa makowe goti gaagapangite palu'.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 13:17">Lukongo lwa mbeyu njene</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 13:17">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mat 13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:17">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Mustard plant - GT00048" file="MustardPlant_Mark4.32_GT00048.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Gordon Thompson © Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc., 2012." ref="13:17" /> <verse eid="LUK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Yesu ngalaluya, “Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu' ulandana na namani? Nilu'a kuulandanisa na ki'li'? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Ubile kati lupeke lwa nkongo wa aladali, lwaalutweti mundu yumo na kulupanda munng'unda wake, lwatibalika no panga nkongo nku'lu'. Iyuni yaigu'lu'ka yakombwi senga iyumba yabe mundambi' yake.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukongo lwa ngelule</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13:31-32</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mal 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Ngalaluya kai', “Nilu'a kuulandanisa Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu' na namani? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Kati ngelule njene yaiyi'i mau' yumo na kuiyangabana pamope na bwembe mbisi tano, na bwembe woti waatilu'la.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Niango wo patimwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat 7:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yesu aayendeli na mwanja wake wa ku Yelusalemu, ku'no kapi'tya muilambo na mumili'ma, kayi'gana liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Mundu yumo ngannaluya, “Buli Bwana, bandu babaalu'a kosopolelwa baayoloka lili?” <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />Yesu ngaabakia, “Mukasane yingya kwo pi'tya niango waupatimwa, kwa mwanjaa nendakummakia, baingi balu'a paya yingya, lakini baakombwali. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Nsimu waisa, apo mwene nyumba alu'a katuka no yigala niango. Mwenga mwaalu'a yi'ma panja no panga u'li kamubaya, ‘Bwana, utuyu'gu'li.’ Lakini ywembe alu'a kunnyangwa, ‘Ndangiteli kwamubu'ka!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Na mwenga mwatumbwa kummakia, ‘Twenga ngatulyage no nywa pamope nawenga, kai' wenga uyi'ganage muilambo yitu.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Lakini ywembe alu'a baya, ‘Ndangiteli mwenga muuma kwaku', mubu'kange nnu'ngi' yangu' mwenga mwaboti mwapanga sambi.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Apo, ngapasapanga kili'lo no yaga mino, pamwabona ki Bulaimu, Isaki, Yakobi na alondoli ba Nnu'ngu', boti babile mu Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu', lakini mwenga mwabene, mutaikulilwe panja! <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Bandu balu'a isa bu'ka kumbwani na kundondi, kukibu'la na kusi no tama pakilyo ku Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Eloo, balu' babalongolile baalu'a panga ba kuundi'la na balu' ba kuundi'la baalu'a longolya.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akiyendelya kiwo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Wakati wowowo, Mafalisayo bi'ngi' baatikunyendelya na kummakia, “Ubu'ke pano uyende kwi'ngi' kundu, kwa mwanjaa Helode apala kukubulaga.” <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesu ngayangwa, “Muyende mukammakiye aywo kibweya nng'anga nnyanya, ‘Li'no na malau' nilu'a bi'nga moka na kwatepwa atamwe na lisu'ba lyenetatu nilu'a yomolya lyengo lyangu'.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Ata nyo li'no, malau' na papasa, niyendelya na mwanja wangu', kwa mwanjaa inogelyali nnondoli wa Nnu'ngu' abulagilwe panja ya ku Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 13:33">Yesu aili'lya Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 13:33">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:33">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Hen sitting on chicks - LB00061" file="HenSittingOnChicks_Mat23.37_LB00061.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="13:33" /> <verse eid="LUK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />“Mwa Yelusalemu! Yelusalemu! Wabulaga alondoli ba Nnu'ngu' na kwaku'mbwa maliwe balu' babatumilwe na Nnu'ngu' kasako. Pali'nga nipalike kwabi'ka pamope bana bako, pamope kati ngu'ku' nyongolo mwakumbatya bana bake pai' ya mapapayo gake, lakini watekana. <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Aya! Alu'a kuleka kisako, panyumba yako palu'a panga payame. Bai, nimmakianga mwanibonali kai' mpaka nsimu wamwabaya, <char style="qt">‘Ayaliwite aywo ywaisa kwa lina lya Bwana.’” </char><verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu antepwa mundu yumo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Lisu'ba limo lya Sabato ya Ayahudi, Yesu aayi'i lya kunyumba yimo ya alongosi ba Mafalisayo, bandu baabile popo kabannolekeya. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Nnu'ngi' yake Yesu, kwaabile na mundu yumo ywaminyage kitamwe so imba payi'ga. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yesu aalalwiye balimu ba salya na Mafalisayo, “Buli, yendayi'ki'ti'lwa kuntepwa mundu lisu'ba lya Sabato?” <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Lakini bembe bayangwili. Yesu ankamwi ywo ntamwe, kuntepwa na kunneka aibu'ki. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Payomwi lyo aatikwabakia, “Ywaku' mukipi'nga sinu, ywembe mwana wake au ng'ombe wake mana atumbuki mulu'si' alu'e kunnopwali, mwanjaa ya lisu'ba lya Sabato?” <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Nabembe baakombwili kunnyangwa lyaalalwiye.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nogamwoyo no gegekeya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yesu paabweni balu' babasawa tama muiti'gu' ya nnu'ngi' mana bakokilwe. Alongei nabo kwa lukongo lu'no. <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“Mana mundu akukokite palisengele kanewatame pandu paisima. Pi'ngi' akokilwe mundumuko kulikoni wenga, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />mwene kaya aisa na kukubakia, ‘Wenga ukatuke, unneki kiti'gu' ayu'!’ Apo, walu'a kwibona oni paminyo ga bandu boti na wayenda tama pakitamo sa nsu'gu'. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Ila, mana ukokilwe pakalamu, waatame pakiti'gu' sa nsu'gu', li'nga mwene kiyambo paaisa, aakubakiye, ‘Mbwiga lyangu', potamiye panogeli lili, sotame pano palu'ngi' panannoga.’ Apo, walu'a peyelwa isima nnu'ngi' ya bandu boti botami nabo pamope. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Mwanjaa ywoywoti ywaiu'bu'ya mwene alu'a uluyilwa na ywaiuluya, alu'a u'bu'yi'lwa.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Kai' aammakiye yu'lu' ywankokite, “Mana kaupala panga kalamu ibe muntwekati au kitamwiyo, kanewakoke mambwiga sika, alongo, babatama papipi yako, bababile matayili. Manaitei nyo yapanga wenga bakuki'li'bu'kiye sawapangile. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Saupalikwa panga, mana kopi'ya kalamu wakoke aki'ba, alemau, itewe na atu'lu'ka minyo. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Nawenga wayaliwa mwanjaa abo bawakokite, ntu'pu' sawaki'li'bu'ki'yi'lwa. Nnu'ngu' alu'a kuli'pa upo yako nsimu wo yu'ka bandu bene aki.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukongo lwa kalamu ngu'lu'</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Yumo ywa balu' babaatami na Yesu kabalya aatikummakia, “Nantali mundu yu'lu' ywalu'a lya kilyo mu Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu'.”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesu ngammakia, “Mundu yumo aapangite kalamu ngu'lu' na aakokite bandu baingi. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Paliikite lisu'ba lya kalamu, antumike mpangakasi wake akaabakiye babakokilwe, ‘Mwise ku'no kila kili'be kitami wiso.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Lakini kila mundu ywaakokilwe aatumbwi piya kitumbu no lu'ba lasi. Ywaalongoli kummona aammakiye mpangakasi, ‘Nenga nipi'mite nng'unda kwa nyo, nipalikwa nikaubone, nikulu'ba unisami bai.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Ywi'ngi' aatibaya, ‘Nipi'mite ng'ombe ku'mi bo li'mya na niyenda kunng'unda kwapaya, nilu'ba lasi unisami bai.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Na ywi'ngi' abaike, ‘Niuma gamba nnwawa kwa nyo, nikombwali isa.’ <figure style="fig" alt="Parable of banquet, guest 2 refuses - WA03901" file="ParableOfBanquet(WeddingFeast)_2InvitedGuestsRefuse_WA03901.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="14:20" /> <verse eid="LUK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Mpangakasi ywo aatibuyangana na kummakia bwana wake makowe go. Yu'lu' mwene nyumba aatiusika, ngammakia mpangakasi wake, ‘Uyende kiyu'ngu'ya kusimbasimba na kumali'la ga kumisengo ukaalete mono nnyumba aki'ba, itewe, atu'lu'ka minyo na bi'ngi' babalemile.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Bu'kapo mpangakasi ywo ngabaya, ‘Bwana, bandu nabakiye kati mwoamulise, lakini balo banatwi'lyali.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Yu'lu' bwana aammakiye kai' mpangakasi wake, ‘Uyende kusimbasimba na mumali'la gagayenda mbwega ya misengo, ukaalasimise bandu bayingi li'nga liiku'ta lyangu' litwi'li. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Kwa nyo nendakummakianga, ntu'pu' ata yumo mwa balu' babakokilwe ywalu'a paya kalamu yangu'.’” <figure style="fig" alt="Parable of banquet guests arrive - DN00477" file="ParableOfBanquet(WeddingFeast)_3OtherGuestsArrive_Mat22.8-10_DN00477.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Darwin Dunham © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="14:24" /><verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kili'ngo so panga wa mwanamasi' wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Apo ipi'nga yambone ilongwanage pamope na Yesu. Bai, aagalambuki bandu na kwabakia, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Mundu ywoywoti mana kaisa kwangu' apalilwa kunipenda nenga kulikoni tati' bake, mau' bake, nnyumbowe, bana bake, nku'we na akinalu'mbu'be, kai' ata mwene. Mana akotwike kombwa panga go, apangali mwanamasi' wangu'.<verse eid="LUK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />“Mundu ywakotoka pu'twa nsalaba wake na kunibi'ngi'ya, akombwali panga mwanamasi' wangu'. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Ywaku' kasinu, ywembe mana kapala senga nsengo nku'lu', akombwali wi'ti' balanga mbanje yaipalikwa, li'nga atange panga yabile nayo, yali'ngana yomolya senga? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Mana buli, mana ayomwi senga pai' bai no kotoka yomolya, bandu balu'a kumweka. <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />Kababaya, ‘Mundu yu' aatumbwi senga, lakini akombwili yomolya.’<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />“Au, nkulungwa ywaku' ywayenda ku'mbwana ngondo na nkulungwa nnyine, ywasomwa wi'ti' gania panga yesi lyake lyene banayesi elupu ku'mi, liwesa otwa kwa yu'lu' mwene banayesi elupu isilini? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Mana aibweni anng'wesali, alu'a kwatuma bandu bo yenda panga masikisano pakemu, yu'lu' nnyine abile balo kuutalu. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Bai, mwenga nyinyonyo, ntu'pu' ata yumo ywakombwa panga mwanamasi' wangu' mana asindwi kukilekekeya kila kili'be sabile naso.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwinyo wangali kilyi'lyi'</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat 5:13</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mal 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />“Mwinyo unogite, lakini mana unogau wake wobite, ulu'a galambuyilwa buli li'nga kilyi'lyi' sake kibuye? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Upwaikali kwa ukando ata kwa mbolya. Bandu bendakuuyita. Bai, mwene makutu go yu'wa ayu'we.”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Lukongo lwa ngondolo ywaobite</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Lisu'ba limo, alonga koli na bene sambi baingi baayi'i kumpi'kania Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Mafalisayo na balimu ba salya baatumbwi ku'ku'li'ka, “Munninguli mundu yu'! Aakemya bene sambi, no lya nabo nkungu gumo.” <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Yesu aayangwi kwa lukongo, <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Ati', mundu yumo kati yinu mana abile na ngondolo mya, mana aobite yumo, alu'a panga buli? Aaleka balu' tisini na kenda mmwitu, no yenda kumpala yu'lu' ywaobite mpaka ammone. <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Mana amweni, alu'a kumpu'twa palipamba kwo napusika. <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Paaika kasake, aakema mambwigalye na kwabakia, ‘Munapusike pamope nanenga kwa mwanjaa yu'lu' ngondolo wangu' ywaobite nimweni.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Mwenga nendakummakia, kwalu'a baa na pulaa kunani kwa mundu yumo mwene sambi buyangania kwa Nnu'ngu', kulikoni bandu tisini na kenda bene aki bapalilwali kummuyangania Nnu'ngu'. <figure style="fig" alt="Lost sheep on shepherds shoulders others rejoicing" file="LostSheep_4Rejoicing_Mat18.13-14_WA03831.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="15:7" /><verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwela lwaluobite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />“Au mwibona buli? Tubaye nnwawa nsi'si' abi na ela ku'mi ya mapeni, mana aobiye yimo, alu'a panga buli? Alu'a koya lumuli na kwipyaya nyumba yoti ku'no kalolekeya mpaka aibone. <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Mana aibweni, aakema mambwiga na bandu ba papipi nakwe no baya, ‘Munapusike pamope nanenga kwa mwanjaa niibweni yi'lu' ela yangu' yayaobite.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Na mwenga nendakummakia, ngamo baanapusika malaika ba Nnu'ngu' kwa kummona mwene sambi yumo kammuyangania Nnu'ngu'.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukongo lwa mwana ywaobite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesu aayendeli longela, “Kwai na mundu yumo aabile na bana abi'li' analu'me. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Yu'lu' nnuna aabakiye tati' bake, ‘Tati', mumbei ulisi wangu'.’ Nembe ayi'ki'ti kwabagana mali yake. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Gaapite masu'ba bai, yu'lu' nnuna aapi'miye ulisi wake no yabwa mwanja wa nni'ma wa kuutalu na yi'lu' mbanje yaapatike. Akwo, aatikwinyamana yi'lu' mbanje. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Payomwi tumya kila kikowe, kwapitike njala ngali' kunni'ma wu'lu', nembe ngatumbwa auka kwo pala kilyo. <figure style="fig" alt="Lost Son and pigs" file="GW103.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="15:14" /> <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Aalu'bike kibalua kwa mundu yumo ywa kunni'ma wo, nembe aampei lyengo lyo kwapeya yakulya magu'be kunng'unda wake. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Aminyikiyage ata lya makabanda gabalyage magu'be mwanjaa, aabile ntu'pu' mundu wa kumpeya kilyo sosoti. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Paapatike malango aatigania, ‘Mboni kwa tati' bangu' kubile na apangakasi baingi babalya no igaya, nenga niwaa njala? <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Nilu'a buyangania kwa tati' bangu' na kwabakia, Tati', ninkosile Nnu'ngu' na mwenga. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Nili'nganili ata kemelwa na mwana winu. Munipange kati yumo ywa apangakasi binu.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Bai, ngatumbwa mwanja wo buyangania kwa tati' bake. Kaegelya pakaya tati' pabamweni mwana, bammi'ki kiya, ngabammutukya, kunkumbatya na kunnonia. <figure style="fig" alt="Lost Son and Father" file="CN01761C.TIF" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © 1996 David C. Cook" ref="15:20" /><verse eid="LUK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />“Mwana aabakiye tati' bake, ‘Tati', ninkosile Nnu'ngu' na mwenga. Nili'nganili ata kemelwa na mwana winu.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Lakini tati' bake ngaabakia apangakasi bake, ‘Kiyu'ngu'ya! Mulete ngu'bo inannoga mukang'walike! Mung'walike lupete na ilatu. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Musinje likinda lyalinenipe tulye no panga si'li'ku'si'li'ku'! <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Kwa mwanjaa ayu' mwana wangu' aatiwaa, kumbe balo mwu'mi, aatioba, lakini nambi'yambi' abonekine.’ Ngabatumbwa si'li'ku'si'li'ku'.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />“Pagapangikage go, nku'we aai anagobwali bu'ka kunng'unda. Paabile mundi'la kaegelya pansengo, ngayu'wa ilulu na ngoma. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Ankemite mpangakasi yumo na kunnaluya, ‘Kubile na namani?’ <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Aywo mpangakasi, aatikunnyangwa, ‘Nnunago agobwile na tati' binu bansinjili likinda lyaliatike, kwa mwanjaa amweni abile salama salimini.’ <figure style="fig" alt="Prodigal son, father and older son - WA03877" file="ProdigalSon_9Father&amp;OlderSon_Luke15.28-32_WA03877.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="15:27" /> <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Aywo nku'we ngausika, aakani ata yingya nnyumba. Tati' bake pabaapiti panja, baatikuntebeya ayingi nnyumba. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Lakini ywembe aayangwi, ‘Linga! Myaka yoti nitikuntumikia kati nammanda winu, nati'kwanali amuli yinu ata lisu'ba limo! Munipei namani? Munanipeyali ata likinda lya mbwi yumo, nani nipange si'li'ku'si'li'ku' na mambwiga bangu'! <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Lakini mwana winu yu', ywalile mali yinu kwo nyamana li'no isa bai munsinjile li'lu' likinda lyalinenipe!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Tati' bake batikunnyangwa, ‘Wamwana wangu', wenga ubile pamope nanenga masu'ba goti na kila sanibile naso sako. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Twaapalikwe tupange si'li'ku'si'li'ku' no napusika, kwa mwanjaa ayu' nnunago aatiwaa, kumbe balo mwu'mi, aatioba, lakini nambi'yambi', abonekine.’”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Mwandiki nng'anga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesu ngaabakia banamasi' bake, “Tayili yumo aabile na mwandiki wake. Aywo mwandiki aasongilwe kwa kitumbu so nyamana mali ya tayili wake. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Yu'lu' tayili ngankema na kummakia, ‘Aga makowe gaku' ganigayu'wa kasako? Upiye na ubalange mabi'ko na matumyo kwa mwanjaa ukombwali panga wamwandiki wangu' kai'.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Yu'lu' mwandiki ngagania, ‘Bwana wangu' anibi'ngite mulyengo lya uandiki, nipange buli? Yenda li'ma nikombwali no lu'balu'ba kati nki'ba oni. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Bai nitangite lyo panga, li'nga panabi'ngi'lwa mulyengo bandu banikemi kasabe.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Bai ngaakema yumoyumo babalongelwage na bwana wake, ngammakia yu'lu' ywalongolile, ‘Ulongelwa ili'nga na bwana wangu'?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Ywembe ngannyangwa, ‘Ilu'yo mya ya mauta ga njaituni.’ Yu'lu' mwandiki ngammakia, ‘Utole seti sako solongelwa na wandike amusini.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Bu'kapo ngannaluya ywi'ngi', ‘Wenga ulongelwa ili'nga?’ Ngannyangwa, ‘Mabunia mya ga ngano.’ Yu'lu' mwandiki ngammakia, ‘Utole seti sako solongelwa na wandike samanini.’<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />“Bai, yu'lu' bwana aatikunnumba aywo mwandiki ywangaaminika, kwa mwanjaa atumi malango na ung'anga. Kwa mwanjaa bandu ba dunia yi'no bai na malango na ung'anga muno mumakowe gabe, kuliko bandu ba mubweya.”<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Yesu ngayendelya baya, “Nimmakianga, mwipangi mambwiga bu'kana na mali ya dunia, li'nga pamwayomokelwa, baampokyange muutamo wangayomoka. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Ywoywoti ywau'bi'li'ka mumakowe masene, aau'bi'li'ka mumakowe maku'lu' na ywa kotoka u'bi'li'ka mumakowe masene, mumakowe maku'lu' aau'bi'li'kali. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Bai, mana mutei mwu'bi'li'kali kwa mali ya ulau ya padunia, nyai ywalu'a kunkamukia mali ya kakape? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Mana mutei mwu'bi'li'kali mumali ya mundu ywi'ngi', nyai ywalu'a kunkamukia mali yinu mwabene?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />“Ntu'pu' ntumisi ywakombwa kwatumikia mabwana abi'li', kwa mwanjaa alu'a kunsukwa yumo na kumpenda ywi'ngi' au ayi'ki'tyana na yumo na kunsalawa ywi'ngi'. Mukombwali kuntumikia Nnu'ngu' na mali.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milongelo ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mat 11:12-13</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mal 10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Mafalisayo pabagayu'wine go nabembe baai apenda mbanje, ngabansalawa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Apo ngaabakia, “Mwenga mwilaya pabandu, panga mwannogau, lakini Nnu'ngu' aitangite myoyo yinu. Kwa mwanjaa sakibonekana sangama pabandu, Nnu'ngu' akibona undi bai.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />“Salya na maandiko ga alondoli ba Nnu'ngu' gaabile mpaka nsimu wa Yoani Ywabatisage. Bu'kapo, Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu' wendaalilwa, na kila mundu auyingya kwa makakala. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Nantali kunani na dunia pi'ta, kuliko bu'yi'lwa liyi'gi'yo limo lya salya.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />“Ywoywoti ywampeya nnyumbowe talaka no kobeka ywi'ngi', apanga upege, na ywoywoti ywankobeka nnwawa ywapeyilwe talaka, apanga upege.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tayili na Lasali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />“Pai na mundu yumo tayili, ywawalage ngu'bo ya bei ngu'lu' ya lukanda lwa sambalau. Mundu ywo atumyage mbanje yambone kila lisu'ba. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Na paniango wa ywo tayili kwai na nki'ba yumo lina lyake Lasali, ywabile na mabanga. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Lasali aminyikiyage peyelwa mbolotya yaitu'mbu'kya pamesa ya aywo tayili, kai' mapwa bendeisa no lambata mabanga gake. <figure style="fig" alt="Lazarus begs - GT00078" file="LazarusBegs_Luke16.19_GT00078.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Gordon Thompson © Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc., 2012." ref="16:21" /><verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />“Bai, yu'lu' nki'ba paawile, malaika ngabantola na kummi'ka pakyuba sa Bulaimu. Na yu'lu' tayili nembe ngawaa no sikilwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Aywo tayili, aai mungu'su'mbu' akwo kumambi', palolekiye kunani, ngammona Bulaimu kuutalu abile nakwe Lasali. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Bai, ngakema, ‘Tati' Bulaimu, mumbi'ki kiya, muntume Lasali asuye lukonji lwake mumasi', aniu'lu'ki'ye mululimi lwangu', kwa mwanjaa nendalumya muno mumwoto wu'no.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Bulaimu ngannyangwa, ‘Mwana wangu', uku'mbu'ki wapoki ganannoga mubwu'mi wako, lakini Lasali apoki maakau. Nambi'yambi' nembe endapu'mu'lya nawenga wendalumya. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Na kai', pakati yitu na mwenga pabi'kilwe lyi'mbwa liku'lu', li'nga babapala isa kwinu bu'ka ku'no kanebakombwe na babapala bu'ka kwinu isa kwitu kanebakombwe.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Yu'lu' ywabile tayili ngabaya, ‘Bai Tati', ninnu'ba muntume Lasali ayende pansengo wa tati' bangu', <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />kwa mwanjaa nibi na aku'bangu' batano, akaakwi'li'ke, baakaneisa pandu pano pene ngu'su'mbu'.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Lakini Bulaimu ngayangwa, ‘Aku'bo babi na Musa na alondoli ba Nnu'ngu', waleke baapi'kani bo.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Lakini ywembe ngabaya, ‘Nyinyoli tati' Bulaimu, ila mundu mana aayu'ka bu'ka kumambi' no yenda kwakwi'li'ka, baagalambuka.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Bulaimu ngabaya, ‘Mana baayu'wali Musa na alondoli ba Nnu'ngu', ata mundu ywaayu'ka bannyu'wali.’”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Iku'balo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Apo, Yesu ngaabakia banamasi' bake, “Inonwipe kotoka pitya iku'balo ya sambi, lakini akibona yu'lu' ywalu'a piya iku'balo ya kumpangia mundu sambi. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Mundu kati ywo yai nantali kuntabya liwe lyo yagya paingo na kuntumbukia mubaali, kulikoni kumpangia sambi yumo ywa anangu'ta ba. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Mwili'ndi'le, ‘Manaitei nnongo akukosile, unkwi'li'ke na mana akuyu'wine unsami.’ <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Na mana akukosya mala saba kwa lisu'ba na kukuki'li'bu'kya kwo lu'ba nsama mala saba ipalikwa unsami.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Atumilwe ngabammakia Bwana, “Utuyongekeye imani.” <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Bwana ngayangwa, “Mukaba na imani alau njene kati lupeke lwa nkongo wa aladali, mulu'e kombwa kuubakia nku'yu' gu', uyokoke na ukayokekelwe mubaali na wembe ulu'e kunnyu'wa.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makowe ga ntumisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />“Tubaye mundu yumo ai na ntumisi ywali'ma nng'unda au sunga ngondolo. Buli, paabuya kwo, alu'a kummakia ntumisi, ‘Uegeli kiyu'ngu'ya saulye?’ <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Lili! Alu'a kummakia, ‘Uniyupuli kilyo na wibi'ke wiso kwo ndumikia mpaka panaayomwa lya no nywa, nga wenga walye no nywa.’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Mulu'e kummakiali posaa aywo ntumisi kwa mwanjaa apangite kati mwaabakiyilwe? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Na mwenga nyinyonyo pamwayomwa panga goti gamubayilwe, mwabaye, ‘Twenga twatumisi bai, tupangite galu' gatupalikwe tupange.’”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 17:10">Yesu apeletea bene matana ku'mi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:10">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Ten Lepers begging to be healed - WA03878" file="TenLepersHealed_Luke17.11-14_WA03878.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="17:10" /> <verse eid="LUK 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Yesu paabile mumwanja kayenda ku Yelusalemu, api'ti mumipaka ya ku Samalia na ku Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Paabile kaika pakilambo simo, akwembine na bandu ku'mi bene matana, bayi'mi kuutalu. <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />Ngabatu'ndu'bi'ya malobe kababaya, “Yesu, wa Mpi'ndo, utubi'ki kiya!” <verse eid="LUK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Paabweni ngaabakia, “Muyende mukailaye kwa api'ndo ba dini.” Bai, pabaabile kabayenda, ngabapeleteka. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Yumo mukipi'nga sabe paibweni apeletike, aatiki'li'bu'ka kannumba na kunkwi'ya Nnu'ngu' kwa lilobe liku'lu'. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Aagonjike pai' wakukama nnu'ngi' ya magu'lu' ga Yesu ku'no kansukulu. Aywo aai Nsamalia. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Apo Yesu ngalaluya, “Nengite naapeletiye bandu ku'mi? Balu' kenda bai kwaku'? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Abonekineli ywi'ngi' ywaki'li'bwike kunsukulu Nnu'ngu' ila aywo nng'eni Nsamalia bai?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Yesu ngammakia aywo mundu, “Uyi'me, uyende kasako, imani yako ikupeletiye.” <figure style="fig" alt="Ten lepers healed one gives thanks - WA03879" file="TenLepersHealed-OneGivesThanks_Luke17.15-19_WA03879.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="17:19" /><verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa kwa Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mat 24:23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Nsimu gumo Mafalisayo bannalwiye Yesu, “Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu' waisa pakubawi?” Ywembe ngayangwa, “Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu' wisali kwo bonekana. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Wala ntu'pu' ywakombwa baya, ‘Wi pano,’ au, ‘Wi palu'.’ Kwa mwanjaa Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu' wi nkati yinu.” <verse eid="LUK 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Bu'kapo ngaabakia banamasi' bake, “Masu'ba gendaisa pamwalu'a minyikia kulibona lisu'ba limo lya Mwana wa Mundu, lakini mwalibonali. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Bandu baalu'a kummakianga, ‘Ai palu'!’ au, ‘Ai pano!’ Lakini mwenga kanemwabu'ke wala kanemwaki'ngame. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Mwanjaa kati njai mwaibeyulya ngamwalyalu'a baa lisu'ba lya Mwana wa Mundu. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Lakini alu'a tumbwa wi'ti' baa mungu'su'mbu' no kanilwa na lubelekwo lu'no. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Kati mwawabile nsimu wa Nuu, ngamwawalu'a baa nsimu wa masu'ba ga Mwana wa Mundu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Bandu baayendeli lya no nywa, kobeka no ku'nda mpaka nsimu wa Nuu payingi musapina. Ngaupita nkukulo no langanyika boti. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Yapanga kati mwayabile kwa Lutu. Bandu bai kabalya no nywa, pi'ma no pi'mi'ya, kena no senga. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Lisu'ba li'lu' lyabu'i Lutu Sodoma, mwoto wa bwaluti na kibi'li'tu' watei kwenda nia, kati ula kauluka bu'ka kunani, na kwalangamisa boti. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Ngamwalyalu'a baa lisu'ba li'lu' lyoumukulwa Mwana wa Mundu.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />“Lisu'ba lyo, ywoywoti ywalu'a baa pamwagala kaneauluke yenda tola mali yake nnyumba na ywalu'a baa kunng'unda kaneaki'li'bu'ke nsu'gu'. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Muku'mbu'ki gagampatike nnyumbowe Lutu. <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Ywoywoti ywapala kuukosopolya bwu'mi wake alu'a kuobeya na ywoywoti ywaalu'a kuuobeya alu'a kuukosopolya. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Nimmakianga panga, lisu'ba lyo bandu abi'li' baagonja pamope, yumo atolelwa na ywi'ngi' alekelwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35-36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35-36" />Alwawa abi'li' bapanga pamope kabayaga, atolelwa yumo na ywi'ngi' alekelwa.” <verse eid="LUK 17:35-36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Apo ngabannaluya, “Bwana, nga kwaku'?” Naywembe ngaabakia, “Papabile na ntwi ngapabakongolekana tai.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Lukongo lwa nnwawa nng'wi'li'kwa na nsengowe na akimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Bu'kapo Yesu aasimuli lukongo li'nga kwalaya panga ipalikwa lu'ba Nnu'ngu' kila lisu'ba pangali totokelwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Ngabaya, “Munni'ma gumo kwai na akimu ywangali kunkilikitya Nnu'ngu' wala kumpi'kania mundu. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Munni'ma wowowo, kai' kwai na mau' yumo nng'wi'li'kwa na nsengowe, ywakoyage kwa akimu ywo kunnu'ba li'nga apate aki yake bu'ka kwa nndumu wake. <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Kwa masu'ba gambone aywo akimu apendili kumpeya aki yake yu'lu' nng'wi'li'kwa, lakini kuundi'la ngaibakia, ‘Pamope no panga nenga ninkilikityali Nnu'ngu' wala napi'kaniali bandu, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />lakini kwa mwanjaa nng'wi'li'kwa yu' endaniauya, nilu'a kumpeya. Mana ngotwike aayendelya kuniauya mpaka anitotoye!’”<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Bai, Bwana ngayendelya baya, “Mupi'kaniange mwaalongei yu'lu' akimu nnau. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Mubaya, Nnu'ngu' alu'a kotoka kwayi'mya balu' baasawile, babanni'lya kilo na muntwekati? Aselewa kwapi'kania? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Nimmakianga alu'a kwayi'mya kiyu'ngu'ya. Nsimu waaisa Mwana wa Mundu alu'a kwikwemba imani padunia?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukongo lwa Mfalisayo na nnonga koli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Na Yesu ngaabakia kai' lukongo balu' babaibona anogau na kwasalawa bi'ngi'. <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“Bandu abi'li' baayi'i lu'ba kulua lwa Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu'. Yumo aai Mfalisayo na ywi'ngi' nnonga koli. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Aywo Mfalisayo ngayi'ma pakisake no lu'ba, ‘Wa Nnu'ngu', nendakusukulu kwa mwanjaa nenga, kati bandu bi'ngi' lili, bababile abwimi, abu'su' na apege. Kai' nenga kati ayu' nnonga koli lili. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Nenga nendapunga mala ibi'li' kwa juma, nipiya salaka lumo kwa ku'mi ya mabi'ko gangu'.’ <figure style="fig" alt="Pharisee &amp; Tax Collector, Pharisee prays proudly - DN00462" file="Pharisee&amp;TaxCollector_3PhariseePraysProudly_Luke18.11-12_DN00462.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Darwin Dunham © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="18:12" /> <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Lakini yu'lu' nnonga koli, ngayi'ma kuutalu na aakombwili tu'ndu'bi'a minyo gake kunani, ila aatikotima no ku'ku'li'ka kabaya, ‘Wa Nnu'ngu', unibi'ki kiya nenga na mwene sambi.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Nimmakianga, yu'lu' nnonga koli aki'li'bu'ki kaya asamilwe. Lakini yu'lu' ywi'ngi', asamilweli. Kwa mwanjaa ywaiu'bu'ya auluyilwa na ywaiuluya au'bu'yi'lwa.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 18:14">Yesu abaliki bana anangu'ta</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 18:14">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19:13-15</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mal 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:14">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Children blessed by Jesus - DN00413" file="ChildrenBlessedByJesus_DN00413.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Darwin Dunham © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="18:14" /> <verse eid="LUK 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Bandu ngabannetya Yesu bana anangu'ta li'nga akunywe kwa maboko li'nga kwaayalya. Banamasi' pabaabweni, baatikwakanikia kwa ukali'. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Lakini Yesu aatikwakema ngabaya, “Mwaleke abo bana baise kasangu', kanemwakanikie, kwa mwanjaa Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu' nga wa bandu kati baa. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Nimmakianga kakape, mundu ywoywoti ywakotoka pokya Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu' kati bana anangu'ta, ayingyali mu Ukulungwa wo.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 18:17">Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu' na utayili</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 18:17">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19:16-30</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mal 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:17">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Rich young ruler - Cook 1978 CN01774" file="RichYoungRuler&amp;Jesus_CN01774.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="18:17" /> <verse eid="LUK 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Kolongosi yumo wa Kiyahudi, ngannaluya Yesu, “Mwalimu nnogau, nipange buli li'nga niupate ukoto wangayomoka?” <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesu ngammakia, “Mboni unikema na nnogau? Ntu'pu' ywai nnogau ila Nnu'ngu' kisake. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Uitangite amuli, <char style="qt">‘Keneube wampege, Kaneubulage, kaneuyibe, Keneukong'ondeli makowe ga ubu'su', waisimu tati' na mau' bako.’”</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Ywembe ngabaya, “Ago goti nigakamwile bu'ka kuunangu'ta wangu'.” <verse eid="LUK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Yesu pagayu'wine go, ngammakia, “Balo upalikwa panga kili'be simo. Upi'mi'ye kila kili'be sobile naso na kwabagana aki'ba mbanje yo, na walu'a ba na amana kunani, bu'kapo uniki'ngame.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Yu'lu' mundu paagayu'wine go, aatiusunika muno kwa mwanjaa aai tayili muno. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesu paamweni kausunika muno, ngabaya, “Atayili yingya mu Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu' kunonwipe. <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Male ngamiya yingya mulipoyo lya singano, kulikoni tayili yingya mu Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu'.” <figure style="fig" alt="Camel and rider - LB00042" file="Camel&amp;Rider_LB00042.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="18:25" /> <verse eid="LUK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Balu' bandu pabagayu'wine go, ngababaya, “Nyai ywalu'a kosopolelwa?” <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesu ngayangwa, “Gagakotoka kombolwa na mundu, kwa Nnu'ngu' gendakombolwa.” <verse eid="LUK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Nembe Petili ngannaluya, “Na twenga, buli? Tuilei ili'be yitu yoti tukuki'ngime wenga!” <verse eid="LUK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesu ngaabakia, “Kakape nimmakianga, mundu ywoywoti ywaulei nsengo wake, au nnyumbowe, au nnongowe, au abelei bake, au bana kitumbu sa Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu', <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />alu'a pokya gambone nambi'yambi' na ukoto wangayomoka pawaisa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alongela pampanda patatu kwa kiwo na uyu'ki wake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20:17-19</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mal 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesu ngayenda nabo pambwega balu' ku'mi na abi'li' ngaabakia, “Mupi'kani wi'ti'! Tuyenda ku Yelusalemu na akwo, kila sakiandikilwe na alondoli ba Nnu'ngu' kwa Mwana wa Mundu kikatimya. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Kwa mwanjaa alu'a kamukiyilwa kwa bandu bangali Ayahudi nabembe balu'a kunsalanga, kumpwi'wa na kumwunia mataa. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Balu'a kunku'mbwa bokola na kummulaga, lakini lisu'ba lyenetatu alu'a yu'ka.” <verse eid="LUK 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Lakini bembe bakwipwili likowe lyo ata pasene, kwa mwanjaa sateiyilwa kikomekeyo sa makowe go na baatangiteli gagaalongelikwe.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu antepwa mbulibuli ku Yeliko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20:29-34</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mal 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Yesu pai papipi na ku Yeliko, kwai na mundu yumo mbulibuli atami mundi'la kalu'balu'ba. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Paayu'wine lipi'nga lya bandu kalipi'ta ngalaluya, “Kubile na ki'li'?” <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Ngabammakia, “Yesu wa ku Nasaleti endapi'ta.” <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Naywembe ngatu'ndu'bi'ya lilobe kabaya, “Yesu, Mwana wa Daudi, unibi'ki kiya!” <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Balu' babaalongolile, ngabankwi'li'ka na kummakia atame liki. Lakini ywembe ngayendelya tu'ndu'bi'ya lilobe, “Mwana wa Daudi, unibi'ki kiya!” <verse eid="LUK 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesu ngayi'ma na kwabakia panga bannete nnu'ngi' yake. Palu' yu'lu' mbulibuli paikite papipi, Yesu ngannaluya, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Upala nikupangi ki'li'?” Naywembe ngannyangwa, “Bwana, nilu'ba nikombwe lola.” <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yesu ngammakia, “Ulole! Imani yako ikutepwile.” <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Na popopo aywo mbulibuli aakombwi lola, nganki'ngama Yesu kankwi'ya Nnu'ngu'. Na bandu boti pabagabweni go, bannumbike Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na Zakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Zacchaeus in tree - WA03891" file="Zacchaeus_3InTree_Luke19.4_WA03891.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="19:0" /> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yesu aikite kunni'ma wa ku Yeliko, ngapi'ta mumali'la ga nni'ma wo. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Akwo kwai na mundu yumo ywakemelwa Zakayo, aywo aai mundu nku'lu' wa alonga koli, kai' aai tayili. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Apalage kummona Yesu, lakini akombwili kummona kwa mwanjaa bandu bai baingi na kyi'mo sake sai kipi. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Kwa nyo, aabutuki nnu'ngi' no u'bu'ka munku'yu' li'nga ammone Yesu, kwa mwanjaa api'ti ndi'la yi'lu'. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Bai, Yesu paikite palu', ngalola kunani ngammakia, “Zakayo, uuluke kiyu'mbi'ti'ka, kwa mwanjaa li'no nipalikwa piliya kasako.” <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Apo Zakayo ngauluka kiyu'ngu'ya na kunkemya kasake kwo napusika. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Bandu boti pabagabweni go, ngabaku'ku'li'ka no baya, “Ayi'i tama na mundu mwene sambi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Zakayo ngayi'ma na kummakia Yesu, “Bwana, upi'kani! Nenga lisinda lya mali yangu' nalu'a kwapeya aki'ba na mana nampokonywi mundu kili'be, nalu'a kunki'li'bu'ki'ya mala nsese.” <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yesu ngammakia, “Li'no ukosopoli wi pansengo wu'no, kwa mwanjaa ayu' naywembe nga ywalukolo lwa Bulaimu. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Kwa mwanjaa Mwana wa Mundu aisi pala no kosopolya babaobite.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukongo lwa atumisi ku'mi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Apo Yesu paabile kaegelya ku Yelusalemu. Bandu babampi'kaniage baganiage panga yaigali pasene bai Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu' ulu'e isa. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Kwa nyo, Yesu ngaabakia lukongo lu'no, “Kwai na mundu wa lukolo lwa kikulungwa ywayabwi mwanja, yenda kunni'ma wa kuutalu li'nga pokya utawala wa ukulungwa no buya. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Bai, wai kapala bu'ka, ngaakema wi'ti' atumisi bake ku'mi na kwapeya mbanje kila mundu na kwabakia, ‘Mupangi nsuluso mpaka panabuya.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Lakini bandu ba palu' baatikunsukwa kwa nyo ngabatuma bandu bayende ku'lu' bakabaye, ‘Tukani kututawala yu'.’<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />“Aywo mundumuko aabuyangani kaya wayomwi pokya ukulungwa, popopo ngaabakia balu' atumisi baapei mbanje bakemelwe li'nga atange panga kila mundu abeliye ili'nga. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Ntumisi ywalongolile ngapitya, ngabaya, ‘Bwana, nibeliye ku'mi yi'ngi' ya mbanje yawanipeile.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Naywembe ngammakia, ‘Unogiye, wenga nga wantumisi nnogau. Kwa mwanjaa upangite kinannoga mumakowe masene, ulu'a panga wa kolongosi muilambo ku'mi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Ntumisi ywenebi'li' ngaisa kabaya, ‘Bwana, nibeliye yi'ngi' tano ya yi'lu' mbanje yawanipeile.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Naywembe ngammakia, ‘Nawenga kai', ulu'a panga wa kolongosi muilambo tano.’<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />“Ntumisi ywi'ngi' ngaisa kabaya, ‘Bwana, utole mbanje yako, natiiya wiso mukitambala. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Naatiyogopa kwa mwanjaa wenga wa mundu nkali'. Wenga utola yangali yako na uuna yangali kena.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Naywembe ngammakia, ‘Malongelo gako galaya makosa gako, wenga wantumisi nnau! Waatangite panga nenga nankali', nitola yangali yangu' na niuna yangali kena. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Kwa mwanjaa ki'li', ukotwike bi'ka mbanje yangu' kwa bababeleya, nanenga kibuyo nikaisa tola yaibeleyilwe?’ <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Apo ngaabakia balu' bababile palu', ‘Mumpokonywe ayo mbanje, mukampei yu'lu' ywabeliye ku'mi yi'ngi'.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Bembe ngabammakia, ‘Lakini Bwana, aywo abile na mali yambone muno!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Ywembe ngayangwa, ‘Kila ywabile na kili'be nga ywapeyelwa no yongekeyelwa. Lakini yu'lu' ywangali ba naso kili'be, ata si'lu' sabile naso saatolelwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Na nambi'yambi', babanisukwa na babanikana nibe na nkulungwa wabe, mwalete pano, na mwabulage papanopano nnu'ngi' yangu'.’”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ayingya ku Yelusalemu kwa si'li'ku'si'li'ku'</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21:1-11</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mal 11:1-11</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoa 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Yesu paayomwi longela go, aatilongolya kalongokeya ku Yelusalemu, <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />paaegeli Bethfage na Betania papipi na Kitu'mbi' sa Minjaituni, aatumike banamasi' bake abi'li', <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" /><figure style="fig" alt="Colt of a donkey" file="15 Colt.jpg" size="col" ref="19:30">Mwana mbu'nda</figure>ngaabakia, “Muyende kukilambo sakibile nnu'ngi' yinu. Pamwayingya mukilambo, mukankolya mwana mbu'nda ywangakolelelwa na mundu atabilwe. Mumundwe, munnete pano. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Mana alu'a kunnaluya mundu mwanjaa ki'li' mumundwa, mwammakiye, ‘Bwana endakumpala.’”<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Bai, babatumilwe ngabayenda na baakoli kati mwabaabakiyilwe na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Pabaabile kabamundwa yu'lu' mwana wa mbu'nda, bene ngabaalaluya, “Kwa mwanjaa ki'li' mumundwa mwana mbu'nda yu'?” <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Nabembe ngabayangwa, “Bwana endakumpala.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Bai, ngabampelekya Yesu yu'lu' mwana mbu'nda. Bu'kapo ngabatandika magu'bo gabe panani ya mbu'nda na kumwu'bu'ya Yesu panani yake. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Yesu payendeli na mwanja, bandu baatandike magu'bo gabe musimbasimba. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus' triumphal entry" file="CN01782C.TIF" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © 1996 David C. Cook" ref="19:36" /><verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Paaegeli ku Yelusalemu pabwelyo wa Kitu'mbi' sa Minjaituni, lipi'nga lya banamasi' bake ngabatumbwa kwi'ndi'lya na kunkwi'ya Nnu'ngu' kwa lilobe liku'lu', kwa kitumbu sa makowe maku'lu' gabagabweni. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Ngababaya, <char style="qt">“Ayaliwite Nkulungwa ywaisa kwa lina lya Bwana!</char> Amani kunani, utukupu kwa Nnu'ngu' ywabile kunani!” <verse eid="LUK 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Apo Mafalisayo bi'ngi' babaabile mu'lu' mulipi'nga lya bandu ngabammakia Yesu, “Mwalimu, wakanikie banamasi' bako kanebapange ndu'ti!” <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yesu ngayangwa, “Nimmakianga, mana bakotwike bembe, ata maliwe galu'a kwi'ndi'lya.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akili'lya kilambo sa ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Paaegeli muno na kuubona nni'ma gu'lu' Yesu aatikuuli'lya. <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />Ngabaya, “We Yelusalemu, Ukatangage li'noli'no makowe gagaleta amani! Lakini nambi'yambi' gaiyilwe paminyo yako. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Kwa mwanjaa masu'ba gendaisa, babakusukwa bakuti'ti'li'ki'ya maboma, na kukuibya ndi'la wakane kosopolelwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Bakutimbatimba wenga pamope na bana bako bababile nkati ya ingu'mbi' yako, baakulekyali ata liwe limo panani ya li'ngi', kwa mwanjaa wautangiteli nsimu Nnu'ngu' paakwisili kukuyangatia.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 19:44">Yesu ayingya mu Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 19:44">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21:12-17</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mal 11:15-19</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoa 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:44">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus driving merchants from temple - WA03896" file="JesusDrivingMerchantsFromTemple_WA03896.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="19:44" /> <verse eid="LUK 19:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Bu'kapo, Yesu aayingi mulua lwa Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu' no tumbwa kwabi'nga asulusi, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />nembe ngabaya, “Iandikilwe, <char style="qt">‘Nyumba yangu' yapanga nyumba yo salilya,’</char> lakini mwenga muipangite ibe <char style="qt">mbango ya apokonyoli</char>!” <verse eid="LUK 19:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Yesu aai kayi'gana mulua lwa Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu' kila lisu'ba. Api'ndo ba dini, balimu ba salya na alongosi ba bandu baapalike kummulaga. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Lakini bai ntu'pu' lyopanga, mwanjaa bandu boti baai kabampi'kania muno.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Makowe ga utawala wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21:23-27</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mal 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Lisu'ba limo, Yesu waabile kaayi'gana bandu mulua lwa Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu' na kwaalya makowe ganannoga, api'ndo ba dini, balimu ba salya pamope na agoi baatiisa, <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />ngababaya, “Utubakiye! Upanga makowe ga goti kwa utawala waku', kai' nyai ywakupei utawala wu'?” <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yesu ngaabakia, “Nanenga mbala kunnaluyanga. Munibakiye, <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />utawala wa Yoani Ywabatisage wabu'kite kwa Nnu'ngu' au bandu?” <verse eid="LUK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Lakini bembe ngababakiana nnyanya, “Mana tubaite ubu'kite kwa Nnu'ngu', ywembe alu'a tulaluya, ‘Mboni mumwu'bi'li lili?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Na mana tubaite ubu'kite kwa mundu, bandu boti ba pano batuku'mbwa maliwe, kwa mwanjaa boti bau'bi'lile panga Yoani aai nnondoli wa Nnu'ngu'.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Bai, ngabammakia, “Tutangiteli utawala wo wabu'kite kwaku'.” <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yesu ngaabakia, “Ata nenga nimmakiangali nigapanga makowe ga kwa utawala waku'.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 20:8">Lukongo lwa nng'unda wa minjabibu na aali'mi</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 20:8">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21:33-46</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mal 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:8">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Vineyard Tenants owner sends son - Wade WA03899" file="VineyardTenants_2OwnerSendsSon_WA03899.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="20:8" /> <verse eid="LUK 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Yesu ngayendelya kwabakia bandu lukongo lu'no, “Mundu yumo aali'mike nng'unda wa minjabibu, na aayaiki ali'mi kwa mali'po no yabwa mwanja mpaka kilambo sa kuutalu, aatami kwo kwa masu'ba ganambone. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Pamauno, mundu ywo ngantuma ntumisi wake kwa balu' ali'mi bammauli lipungu lya itunda lya mauno ga nng'unda wa minjabibu. Lakini balu' ali'mi baatikunku'mbwa ntumisi ywo na kunki'li'bu'ya moko gabule. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Yu'lu' bwana ngantuma kai' ntumisi ywi'ngi', lakini bembe ngabanku'mbwa, bampangi makowe ga oni na kunki'li'bu'ya moko gabule. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Ngaantuma kai' ywenetatu, aywo ywembe pabannumiye ngabantaikulya paungo. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Yu'lu' mwene nng'unda ngabaya, ‘Nilu'a panga buli? Nintuma mwana wangu' ywanimpendile, kwaali' ywembe balu'a kunnyu'wa.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Balu' ali'mi pabamweni bai, ngababakiyana, ‘Ayu' ngalu'a tola ulisi wake, kwa nyo tummulage li'nga ulisi wo upange witu.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Bai, ngabampiya paungo ya nng'unda wa minjabibu na kummulaga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Yesu ngalaluya, “Yu'lu' mwene nng'unda alu'a kwapanga buli balu' ali'mi? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Alu'a isa kwabulaga ali'mi bo na kwapeya ali'mi bi'ngi' nng'unda wo wa minjabibu.” Bandu pabayu'wine makowe go ngababaya, “Lili! Kanegapite ata pasene!” <verse eid="LUK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Lakini Yesu ngaabu'nju'lya minyo na kwabakia, “Bai, Maandiko Mapeleteu gaalomboli ki'li'? <char style="qt">‘Liwe lyabalikani asengi, nambi'yambi' lipangike liwe liku'lu' lya pakitumembe!’</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Mundu ywoywoti ywatu'mbu'ka panani ya liwe lyo ati'kwanika ipandeipande na mana lintu'mbu'ki mundu ywoywoti, lyantimba.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 20:18">Li'pa koli kwa Kaisali</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 20:18">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22:15-22</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mal 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:18">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus showing denarius to crowd - Cook CN01790" file="JesusShowingDenariusToCrowd_CN01790.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="20:18" /> <verse eid="LUK 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Balimu ba salya na api'ndo ba dini baatangite panga lukongo lwo lwali'ngage bembe, kwa nyo bapalage kummoywa papalu'palu', ila bayogwipe bandu. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Bai, ngabaupala nsimu waupwaika. Ngabaatuma bandu baku'pi'ki'ye panga anogau, bampekeseni Yesu kwa kunnaluya, li'nga bammoywe na kunkamukia kwa alongosi ba silikali. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Bandu bo ngabammakia, “Mwalimu, tutangite panga wendalongela no yi'gana makowe ga kakape, kai' wenga ubawali bandu, uyi'gana kakape ndi'la ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Bai, utubakiye yendayi'ki'ti'lwa musalya ya Musa li'pa koli kwa Kaisali?” <verse eid="LUK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Yesu akwipwile kitapa sabe ngaabakia, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Munilaye lwela, lubile na kuminyo ya nyai?” <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Nabembe ngabannyangwa, “Kuminyo ya Kaisali.” Yesu ngaabakia, “Bai, ga Kaisali mumpei Kaisali, ga Nnu'ngu' mumpei Nnu'ngu'.” <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Bakombwili kunnyonja kwa likowe lyolyoti palu' pabandu, kwa nyo ngabatama liki no sangala mwaayangwile.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makowe ga uyu'ki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22:23-33</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mal 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Bu'kapo Masadukayo, bababaya panga babawile bayu'kali, baamwisili Yesu, ngababaya, <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />“Mwalimu, Musa atuandiki panga, <char style="qt">‘Manaitei mundu nsi'si' awile na annei nnwawa nng'wi'li'kwa pangali bana, nnunawe apalikwa antole ywo nnwawa li'nga ampapi nku'we bana.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Ngaipanga, nsimu gumo kwai na akingolo saba. Yu'lu' nku'lu' aatikobeka no waa pangali mwana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Yu'lu' nnuna ywenebi'li' ywantweti yu'lu' nng'wi'li'kwa naywembe ngawaa kai', <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />na nnuna ywenetatu yai nyinyonyo. Makowe gai gagalu'galu' kwa boti saba, boti bawile pangali papa bana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Kuundi'la na yu'lu' nnwawa ngawaa. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Lisu'ba lyabaalu'a yu'yi'lwa babawile, nnwawa ywo apanga nnyumbo wa nyai? Kwa mwanjaa boti saba baankobike.” <verse eid="LUK 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesu ngaabakia, “Bandu ba nsimu wu'no kobeka no ku'nda, <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />lakini balu' bababalangilwa panga baapwaika yu'ka no tama na Nnu'ngu', baakobekali na baaku'ndali. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Kai', bawaali, kwa mwanjaa babaa kati malaika, no baa bana ba Nnu'ngu' kwa mwanjaa bayu'kite muuwi'li. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Lakini kwa mwanjaa kubile no yu'ka bu'ka kuuwi'li, ata Musa aayi'ki'tile. Mu Maandiko Mapeleteu ga si'lu' kiwi'mbi' sasabile kakiyaka mwoto, kantambwa Bwana kati <char style="qt">‘Nnu'ngu' wa Bulaimu, Nnu'ngu' wa Isaka, na Nnu'ngu' wa Yakobi.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Bai, ywembe Nnu'ngu' wa awi'li lili, ywembe Nnu'ngu' wa balu' bababile bau'mi, kwa mwanjaa kasake boti bendalama.” <verse eid="LUK 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Bi'ngi' ba balu' balimu ba salya ngababaya, “Mwalimu, mwoyangwile ngamwembe.” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Ntu'pu' mundu ywi'ngi' ywalowite kai' kunnaluya li'ngi'.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makowe ga Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22:41-46</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mal 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yesu ngaalaluya, “Ibayilwa buli panga Kilisitu ywabayilwe nga mwana wa Daudi? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Daudi mwene abaya mu Zabuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">
    <char style="qt">‘Bwana Nnu'ngu' aammakiye Bwana wangu', </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">
    <char style="qt">Utame kummalyo gangu', </char><verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />
    <char style="qt">mpaka panaalu'a kwabi'ka andumu bako pai' ya magu'lu' gako.’ </char><verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Daudi ankema Kilisitu ‘Bwana,’ kwa nyo, Kilisitu apangali mwana wake bai, ila Bwana wake kai'.”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aakwi'li'ka bandu kanebabe kati balimu ba salya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23:1-36</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mal 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Yesu ngaabakia banamasi' bake nnu'ngi' ya bandu boti, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Mwili'ndi'le na balimu ba salya babapenda pi'tapi'ta bawalile makanju malaso. Bapendi pangilwa abali na bandu kwa isima kusoko no tama muitamo ya bandu bako, mu Nyumba ya kunnu'ba Nnu'ngu' na mumasalaka. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Baapokonywa alwawa awi'li'kwa ku'no kabaku'pi'ki'ya panga anogau kwo sali sala ndaso. Abo baapata ukumu ngu'lu'.”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Salaka ya mau' nng'wi'li'kwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mal 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Temple offering widow's mite - GT00084" file="TempleOffering-Widow'sMite_Luke21.2_GT00084.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Gordon Thompson © Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc., 2012." ref="21:0" /> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yesu aatikwalingia matayili, ngaabona kabayi'ya salaka yabe mulisanduku lya mbanje ya mulua lwa Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu', <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />ngammona mau' yumo nng'wi'li'kwa kayi'ya mo ela njene. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Bai, ngabaya, “Nimmakianga, mau' yu' nng'wi'li'kwa nki'ba ayi'i kiku'lu' mulisanduku kulikoni sabayi'i bi'ngi' boti. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Kwa mwanjaa boti bo bapiyike salaka bu'kana na mali yabe yaipi'tile, lakini mau' yu' muuki'ba wake, ayi'i yoti yabile nayo.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 21:4">Yesu alondwa sengwanilwa kwa Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 21:4">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mal 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 21:4">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Temple ruins - Knowles and Bass LB00247" file="TempleRuins(Herod's)_LB00247.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="21:4" /> <verse eid="LUK 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Bandu bi'ngi' balongelyage makowe ga Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu', mwainemekilwe kwa maliwe ga samani, pamope na upo yaipiyilwe kwa Nnu'ngu'. Yesu ngabaya, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Aga goti gamugabona, gaaisa masu'ba lyaigalali ata liwe limo panani ya li'ngi', kila kili'be sasengwanilwa.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tabu na ngu'su'mbu'</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24:3-14</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mal 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Bai, ngabannaluya, “Mwalimu, makowe go gapitya pakubawi? Na kikowe saku' sasalaya panga makowe go gaegelile pitya?” <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yesu ngaayangwa, “Mulinguli mwakanekongelwa. Kwa mwanjaa baingi baaisa na kulitumya lina lyangu', kila mundu kabaya panga, ywembe nga nenga no panga nsimu gu'lu' wegelile. Lakini mwenga kanemwakoleye! <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Bai, pamwagayu'wa makowe ga ngondo na mayu'mano, kanemwayogope, kwa mwanjaa ago gapalikwa gapi'te wi'ti', lakini matemulyo ga goti gaapanga balo.” <verse eid="LUK 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Bu'kapo ngayendelya longela, “Nni'ma gumo waku'mbwana na wi'ngi' na ukulungwa gumo waku'mbwana na wi'ngi'. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Kila pandu palu'a panga na malendemo maku'lu' ga bwi', njala na utamwe wa tauni. Kai' kwabaa na makowe maakau na myasu miku'lu' kunani. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Wangapitya ago goti, yalongolya wi'ti' kummoywa mwenga, kummi'ka mungu'su'mbu' no pwatilwa mumayumba ga kunnu'ba Nnu'ngu' na kunnyi'yanga muutabilwe. Mwapelekelwa nnu'ngi' ya akulungwa na atawala kwa mwanjaa ya lina lyangu'. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Li'nga mukanikong'ondeli kasabe. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Mukangamale mumyoyo yinu, kanemwaganiye pamwapala kwikengya. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Kwa mwanjaa nenga namwene nilu'a kumpeyanga milongelo yene malango, ata andumu bako bakukombwali kai' bakutaukyali. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Abelei binu, anunago, alongo na mambwiga binu balu'a kunsongya mwenga na mwabi'ngi' mwalu'a bulagilwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Bandu boti balu'a kunsukwanga kwa kitumbu sa lina lyangu'. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Lakini, ata lunywili lumo lwa mitwe yinu lwaobali. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Kwo komeya kwinu mwalu'a kosopolya bwu'mi winu.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alondwa sengwanilwa kwa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mat 24:15-21</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mal 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />“Pamwalu'a kukibona kilambo sa ku Yelusalemu kiti'li'tilwe na mayesi, bai mwatange panga nsimu wisile wo sengwanilwa kwa kilambo so. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Apo, bababile ku Yudea babutuki muitu'mbi', balu' bababile mukilambo babu'ke na balu' bababile kumigunda kanebaki'li'bu'ki kukilambo. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Kwa mwanjaa masu'ba go nga ga ukumu, li'nga goti gagaandikilwe mu Maandiko Mapeleteu gatimi. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Baalu'a kibona atopelwe na babayongeya masu'ba go! Kwa mwanjaa kwalu'a baa na siki ngu'lu' munni'ma na nyongo ya Nnu'ngu' yalu'a kwaisilya bandu bo. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Bi'ngi' baabulagilwa kwa lipanga, bi'ngi' baatolelwa mateka mumili'ma yoti, na kilambo sa ku Yelusalemu sali'batilwa na bandu bangali Ayahudi, mpaka nsimu wabe pawayomokya.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa kwa Mwana wa Mundu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24:29-31</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mal 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />“Kwalu'a baa na myasu mulisu'ba, mwei, na ndondwa. Dunia yoti yaba musiki kwa kitumbu sa kyukala so bu'kana na mwago wo yu'gayu'ga kwa masi' ga baali. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Bandu bainduka kwa mwanjaa ya bwoga, kabalolela makowe gagalu'a pitya, kwa mwanjaa makakala ga kunani galu'a tikatika. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Bu'kapo, baalu'a kummona Mwana wa Mundu kaisa mulyunde, mwene makakala na utukupu wammese. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Pagalu'a tumbwa pitya makowe go mwayi'me no tu'ndu'bi'ya mitwe yinu kunani, kwa mwanjaa kosopolelwa kwinu kwegelile.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukongo lwa ntini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24:32-35</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mal 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Bu'kapo ngaabakia lukongo lu'no, “Mulolekeye nkongo wa ntini na mikongo yi'ngi' yoti. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Pamwibona panga gatumbwile ipuka maakapi, mwatange panga nsimu wa kyuku wegelile. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Nyinyonyo, pamwagabona makowe go kagapangilwa, mwatange panga Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu' wegelile. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Kakape nimmakianga, lubelekwo lu'no lwa nambi'yambi' lwapi'tali pangalipangika ago goti. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Makowe goti gagabile padunia na panani ya dunia gapi'ta, lakini mayi'gi'yo gangu' gaapi'tali.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tupalikwa tube minyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />“Mube minyo, yakanetopelwa myoyo yinu na makowe maakau, lobya na mengo ga bwu'mi wu'no. Mana lili, lisu'ba lyo lyamwisilyanga kwa kiimuimu. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Kwa mwanjaa lyamwisilya kati kitapa kwa boti babatama mudunia yoti. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Mutame mwiso bai na mukoye lu'ba Nnu'ngu' li'nga mupate makakala go pi'ta salama mumakowe goti gagalu'a pitya no yi'ma nnu'ngi' ya Mwana wa Mundu.” <verse eid="LUK 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Muntwekati masu'ba go Yesu ayi'ganage bandu mulua lwa Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu', lakini kilo ayendage ku Kitu'mbi' sa Minjaituni no tama kwo. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Bandu boti bayendage mulua lwa Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu' kindai' putiputi li'nga kumpi'kania.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Makowe ga kummulaga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26:1-5</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mal 14:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoa 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Judas with high priest - CN01795" file="JudasWithHighPriest_CN01795.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="22:2" /> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Lisu'ba lya si'li'ku'si'li'ku' ya Makati Gangalu'la, yaikemelwa Pasika, yai kaiegelya. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Api'ndo ba dini na balimu ba salya baapalike ndi'la ya kummulaga Yesu, lakini baayogopage bandu. <verse eid="LUK 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Bai, Ibilisi ngannyingya Yuda Isikalioti, yumo ywa balu' banamasi' ku'mi na abi'li'. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Yuda aayi'i lagana na api'ndo ba dini na ali'ndi'li ba Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu' mwopanga li'nga kunsongya Yesu kasabe. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Baatinapusika nabembe ngabayi'ki'tyana nakwe kunni'pa mbanje. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yuda aayi'ki'tile, ngapala lipala lya kwakamukiya pangali tanga lipi'nga lya bandu.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwibi'ka wiso si'li'ku'si'li'ku' ya Pasika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26:17-25</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mal 14:12-21</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoa 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Bai, Lisu'ba lya Makati Gangalu'la ngaliika. Na alyo nga lisu'ba lyo sinjilwa Mwana wa Ngondolo wa Pasika. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Apo Yesu ngaatuma Petili na Yoani, ngaabakia, “Muyende mukatubi'ki wiso si'li'ku'si'li'ku' li'nga tulye Pasika.” <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Nabembe ngabannaluya, “Upala tukakubi'ki wiso kwaku'?” <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Ngaabakia, “Pi'kani! Pamwalu'a yenda kukilambo, mwakwembana na nnalu'me ywapu'twi kibi'ga sa masi'. Mwanki'ngame mpaka nnyumba ya nyumba yaayingya. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Mwammakiye mwene nsengo, ‘Mwalimu endakulaluya, kibi kwaku' sumba so li'lya Pasika nenga na banamasi' bangu'?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Naywembe aannangya sumba kiku'lu' kugolopwa sakibi'kilwe wiso, na mwenga mukabi'ke wiso ilyo.” <figure style="fig" alt="House two storeys - LB00235" file="HouseTwoStoreys_LB00235.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="22:12" /> <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Bai, ngabayenda, baakikoli kila kili'be kibi kati mwaabakiye Yesu, ngababi'ka wiso Pasika.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilyo pamesa ya Bwana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26:26-30</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mal 14:22-26</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Kol 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Saa payikite, Yesu ngatama lya na atumilwe bake. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Ngaabakia, “Niteminyikiya muno lya Pasika yi'no pamope na mwe, ku'no kaiegelya saa yo teselwa kwangu'. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Kwa mwanjaa nimmakianga panga nailyali kai' mpaka palu' panailya yi'lu' yaitimile pawaika Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu'.” <verse eid="LUK 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Bu'kapo ngatola nnobo wa divai no sukulu, kabaya, “Mupokyange, munywe pamope. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Kwa mwanjaa bu'ka nambi'yambi' nimmakianga, nainywali kai' divai ya njabibu mpaka pawalu'a isa Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu'.” <verse eid="LUK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Bu'kapo ngatola likati, ngasukulu, ngalimetwana na kwapeya kabaya, “Yi'no nga yi'ga yangu' yaipiyilwa kwa kitumbu sinu. Mwapange nyo kwa kuniku'mbu'kya.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Ngapanga nyinyonyo na nnobo wa divai bu'ka pakilyo, kabaya, “Kikombe si'no nga lilagano lyayambi' lya myai yangu' yaiyitanika kwa kitumbu sinu. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Lakini, mulolange! Yu'lu' ywanisongya ai pamope nanenga pano pamesa. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Kakape Mwana wa Mundu ayenda bulagilwa kati mwabini Nnu'ngu', lakini akibona yu'lu' ywansongya.” <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Apo ngabatumbwa laluyana bene na bene nyai kati yabe ywalu'a panga likowe lyo.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyai nku'lu' pakati yitu!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Kwapitike ntau kwa abo banamasi' panga nyai ywaganiyilwa baa nku'lu' kulikoni bi'ngi'. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesu ngaabakia, “Akulungwa ba bandu bangali Ayahudi batawala bandu babe kwa makakala, nabembe bakemelwa ayi'mi'li'ki'yi ba bandu. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Lakini kaneibe nyo kwinu, ila yu'lu' ywabile nku'lu' kwinu apalikwa abe nsene wa boti, na ywabile kolongosi apalikwa abe kati ntumisi. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Tubaye nku'lu' ngaywaku', yu'lu' ywatama pamesa no lya, au yu'lu' ywatumikia? Ngamwembe panga yu'lu' ywatama pamesa no lya! Lakini ata nyo nenga nibi pano pakati yinu kati nantumisi. <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Mwenga ngamwabile nanenga nsimu woti wa mapayilwo gangu', <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />kati Tati' bangu' mwabangamukiye ukulungwa, nanenga ninkamukiyanga mwenga ukulungwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />Mwalya no nywa pamesa yangu' muukulungwa wangu' no tama muiti'gu' ya kikulungwa kuisenwa ngolo ku'mi na ibi'li' ya Isilaili.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alondwa panga Petili alu'a kunkana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26:31-35</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mal 14:27-31</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoa 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />“Simoni, Simoni! Pi'kania wi'ti'! Ibilisi ayi'ki'tilwe na Nnu'ngu' kumpeeta mwenga kati mundu mwapeeta ngano. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Lakini nenga nitikulu'bya kwa Nnu'ngu' li'nga imani yako yakanepu'ngwa. Nawenga pawalu'a niki'li'bu'kya, wasenge akinaalongobo.” <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Petili ngannyangwa, “Bwana, niyi'ki'tile yenda pamope nawenga muutabilwe, na ata waa.” <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesu ngannyangwa, “Nikubakia wenga wa Petili, kapala bi'ka njogolo li'no kilo walu'a ngana mala itatu panga unitangiteli.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nsimu wa atali wegelile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Bu'kapo, Yesu ngaalaluya banamasi' bake, “Nsimu panantumike pangali pu'twa mpuko wa mbanje wala utingo wala ilatu, mwapu'ngu'kilwe na kili'be sosoti?” Ngabayangwa, “Lili.” <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Naywembe ngaabakia, “Nambi'yambi', ywabile na mpuko wa mbanje aupu'twe na ywabile na utingo nyinyonyo. Na ywabile ntu'pu' lipanga, api'mi'ye nganju yake li'nga akapi'me limo. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Nimmakianga gano mayi'gi'yo ga Maandiko Mapeleteu, <char style="qt">‘Aabi'kilwe kipi'nga simo na babaalabiya.’</char> Makowe ga gaandikilwe kwangu' nenga gapalikwa gatimi.” <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Nabembe ngababaya, “Bwana, lola, pano pai na mapanga gabi'li'.” Naywembe ngabaya, “Bai gali'ngani!”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 22:38">Yesu annu'ba Nnu'ngu' kukitu'mbi' sa Minjaituni</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 22:38">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26:36-46</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mal 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus praying in gethsemane - CN01808" file="JesusPrayingInGethsemane_CN01808.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="22:38" /> <verse eid="LUK 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yesu pabu'i po kati mwayobelile ngayenda ku Kitu'mbi' sa Minjaituni, na banamasi' bake ngabanki'ngama. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Paaikite kwo ngaabakia, “Mulu'bange Nnu'ngu' mwakaneyingya mumapayilwo.” <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Bu'kapo ngaaleka no yenda kuutalu pasene ngakilikita no lu'ba Nnu'ngu', <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />“Tati', mana mupendile, munibu'ki'ye nnobo gu'. Ata nyo, ibe kati mwamupendi mwenga, kwenda kati mwanipendi nengali.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Bu'kapo, malaika bu'ka kunani ngampitya li'nga kunyongea makakala. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Paabile mulwu'ngu' luku'lu', aannu'bite Nnu'ngu' kwa makakala muno, ngalimpita lyusu kati matondwa ga myai, ngalibutuka mpaka pai'. <verse eid="LUK 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Paayomwi lu'ba Nnu'ngu', aaki'li'bu'ki banamasi' bake, na akoli bagonjike, kwa mwanjaa baabile na usuni. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Ngaabakia, “Mboni mwendagonja? Muyumukange musali, mwakane yingya mumapayilwo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aboyolwa kwa makakala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mal 14:43-50</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yoa 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Kayendelya longela, ngaliisa lipi'nga lya bandu lilongoyilwe na Yuda, yu'lu' yumo ywa banamasi' ku'mi na abi'li'. Yuda ngayenda kumpanga abali Yesu kwa kunnonia. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Yesu ngammakia, “Yuda! Unsongya Mwana wa Mundu kwa kunnonia?” <verse eid="LUK 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Banamasi' bake pabagabweni go ngababaya, “Bwana, tukoleli mapanga gitu?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Yumo kati yabe nganku'mbwa lipanga ntumisi wa Mpi'ndo Mku'lu' wa dini, ngankata likutu lyake lya kummalyo. <figure style="fig" alt="Peter cuts off Malchus' ear, Jesus stops him" file="cn01813C.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © 1996 David C. Cook" ref="22:50" /> <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Apo, Yesu ngabaya, “Kotokaa! Ili'ngani.” Ngalikunywa likutu lya mundu yu'lu', na kuntepwa.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Bu'kapo Yesu ngaabakia api'ndo ba dini, api'ndo ba ali'ndi'li ba Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu' na api'ndo babaisi kummoywa, “Mboni mwisi na mapanga na mandolonga kuniboywa kati nenga nampokonyoli? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Panaabile na mwenga kila lisu'ba mulua lwa Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu' mwaniboywili! Lakini, wu'no nga nsimu winu lelo, nsimu wa utawala wa lubi'ndu'.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 22:53">Petili ankana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 22:53">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat 26:57-58</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mal 14:53-54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yoa 18:12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:53">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Peter denies knowing Jesus - WA03920" file="PeterDeniesKnowingJesus_WA03920.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="22:53" /> <verse eid="LUK 22:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Bai, ngabammoywa na kumpeleka kasake mpi'ndo nku'lu' wa dini. Petili anki'ngime nsu'gu' kwa kuutalu. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Mwoto wabi ukunganilwe pakatikati ya luwa. Nabembe batami pamope, na Petili abi pamope nabo. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Ntumisi yumo nnwawa paamweni Petili atami kayota mwoto ngammu'nju'lya minyo, kabaya, “Mundu yu' aai pamope na Yesu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Lakini Petili ngakana no baya, “Wewenga! Nenintangiteli yu'.” <verse eid="LUK 22:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Baliya pasene, mundu ywi'ngi' ngammona Petili, ngabaya, “Nawenga wanaywembe kati yabe.” Lakini Petili ngayangwa, “Wenga, nenintangiteli!”<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Walipite lisaa limo, mundu ywi'ngi' ngakong'ondelya panga “Ayu' naywembe mwenekaya wa ku Galilaya.” <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Petili ngabaya, “Wenga we, ne nikitangiteli ata saukilongela!” Na popopo paabile kalongela, njogolo ngabi'ka. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Bwana Yesu ngagalambuka na kummu'nju'lya minyo Petili, naywembe Petili ngaku'mbu'kya galu' gaabakiyilwe na Bwana Yesu, “Li'no kapala bi'ka njogolo walu'a nikana mala itatu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Apo ngapitya panja, no li'la munomuno.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu endasalangilwa no ku'mbu'lwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mat 26:67-68</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mal 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Balu' bandu babanni'ndi'lage Yesu, batekunku'mbwa na kunsalanga. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Bantabike kitambala kuminyo, kabannaluya, “Akuku'mbwi nyai? Ebu londwa, tulole!” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Ngabampikia makowe gambone ga kumpwi'wa.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nnu'ngi' ya Balasa Liku'lu'</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26:59-66</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mal 14:55-64</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yoa 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Pakusile, kitamo sa api'ndo ba bandu saatipangilwa na amo bakwembine api'ndo ba dini na balimu ba salya. Yesu ngaletelwa nnu'ngi' ya Balasa Liku'lu' lya Ayahudi. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Nabembe ngabammakia, “Tubakia wenga nga wa Kilisitu ywabayilwe?” Yesu ngaabakia, “Ata mana nimmakiangite mwaniu'bi'lyali, <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />na ata mana ninnaluyangite liswali, mwaniyangwali. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Lakini bu'ka nambi'yambi', Mwana wa Mundu alu'a tama kummalyo ga Nnu'ngu' mwene makakala.” <verse eid="LUK 22:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Apo boti ngababaya, “Elo, baya wenga nga wa Mwana wa Nnu'ngu'?” Naywembe ngabaya, “Mubaya panga nenga nga naywembe.” <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Nabembe ngababaya, “Buli, balo tukapala usaili wi'ngi'? Twabene tunnyu'wine kalongela munkano wake mwene.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Yesu apelekelwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mal 15:1-5</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoa 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Bu'kapo, boti ngabayi'ma kumpeleka Yesu nnu'ngi' ya Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Ngabatumbwa kunsitakya kababaya, “Mundu yu' tunkoli kalemaya bandu bitu, kakana li'pa koli kwa Kaisali na kwikema ati' ywembe nga Kilisitu, Nkulungwa.” <verse eid="LUK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Pilato ngannaluya Yesu, “Wenga nga wankulungwa wa Ayahudi?” Yesu ngannyangwa, “Wenga ngawaubaya.” <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pilato ngaabakia api'ndo ba dini na lipi'nga lya bandu, “Nikibonali kitumbu sosoti sa kunsenwa ayu' mundu.” <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Lakini bembe ngabakong'ondelya kababaya, “Asopa bandu kwa mayi'gano gake munni'ma woti wa ku Yudea, aatumbuli ku Galilaya, na nambi'yambi' ai pano.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu apelekelwa kwa Helode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Pilato pagayu'wine go, ngalaluya, “Mundu yu' nga mwenekaya wa ku Galilaya?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Paatangite panga Yesu aai muutawala wa Helode, ngampeleka kwa Helode, ywabile ku Yelusalemu nsimu gu'lu'. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Helode aatipulaika muno paamweni Yesu. Aagayu'wine makowe gake, ila endelolela li'nga ammone kwa minyo gake. Kai', au'bi'lyage kummona Yesu kapanga mangelongelo. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Bai, ngannaluya makowe ganambone kwo kondeya, lakini Yesu ayangwili. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Api'ndo ba dini na balimu ba salya, baapitike nnu'ngi', na kunsitakya Yesu kwa makakala. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Bai, Helode pamope na asikali bake, ngabamwisia Yesu na kumpangya nsalango. Bu'kapo, ngabang'walika ngu'bo ya kikulungwa, na kunki'li'bu'ya kwa Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Helode na Pilato babaabile andumu, lakini bu'ka lisu'ba lyo baabile mambwiga.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 23:12">Yesu asenulwa bulagilwa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 23:12">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27:15-26</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mal 15:6-15</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yoa 18:39-19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:12">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Pilate before crowd - WA03922" file="PilateBeforeCrowd_WA03922.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="23:12" /> <verse eid="LUK 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Bai, Pilato ngakemya kitamo sa api'ndo ba dini, alongosi na bandu, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />ngaabakia, “Munnetike kasangu' ayu' mundu kamubaya panga aatindigana bandu. Nambi'yambi' pi'kaniange! Panilokikiye likowe lyo nnu'ngi' yinu, nimwenili na lyakau lyolyoti lyalilandana na masitakyo ginu. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Wala nenga bai lili, ata Helode alibwenili lyakau lyolyoti, na nyo nganki'li'bwiye kasangu'. Ibonekana mpu'la bai panga mundu yu' apangiteli sosoti sakumpangia asenulwe kiwo. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Kwa nyo, nilu'a amulisa ammeselwe mikwasu, bu'kapo nalu'a kunnekekea.” <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />(Kila lisu'ba lya si'li'ku'si'li'ku' ya Pasika, Pilato yapalikwe kwayu'gu'lya bandu ntabilwe yumo.)<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Lakini boti ngabapanga ndu'ti pamope, “Ummu'ye mundu yu' na utuyu'gu'li Balaba!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Balaba aabi'kilwe muutabilwe kwa mwanjaa aayu'maniye bandu panni'ma, kai' aatibulaga.<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pilato apalike kunnekekea Yesu, kwa nyo ngalongela nabo kai'. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Lakini bembe ngabapanga ndu'ti, “Ummambe munsalaba, ummambe munsalaba!” <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Pilato ngaabakia pampanda patatu, “Apangite lyakau lyaku'? Nilibonali lyakau lyakumpanga abulagilwe, kwa nyo nilu'a kummesa mikwasu, bu'kapo ninnekekeye.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Lakini bembe ngabayongekea panga ndu'ti kwa makakala munomuno, panga Yesu lasima abambilwe munsalaba. Kuundi'la, malobe gabe ngagayu'wanika. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Bai, Pilato ngabaya panga mwabapala bembe ipangilwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Annyu'gu'li yu'lu' ywabampalage, ywabile ntabilwe kwa mwanjaa ayu'maniye bandu panni'ma no bulaga na kwapeya Yesu bampangi mwabapendile.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 23:25">Yesu endabambilwa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 23:25">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27:32-44</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mal 15:21-32</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoa 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:25">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Simon of Cyrene carrying cross - WA03924" file="SimonOfCyreneCarryingCross_WA03924.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="23:25" /> <verse eid="LUK 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Pabaabile kabampeleka, bakwembine na mundu ywakemelwage Simoni wa Kilene, kabu'ka kunng'unda. Bai, ngabammoywa na kuntwi'ka gu'lu' nsalaba aupu'twe nsu'gu' ya Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Lipi'nga lya bandu lyatekunki'ngama, nkati yabe baabile alwawa babaabile kabalombola na kunni'lya. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesu ngaagalambukya kabaya, “Mwenga mwaakinamau' ba ku Yelusalemu! Kanemundi'li nenga, ila mwili'li mwabene na bana binu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Kwa mwanjaa masu'ba gendaisa pabaalu'a baya, ‘Nantali balu' atonga, kingabeleka wala kingayongea bana!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Nsimu wo, bandu ngabatumbwa kuibakia itu'mbi' na itundulia, ‘Mututu'mbu'ki na mutuwi'ki'li!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Kwa mwanjaa manaitei bandu baupangya nkongo mmi'gi' kati nyo, yapanga buli kwa nkongo nnyu'mu'?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:31">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Three Crosses - WA03926" file="ThreeCrosses_WA03926.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="23:31" /> <verse eid="LUK 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Baatweti kai' bandu bi'ngi' abi'li' babaalabiye, babulagilwe pamope nakwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Pabaikite pandu papakemelwa “Lipakala lya Ntwe,” ngabammamba Yesu munsalaba papipi na balu' abi'li' babaalabiye, yumo lwamalyo wa Yesu na ywi'ngi' lwanki'ya lwake. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Yesu ngabaya, “Tati', mwasami, kwa mwanjaa batangiteli lyabalipanga.” Bu'kapo, ngababagana magu'bo gake kwo ng'andya mpumbe. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Bandu baabile wi'ma kabalola. Nabembe alongosi ngabansalanga kababaya, “Aakosopoli bi'ngi', nambi'yambi' aikosopoli mwene, manaitei ywembe nga Kilisitu, nsaulwa na Nnu'ngu'.” <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Nabembe asikali baatikunsalanga kai', baatikunnyendelya na kumpeya kasiki, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />kababaya, “Manaitei kakape wenga nga wankulungwa wa Ayahudi, wikosopoli wamwene.”<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Kai' maandiko gano gaabi'kilwe panani ya nsalaba wake, “Ayu' nga Nkulungwa wa Ayahudi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Yumo ywa balu' babaalabiye bababambilwe munsalaba, aatikumpwi'wa kabaya, “Nga, kakape buli panga wenga nga wa Kilisitu ywabayilwe? Bai, wikosopoli wamwene, kai' utukosopoli na twenga.” <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Lakini yu'lu' ywaalabiye ywi'ngi' ngankalipya nnyine kabaya, “Wenga unnyogopali Nnu'ngu' ata pasene? Wenga utesenulwa nyinyonyo. <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Wenga nanenga ngaipalikwa pata mali'po gano kwa galu' gatupangite. Lakini mundu yu' apangiteli lyakau lyolyoti.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Bu'kapo ngabaya, “Mwa Yesu! Mwangu'mbu'ki nsimu pamwayingya mu Ukulungwa winu.” <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu ngannyangwa, “Nikubakia kakape, li'no waba pamope nanenga kumbepo ya Nnu'ngu'.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awaa munsalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27:45-56</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mal 15:33-41</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoa 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44-45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44-45" />Payabile kayika saa sita muntwekati, lisu'ba lyasomwi mulika, lubi'ndu' lwawi'ki'li munni'ma woti mpaka saa tisa. Na panjia yaitemwana Papeleteu muno mu Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu' yapopwanike ande ibi'li'. <verse eid="LUK 23:44-45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yesu ngali'la kwa lilobe liku'lu', “Tati', <char style="qt">mumoko ginu niibi'ka loo yangu'!</char>” Payomwi longela go, ngayomoka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:46">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Centurion and Jesus on Cross - CN01844" file="Centurion&amp;JesusOnCross_CN01844.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="23:46" /> <verse eid="LUK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Apo, yu'lu' asikali nku'lu' paagabweni gagapitike, annumbite Nnu'ngu' no baya, “Kakape ayu' aai mundu wa aki.” <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Bandu boti babaakongolekine po pala bagabone gagapangika, pabagabweni malau gagapitike, baki'li'bu'ki kaya ku'no kabaisenwa no usunika pamwoyo wabe. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Mambwiga bake boti na balu' alwawa babalongwaniye nakwe bu'ka ku Galilaya, baayi'mi kuutalu lola likowe lyo.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 23:49">Yesu endasikilwa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 23:49">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mal 15:42-47</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoa 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:49">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus Body Carried toTomb - Dunham 1989" file="Jesus'BodyCarriedToTomb(Burial)_DN00494.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Darwin Dunham © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="23:49" /> <verse eid="LUK 23:49" /><verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51" />Kwai na mundu yumo lina lyake Yusupu, mwenekaya wa Alimataya mukilambo simo sa ku Yudea. Aai mundu nnogau na mwene aki. Aabile kalolela isa kwa Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu'. Pamope no panga aabile yumo ywa Kitamo Kiku'lu' sa Ayahudi, aabile anayi'ki'tyanali nabo mukyendo sabe. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Bai, ywembe ngayenda kwa Pilato, lu'ba ntwi wa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Bu'kapo ngauluya ntwi bu'ka munsalaba, ngaingilya sanda ngabi'ka mulisiko lyalii'mbilwe mumpi'mbi', na lyabile lyangakolelwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Lisu'ba lyo lyabile Ijumaa kitamwiyo, kai' lyaai lisu'ba lyo bi'ka wiso Sabato ya Ayahudi.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Balu' alwawa babaalongwaniye na Yesu bu'ka ku Galilaya banki'ngime Yusupu, ngabalibona li'lu' lipango na ntwi wa Yesu mwaubi'kilwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Bu'kapo, baaki'li'bu'ki kaya no bi'ka wiso mauta ganannungya ga kuupakaya ntwi wa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Lisu'ba lya Sabato ya Ayahudi baatipu'mu'lya kati mwayaamuliswe na salya.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Yu'ka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat 28:1-10</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mal 16:1-8</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoa 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Jumapili, kindai' bulabula, balu' alwawa baayi'i kulisiko, baapu'twi galu' mauta ganannungya gagabi'kilwe wiso. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" /><figure style="fig" alt="The stone rolled away from the tomb" file="NT-16 Tomb.tif" size="col" ref="24:2">Liwe liimbiyilwe kuutalu na lisiko</figure>Baalikoli li'lu' liwe liimbiliyilwe kuutalu na lisiko, <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />pabaayingi nkati, baaubwenili ntwi wa Bwana Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Pabaabile kabasangala kwa likowe lyo, imukya bandu abi'li' babaaweti ngu'bo yene mmelemetya muno bayi'mi papipi nabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Balu' alwawa baatiyogopa muno, ngabayinamika ibu'ngi' yabe. Apo balu' bandu ngabaabakia, “Kwa ki'li' mumpala ywabile nkoti mumapango ga awi'li? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Abileli pano, ayu'kite. Muku'mbu'ki gammakiye paabile ku'lu' ku Galilaya, <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />‘Ipalikwa Mwana wa Mundu apiyilwe kwa bandu baakau, nabembe balu'a kummamba munsalaba na lisu'ba lyenetatu alu'a yu'ka.’”<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Apo balu' alwawa ngabaku'mbu'kya mayi'gi'yo gake, <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />ngabaki'li'bu'ka bu'ka kulipango, na kwabakia balu' banamasi' ku'mi na yumo na apwasi bi'ngi'. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Babaapiyike makowe go kwa atumilwe baai, Malia Makatalena, Yoana na Malia mau' ba Yakobi, pamope na alwawa bi'ngi' babalongwaniye nabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Banamasi' pabagayu'wine makowe go baagabweni kati gangali ntwe kwa nyo bau'bi'li lili. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Lakini Petili aabutwike lubi'lo mpaka kulipango, palitike no lingulya nkati, ngaibona sanda bai. Ngabuyangana kaya ku'no kasangala kwa galu' gagapitike.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 24:12">Mwanja wo yenda ku Emau</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 24:12">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mal 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:12">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Disciples &amp; Jesus on emmaus road - GT00089" file="Disciples&amp;JesusOnEmmausRoad_Luke24.13-27_GT00089.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Gordon Thompson © Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc., 2012." ref="24:12" /> <verse eid="LUK 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Lisu'ba lyolyolyo, apwasi abi'li' ba Yesu baai kabayenda kukilambo simo sakikemelwa Emau, ulipau wake kilometa ku'mi na yimo bu'ka ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Baabile kabalongelya makowe go gagapitike. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Pabaabile kabalongela no laluyana, Yesu mwene ngapitya, ngalongwana nabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Baamweni, lakini Nnu'ngu' aatabite malango ga kunkwipwa.<verse eid="LUK 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Ngaalaluya, “Mulongela ki'li' ku'no kannyenda?” Nabembe baayi'mi liki, no uta ngi'njaki'nja ya kuminyo yabe kwo usunika. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Yumo, ywakemelwa Kileopa, ngannyangwa, “Wenga ngawang'eni kisako ku Yelusalemu wokotoka tanga gagapitike kwo masu'ba gano?” <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Naywembe ngaalaluya, “Makowe gaku'?” Bembe ngabannyangwa, “Makowe gagampatike Yesu wa ku Nasaleti. Ywembe aai nnondoli wa Nnu'ngu' nku'lu' mwene makakala go panga makowe no yi'gana nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu' na bandu boti. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Api'ndo ba dini na atawala bitu baampiyike asenulwe waa, ngabammamba munsalaba. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Lakini twenga tuu'bi'lyage panga ywembe nga ywalu'a kwikombwa Isilaili. Bu'ka pagapangilwe makowe ga goti, li'no lisu'ba lyenetatu. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Kai', alwawa bitu bi'ngi' baatikutung'ang'amuya. Baayi'i kulisiko kindai' bulabula. <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />Baaikolili yi'ga yake. Baaki'li'bwike kababaya panga bapitilwe na malaika ywaabakiye panga ai nkoti. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Aitu bi'ngi' baayi'i kulisiko lingulya wiso galu' gabalongei balu' alwawa, gaai nyinyonyo ila ywembe baamwenili.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Kuundi'la Yesu ngaabakia, “Mboni mwalogeloge nyo, na myoyo yinu ndopau kwo kotoka kugau'bi'lya goti gagalongelilwe na alondoli ba Nnu'ngu'? <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Buli, yali'nganili Kilisitu ateselwe, li'nga ayingi muutukupu wake?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Ngaawanikia mayi'gi'yo gake goti ga mu Maandiko Mapeleteu tumbulya Musa mpaka alondoli ba Nnu'ngu' boti.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Pabaegeli palu' pakilambo sabayendage, Yesu ngapanga kati ayendelya na mwanja. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Lakini bembe ngabannu'ba kababaya, “Utame pamope na twe, kwendapilya na kilo kiegelile.” Bai, ngaika palu' pakilambo, no yingya nnyumba tama pamope nabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Waatami lya pamope nabo, ngatola likati kulilu'bya na kulimetwana, na kwabagana. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Popopo minyo gabe gaatibanjwa, ngabankwipwa, lakini ywembe baimuki abu'i na baamwenili kai'. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Bai, ngababakiana, “Panga myoyo yitu yabileli kaiyaka nkati yitu paabile katuawanikia Maandiko Mapeleteu mu'lu' mundi'la?” <verse eid="LUK 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Ngababu'ka saa yi'yi'lu'yi'lu', ki'li'bu'ka ku Yelusalemu, ngabaakolya balu' banamasi' ku'mi na yumo na balu' apwasi bi'ngi' bababile pamope nabo bakongolekine <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />kababaya, “Kakape Bwana ayu'kite, ampiti Simoni.” <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Bai, balu' apwasi abi'li' ngabaayaulya ayabe galu' gabagapatike mundi'la, na mwabapatike kuntanga kwa kulimetwa likati.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 24:35">Yesu apitya banamasi' bake</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 24:35">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28:16-20</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mal 16:14-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoa 20:19-23</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Mak 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:35">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus with 12 disciples wounds in hands - WA03932" file="JesusWith12Disciples(WoundsInHands)_WA03932.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="24:35" /> <verse eid="LUK 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Pabaabile kabaabakia go, baimuki mwene Yesu aayi'mi pakatikati yabe, ngaabakia, “Amani ibe namwenga.” <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Baating'ang'amuka no yogopa kwa mwanjaa baganiage balibweni lyoka. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Lakini ywembe ngaabakia, “Kwa mwanjaa ki'li' muyogobala? Mboni mubaa na kyukala mumyoyo yinu? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Mulolekeye moko na magu'lu' gangu', nga nenga namwene. Munipapaye munibone kwa mwanjaa lyoka ntu'pu' yi'ga wala yupaa kati mwamunibona.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Paayomwi longela go, ngaalaya moko na magu'lu' gake. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Pabaabile balo banau'bi'lyali kwa mwanjaa ya pulaa yabe na kabasangala, ngaalaluya, “Mubile naso kilyo sosoti pano?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Ngabampeya kitomwa sa omba mmanika. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Ngakitola no lya, boti kabammona. <verse eid="LUK 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Bu'kapo ngaabakia, “Yi'no nga ikomekeyo ya makowe ganammakiye panaabile pamope namwenga. Panga yaapalikwe yomwa goti gagaandikilwe kwa kitumbu sa nenga musalya ya Musa, muitabu ya alondoli ba Nnu'ngu' na mukitabu sa Zabuli.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Bu'kapo, ngaayu'gu'lya malango gabe li'nga bapate kugatanga Maandiko Mapeleteu. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Ngaabakia, “Ngamo mwaiandikilwe, panga Kilisitu aateselwa na lisu'ba lyenetatu aayu'ka bu'ka kuuwi'li, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />kwa nyo ngaipalikwa panga, kwa lina lyake, dunia yoti tumbulya ku Yelusalemu, bandu ba dunia yoti baalilwe panga banki'li'bu'ki Nnu'ngu' basamilwe masambi. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Mwenga nga mwakong'ondeli ba makowe go. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Nenga namwene nalu'a kumpelekyanga yu'lu' ywabayilwe tumilwa na Tati'. Lakini muli'nde ku'no kukilambo mpaka pamwapeyelwa galu' makakala gagabu'ka kunani.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 24:49">Yesu au'bu'ka kunani</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 24:49">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mal 16:19-20</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Mak 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:49">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Ascension - WA03935" file="Ascension_WA03935.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="24:49" /> <verse eid="LUK 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Bu'kapo, ngaalongoya panja ya ku Yelusalemu mpaka ku Betania, ngatu'ndu'bi'ya moko gake kunani ngaayalya. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Paabile kaayalya, ngaaleka, no pu'tu'lwa kunani. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Bembe ngabankilikitya, bu'kapo ngabaki'li'bu'ka ku Yelusalemu babile na pulaa ngu'lu'. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Baatami masu'ba goti mulua lwa Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu' kabannumba Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>